(37, 'bmw-c-650-gt-2015', 'SCOOTER', 'The power of the harmoniously tuned engine with 60 bhp (44 kW) is especially advantageous over longer distances. Here and in many other situations you will appreciate the easy handling and exceptional comfort of the C 650 GT. In the city the C 650 GT gives you a whole new sense of freedom and independence', 'Steel tube construction with aluminium die cast unit', 'Upside-down fork 40 mm (curso 115 mm (4.5 inches))', 'Single-sided swing arm (curso 115 mm (4.5 inches))', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating discs. Two-piston calipers Disco de 270 mm (10.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 270 mm (10.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR15', '160/60-ZR15', 'Twin, four-stroke', 647, 2, 4, 60, 7500, 66, 6000, '11.6:1', 79, 66, 'Liquid', 'Injection', 'Automatic', NULL, 'Chain', 175, 4.4, 'Euro 4', 2218, 822, 1411, 1591, 795, NULL, 261, 241, 16),
