(40, 'bmw-f-700-gs-2018', 'ADVENTURE', 'The new knee cover with its galvanised surface significantly increases the visual appeal of the F 700 GS. The high-quality design of the ignition lock cover and tank cover also catch the eye. And of course, details such as the new model inscription and the new dual-colour seat cover create a look that stands out', 'Tubular steel space frame with load-bearing engine', 'Telescopic fork, 41 mm (curso 170 mm (6.7 inches))', 'Cast aluminium dual swing arm, central spring strut, spring pre-load hydraulically adjustable (continuously variable) at handwheel, rebound damping adjustable', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Two-piston calipers Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '110/80-19', '140/80-17', 'Twin, four-stroke', 798, 2, 4, 75, 7300, 77, 5300, '12:1', 82, 75.6, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electroinc intake pipe injection, digital engine management (BMS-K+)', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 192, 4.3, NULL, 2280, 880, 1215, 1562, 820, NULL, 212, NULL, 16),
(41, 'bmw-f-750-gs-premium-2020', 'ADVENTURE', 'Feel the strong character of the engine and enjoy the ease of handling of the F 750 GS. While you´re off discovering the world, you´ll have the bike safely under control with the standard Automatic Stability Control (ASC) and ABS. With the optional addition of Connectivity, the 6.5 inch TFT display boasts many features including navigation and smartphone connectivity', 'Bridge-type frame, steel shell construction', 'Telescopic fork, 41 mm (curso 151 mm (5.9 inches))', 'Cast aluminium dual swing arm, central spring strut, spring pre-load hydraulically adjustable (continuously variable) at handwheel, rebound damping adjustable', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Two-piston calipers Disco de 305 mm (12.0 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '110/80-19', '150/70-17', 'Twin, four-stroke', 853, 2, 4, 77, 7500, 83, 6000, '12.7:1', 84, 77, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electroinc intake pipe injection, digital engine management (BMS-K+)', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 190, 4.1, 'Euro 4', 2255, 922, 1225, 1559, 815, NULL, 224, NULL, 15),
