(54, 'bmw-f-800-gs-adventure-2018', 'ADVENTURE', 'No matter how far the journey takes you - and no matter what terrain you cover: With the BMW F 800 GS Adventure you´ll survive every adventure', 'Tubular steel space frame, load-bearing engine', 'Upside-down fork (curso 230 mm (9.1 inches))', 'Aluminium double sided swing-arm at the rear (curso 215 mm (8.5 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '90/90-21', '150/70-17', 'Twin, four-stroke', 798, 2, 4, 85, 7500, 83, 5750, '12:1', 82, 75.6, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection, digital engine management (BMS-K+)', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 193, 4.3, NULL, 2305, 925, 1450, 1573, 890, NULL, 232, 192, 24),
(55, 'bmw-f-800-gs-adventure-2017', 'ADVENTURE', 'The F 800 GS Adventure is every inch the globetrotter – from the high windscreen right through to the combined tank bracket and case holder. In spite of its striking side trim and the larger fuel tank, the characteristic flyline of the F 800 GS Adventure reveals its kinship at first sight', 'Tubular steel space frame, load-bearing engine', 'Upside-down fork (curso 230 mm (9.1 inches))', 'Aluminium double sided swing-arm at the rear (curso 215 mm (8.5 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '90/90-21', '150/70-17', 'Twin, four-stroke', 798, 2, 4, 85, 7500, 83, 5750, '12:1', 82, 75.6, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection, digital engine management (BMS-K+)', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 193, NULL, NULL, 2305, 925, 1450, 1573, 890, NULL, 232, 191, 24),
(56, 'bmw-f-800-gs-adventure-2016', 'ADVENTURE', 'Be it sand dunes, mountain passes or river crossings, the F 800 GS Adventure can master any task it may be faced with in faraway places. Its core is the torsion-resistant tubular steel frame with spring travel of 9.1 inches at the front and 8.5 inches at the rear. The rider is supported with the optional “Enduro mode” which optimizes ASC traction control and ABS on loose surfaces. ABS is of course a standard feature', 'Tubular steel space frame with load-bearing engine', 'Upside-down fork, stanchion diameter 43 mm (curso 230 mm (9.1 inches))', 'Wrought aluminium swing-arm, directly hinged WAD central spring strut, hydraulically adjustable suspension height, adjustable rebound damping (curso 215 mm (8.5', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Two-piston calipers Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '90/90-21', '150/70-V17', 'Twin, four-stroke', 798, 2, 4, 85, 7500, 83, 5750, '12:1', 82, 75.6, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic fuel injection,BMS-K+ electronic engine management', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 193, 4.3, 'Euro 3', 2305, 925, 1450, 1578, 890, NULL, 229, 191, 24),
(57, 'bmw-f-800-gs-adventure-2014', 'ADVENTURE', 'Everything about this bike is Unstoppable. Its state-of-the-art twin-cylinder engine delivers awesome off-road power and incredible responsiveness. Its weight-optimized construction makes it unbelievably agile and easy to handle. And its outstanding c­hassis performs superbly both on and off-road', 'Tubular steel space frame with load-bearing engine', 'Upside-down fork, stanchion diameter 43 mm (curso 230 mm (9.1 inches))', 'Wrought aluminium swing-arm, directly hinged WAD central spring strut, hydraulically adjustable suspension height, adjustable rebound damping (curso 215 mm (8.5', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Two-piston calipers Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '90/90-21', '150/70-V17', 'Twin, four-stroke', 798, 2, 4, 85, 7500, 83, 5750, '12:1', 82, 75.6, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic fuel injection,BMS-K+ electronic engine management', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 193, 4.3, 'Euro 3', 2305, 925, 1450, 1578, 890, NULL, 229, 191, 24),
(58, 'bmw-f-800-gs-adventure-2015', 'ADVENTURE', 'No matter where you travel, no matter what the terrain – with the F 800 GS you can master any adventure. This travel enduro has been created for true globetrotters for whom no destination is too remote and who want to conquer the world off the beaten track. The F 800 GS Adventure: the reliable and robust companion for unbounded adventure', 'Tubular steel space frame with load-bearing engine', 'Upside-down fork, stanchion diameter 43 mm (curso 230 mm (9.1 inches))', 'Wrought aluminium swing-arm, directly hinged WAD central spring strut, hydraulically adjustable suspension height, adjustable rebound damping (curso 215 mm (8.5', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Two-piston calipers Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '90/90-21', '150/70-V17', 'Twin, four-stroke', 798, 2, 4, 85, 7500, 83, 5750, '12:1', 82, 75.6, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic fuel injection,BMS-K+ electronic engine management', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 193, 4.3, 'Euro 3', 2305, 925, 1450, 1578, 890, NULL, 229, 191, 24),
(59, 'bmw-f-800-gs-triple-black-trophy-2013', 'ADVENTURE', 'The front section of the body in particular has undergone significant transformation: the new fuel tank trim, intake snorkel, upper mudguard and a new windshield give the bike that extra dash of dynamic performance, reflecting the off-road side of the F 800 GS', 'Tubular steel space frame, load-bearing engine', 'Upside-down telescopic fork, 45 mm (curso 231 mm (9.1 inches))', 'Cast aluminium dual swing arm, WAD strut (travel related damping), spring pre-load hydraulically adjustable (continuously variable) at handwheel, rebound', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Two-piston calipers Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '90/90-21', '150/70-17', 'Twin, four-stroke', 798, 2, 2, 84.5, 7500, 61, 5750, '12:1', 82, 75.6, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electroinc intake pipe injection, digital engine management (BMS-K+)', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 241, 3.79, 'Euro 3', 2319, 945, 1351, 1577, 879, NULL, 214.1, 191, 15.9),
(60, 'bmw-f-800-gs-triple-black-trophy-2018', 'ADVENTURE', 'The motorcycle is continuing its long success story, and impresses with its enormous versatility for both on and off-road journeys. Simply an incredibly versatile enduro with a sports pedigree', 'Tubular steel space frame, load-bearing engine', 'Upside-down telescopic fork, 43 mm (curso 230 mm (9.1 inches))', 'Cast aluminium dual swing arm, WAD strut (travel related damping), spring pre-load hydraulically adjustable (continuously variable) at handwheel, rebound', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Two-piston calipers Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '90/90-21', '150/70-17', 'Twin, four-stroke', 798, 2, 4, 85, 7500, 83, 5750, '12:1', 82, 75.6, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electroinc intake pipe injection, digital engine management (BMS-K+)', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, 4.3, 'Euro 4', 2300, 945, 1350, 1573, 880, NULL, 217, NULL, 16),
(61, 'bmw-f-800-r-2016', 'NAKED', 'The F 800 R is just the right motorbike if you simply want to get on and have fun - and that is just what it looks like. The precise lines and minimalist trim elements give it a sense of light-footed agility, while the new upside-down fork is suggestive of dynamic forward thrust even when stationary. The symmetrical headlamp gives the F 800 R a new distinctive look', 'Bridge-type aluminium frame, load-bearing engine', 'Telescopic fork, 43 mm (curso 125 mm (4.9 inches))', 'Cast aluminium double sided swing arm, central spring strut, spring pre-load hydraulically adjustable (continuously variable) at handwheel, rebound damping', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '180/55-ZR17', 'Twin, four-stroke', 798, 2, 4, 90, 8000, 86, 6000, '12:1', 82, 75.6, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection / digital engine management (BMS-KP)', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 218, 3.6, 'Euro 3', 2145, 860, 1235, 1520, 790, NULL, 202, 177, 15),
(62, 'bmw-f-800-r-2013', 'NAKED', 'The new 2013 F 800 R is definitely the hottest naked bike around. Three words best describe the F 800 R: light, agile and fast. This cool and sexy roadster offers the perfect combination of highway riding with a high degree of maneuverability for everyday urban use', 'Bridge-type frame, cast aluminum, load-bearing engine', 'Telescopic fork, 43 mm (curso 124 mm (4.9 inches))', 'Cast aluminum dual swing arm, central spring strut, spring pre-load hydraulically adjustable (continuously variable) at handwheel, rebound damping adjustable', 'Double disc. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers. ABS Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper. ABS Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-17', '180/55-17', 'Twin, four-stroke', 798, 2, 4, 87, 8000, 63, 6000, '12:1', 82, 75.6, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection / digital engine management (BMS-K+)', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 201, 3.62, 'Euro 3', 2144, 904, 1161, 1519, 800, NULL, 199.1, 176.9, 15.9),
(63, 'bmw-f-800-r-2017', 'NAKED', 'The high-performance cockpit features a new dial design and the clear multifunction display now gives you even more information. Another highlight is the new rear silencer, which not only looks as good as it sounds, it also meets the EU-4 standard', 'Bridge-type frame, cast aluminium', 'Upside-down fork (curso 125 mm (4.9 inches))', 'Cast aluminium dual swing arm, central spring strut, spring pre-load hydraulically adjustable (continuously variable) at handwheel, rebound damping adjustable', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-17', '180/55-17', 'Twin, four-stroke', 798, 2, 4, 90, 8000, 86, 5800, '12:1', 82, 75.6, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 218, NULL, NULL, 2145, 860, 1235, 1520, 790, NULL, 203, 177, 15),
(64, 'bmw-f-800-r-2015', 'NAKED', 'The F 800 R is a firmly established player in the BMW Motorrad roadster segment. It combines agility, everyday practicality and dynamic riding fun in an integrated sporty package. And the revised F 800 R takes the whole thing a step further', 'Bridge-type aluminium frame, load-bearing engine', 'Telescopic fork, 43 mm (curso 125 mm (4.9 inches))', 'Cast aluminium double sided swing arm, central spring strut, spring pre-load hydraulically adjustable (continuously variable) at handwheel, rebound damping', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '180/55-ZR17', 'Twin, four-stroke', 798, 2, 4, 90, 8000, 86, 6000, '12:1', 82, 75.6, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection / digital engine management (BMS-KP)', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 218, 3.6, 'Euro 3', 2145, 860, 1235, 1520, 790, NULL, 202, 177, 16),
(65, 'bmw-f-800-r-2014', 'NAKED', 'The new F 800 R is radically different, and yet every inch a BMW. The state-of-the-art parallel twin engine with electronic fuel injection develops 87hp from its 798cc, not to mention a mighty 86Nm of torque. And with the deep, throaty exhaust tone, its sound is every bit as impressive as it performs', 'Bridge-type aluminium frame, load-bearing engine', 'Telescopic fork, 43 mm (curso 125 mm (4.9 inches))', 'Cast aluminium double sided swing arm, central spring strut, spring pre-load hydraulically adjustable (continuously variable) at handwheel, rebound damping', 'Double disc. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', NULL, '120/70-ZR17', '180/55-ZR17', 'Twin, four-stroke', 798, 2, 4, 87, 8000, 86, 6000, '12:1', 82, 75.6, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection / digital engine management (BMS-KP)', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 218, 3.6, 'Euro 3', 2145, 905, 1160, 1520, 800, NULL, 199, 177, 16),
