(105, 'bmw-g-310-gs-2021', 'ADVENTURE', 'The G 310 GS is the perfect companion for discovering your city, beyond its borders and off the asphalt roads. Thanks to the comfortable GS ergonomics and high-quality equipment, this bike is perfect for everyday relaxed riding to any destination', 'Tubular space', 'Upside-down telescopic fork, Ø 41mm (curso 180 mm (7.1 inches))', 'Cast aluminium dual swing arm, central spring strut, spring pre-load adjustable (curso 180 mm (7.1 inches))', 'Single disc. ABS. 4-piston fixed caliper, radially bolted Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. single-piston floating caliper Disco de 240 mm (9.4 inches)', 'ABS', '110/80-R19', '150/70-R17', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 313, 1, 4, 33.5, 9250, 28, 7500, '10.9:1', 80, 62.1, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 143, 3.3, 'Euro 5', 2075, NULL, 1230, 1420, 835, NULL, 175, 175, 11.5),
(106, 'bmw-g-310-gs-2022', 'ADVENTURE', 'Be spontaneous. Break the routine. With the BMW G 310 GS, your everyday life becomes an adventure. Thanks to the optimized engine with Ride by Wire and a slipper clutch, you can master the urban jungle and make trips into the surrounding areas', 'Tubular space', 'Inverted fork, Ø 41mm (curso 180 mm (7.1 inches))', 'Cast aluminium dual swing arm, central spring strut, spring pre-load adjustable (curso 180 mm (7.1 inches))', 'Single disc. ABS. 4-piston fixed caliper, radially bolted Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. single-piston floating caliper Disco de 240 mm (9.4 inches)', 'ABS', '110/80-R19', '150/70-R17', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 313, 1, 4, 34, 9250, 28, 7500, '10.9:1', 80, 62.1, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 142, 3.3, 'Euro 5', 2075, NULL, 1230, 1420, 833, NULL, 175, 175, 11.5),
(107, 'bmw-g-310-gs-2026', 'ADVENTURE', 'The G 310 GS stands for pure riding enjoyment – whether making daily rides around the city or trips into the surrounding areas. In the typical relaxed GS seat position, you have a perfect view of every adventure. Find out all about the technical data and extensive standard equipment here', 'Tubular space', 'Inverted fork, Ø 41mm (curso 180 mm (7.1 inches))', 'Cast aluminium dual swing arm, central spring strut, spring pre-load adjustable (curso 180 mm (7.1 inches))', 'Single disc. ABS. 4-piston fixed caliper, radially bolted Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. single-piston floating caliper Disco de 240 mm (9.4 inches)', 'ABS', '110/80-R19', '150/70-R17', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 313, 1, 4, 34, NULL, 28, NULL, '10.9:1', 80, 62.1, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 142, 3.3, 'Euro 5', 2075, 879, 1230, 1420, 833, NULL, 175, 175, 11.4),
(108, 'bmw-g-310-gs-2018', 'ADVENTURE', 'It carries you through the urban jungle, confident and carefree, and out into the surrounding countryside. Because with the G 310 GS, the adventures don´t have to be big to be unforgettable. What matters is that you experience them – every day', 'Tubular spaceframe', 'Upside down fork , 41 mm (curso 180 mm (7.1 inches))', 'Solid die-cast aluminum swingarm, directly hinged monoshock, adjustable preload (curso 180 mm (7.1 inches))', 'Single disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 240 mm (9.4 inches)', 'ABS', '110/80-19', '150/70-17', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 313, 1, 4, 34, 9500, 28, 7500, '10.6:1', 80, 62.1, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic fuel injection, BMS-E2', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 143, 3.33, 'Euro 4', 2075, 880, 1080, 1420, 835, NULL, 169.5, NULL, 11),
