(110, 'bmw-g-310-gs-2024', 'ADVENTURE', 'The clutch and brake levers can be adjusted to four levels, conveniently adapting to the reach of your hands. This means that they move up to six millimeters closer to the handlebar. And you can effortlessly keep a grip on everything', 'Tubular space', 'Inverted fork, Ø 41mm (curso 180 mm (7.1 inches))', 'Cast aluminium dual swing arm, central spring strut, spring pre-load adjustable (curso 180 mm (7.1 inches))', 'Single disc. ABS. 4-piston fixed caliper, radially bolted Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. single-piston floating caliper Disco de 240 mm (9.4 inches)', 'ABS', '110/80-R19', '150/70-R17', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 313, 1, 4, 34, NULL, 28, NULL, '10.9:1', 80, 62.1, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 142, 3.3, 'Euro 5', 2075, 879, 1230, 1420, 833, NULL, 175, 175, 11.5),
(111, 'bmw-g-310-gs-2019', 'ADVENTURE', 'Hanks to the effective combustion and the secondary air system, the G 310 GS complies with the strict Euro IV standards. At the same time, the special engine configuration ensures not only low consumption but powerful and harmonious power even in the lower rev ranges. 313 ccm and 25 kW (34 HP) at 9,500 RPM guarantee the required power and acceleration', 'Tubular spaceframe', 'Upside down fork , 41 mm (curso 180 mm (7.1 inches))', 'Solid die-cast aluminum swingarm, directly hinged monoshock, adjustable preload (curso 180 mm (7.1 inches))', 'Single disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 240 mm (9.4 inches)', 'ABS', '90/90-19', '150/70-17', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 313, 1, 4, 34, 9500, 28, 7500, '10.6:1', 80, 62.1, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic fuel injection, BMS-E2', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 143, 3.33, 'Euro 4', 2075, 880, 1230, 1420, 835, NULL, 169.5, NULL, 11),
