(113, 'bmw-g-310-gs-2025', 'ADVENTURE', 'The G 310 GS stands for pure riding enjoyment – whether making daily rides around the city or trips into the surrounding areas. In the typical relaxed GS seat position, you have a perfect view of every adventure. Find out all about the technical data and extensive standard equipment here', 'Tubular space', 'Inverted fork, Ø 41mm (curso 180 mm (7.1 inches))', 'Cast aluminium dual swing arm, central spring strut, spring pre-load adjustable (curso 180 mm (7.1 inches))', 'Single disc. ABS. 4-piston fixed caliper, radially bolted Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. single-piston floating caliper Disco de 240 mm (9.4 inches)', 'ABS', '110/80-R19', '150/70-R17', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 313, 1, 4, 34, NULL, 28, NULL, '10.9:1', 80, 62.1, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 142, 3.3, 'Euro 5', 2075, 879, 1230, 1420, 833, NULL, 175, 175, 11.4),
(114, 'bmw-g-310-r-2024', 'SPORT', 'The strength of the G 310 R is in its lightness and agility. The 313cc single-cylinder four-stroke engine not only delivers fun in the big-city, but also when you are redefining the city limits when changing corners quickly', 'Tubular space', 'Inverted telescopic fork, Ø 41mm (curso 140 mm (5.5 inches))', 'Cast aluminum dual swing arm, central spring strut, spring pre-load adjustable (curso 132 mm (5.2 inches))', 'Single disc. 4-piston fixed caliper, radially bolted. ABS Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. Single-piston floating caliper. ABS Disco de 241 mm (9.5 inches)', 'ABS', '110/70-R17', '150/60-R17', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 313, 1, 4, 34, NULL, 28, NULL, '10.9:1', 80, 62.1, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 143, 3.33, 'Euro 4', 2005, 849, 1080, 1380, 785, NULL, 158, 158, 11),
(115, 'bmw-g-310-r-2023', 'SPORT', 'Experience the maneuverability, easy handling, and sportiness of the G 310 R and use it to push to new boundaries every single day', 'Tubular space', 'Inverted telescopic fork, Ø 41mm (curso 140 mm (5.5 inches))', 'Cast aluminum dual swing arm, central spring strut, spring pre-load adjustable (curso 132 mm (5.2 inches))', 'Single disc. 4-piston fixed caliper, radially bolted. ABS Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. Single-piston floating caliper. ABS Disco de 241 mm (9.5 inches)', 'ABS', '110/70-R17', '150/60-R17', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 313, 1, 4, 34, 9500, 28, 7500, '10.9:1', 80, 62.1, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 143, 3.33, 'Euro 4', 2005, 849, 1080, 1380, 785, NULL, 164.2, 158, 11),
(116, 'bmw-g-310-r-2025', 'SPORT', 'Good looks run in the family because the G 310 R carries the DNA of the BMW S 1000 R. With its bare design, it wears its heart on its sleeve and thus stands for lightness, precision, and a pure riding experience', 'Tubular space', 'Inverted telescopic fork, Ø 41mm (curso 140 mm (5.5 inches))', 'Cast aluminum dual swing arm, central spring strut, spring pre-load adjustable (curso 132 mm (5.2 inches))', 'Single disc. 4-piston fixed caliper, radially bolted. ABS Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. Single-piston floating caliper. ABS Disco de 241 mm (9.5 inches)', 'ABS', '110/70-R17', '150/60-R17', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 313, 1, 4, 34, NULL, 28, NULL, '10.9:1', 80, 62.1, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 142, 3.33, 'Euro 4', 2005, 849, 1080, 1380, 785, NULL, 158, 158, 11),
(117, 'bmw-g-310-r-2017', 'OFF_ROAD', 'Whether you´re a tall or small rider – you’ll immediately feel at home on the BMW G 310 R! The bike is lightweight, yet a real powerhouse with its 313 cc engine. Safely and reliably the new bike will get you to work, to the next hotspot or out of the city. The G 310 R is a real BMW motorcycle, but with reduced cylinder capacity', 'Bolted steel frame, drive unit load-bearing, tubular steel rear frame', 'Upside down fork , Ø 41 mm', 'Solid die-cast aluminum swingarm, directly hinged monoshock, adjustable preload', 'Single disc. ABS Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS Disco de 240 mm (9.4 inches)', 'ABS', '110/80-R17', '159/60-R17', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 313, 1, 4, 34, 9500, 28, 7500, '10.6:1', 80, 61.1, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic fuel injection, BMS-E2', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 143, 3.33, 'Euro 4', 2005, 820, 1080, 1374, 785, NULL, 158.8, NULL, NULL),
(118, 'bmw-g-310-r-2026', 'SPORT', 'Good looks run in the family because the G 310 R carries the DNA of the BMW S 1000 R. With its bare design, it wears its heart on its sleeve and thus stands for lightness, precision, and a pure riding experience', 'Tubular space', 'Inverted telescopic fork, Ø 41mm (curso 140 mm (5.5 inches))', 'Cast aluminum dual swing arm, central spring strut, spring pre-load adjustable (curso 132 mm (5.2 inches))', 'Single disc. 4-piston fixed caliper, radially bolted. ABS Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. Single-piston floating caliper. ABS Disco de 241 mm (9.5 inches)', 'ABS', '110/70-R17', '150/60-R17', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 313, 1, 4, 34, NULL, 28, NULL, '10.9:1', 80, 62.1, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 142, 3.33, 'Euro 4', 2005, 849, 1080, 1380, 785, NULL, 158, 158, 11),
(119, 'bmw-g-310-r-2018', 'NAKED', 'The BMW G 310 R is the essence of riding pleasure. It was built for pulsing cities and for all those who simply love riding motorcycles. It is manoeuvrable, easy to handle and sporty at the same time', 'Bolted steel frame, drive unit load-bearing, tubular steel rear frame', 'Upside down fork , Ø 41 mm', 'Solid die-cast aluminum swingarm, directly hinged monoshock, adjustable preload', 'Single disc. ABS Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS Disco de 240 mm (9.4 inches)', 'ABS', '110/80-R17', '160/60-R17', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 313, 1, 4, 34, 9500, 28, 7500, '10.6:1', 80, 61.1, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic fuel injection, BMS-E2', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 143, 3.33, 'Euro 4', 2005, 820, 1080, 1374, 785, NULL, 158.8, NULL, 11),
(120, 'bmw-g-310-r-2021', 'SPORT', 'The bike is lightweight, yet a real powerhouse with its 313 cc engine. Get to work, the next hot spot or out of the city safely and reliably on the G 310 R. Premium quality, excellent workmanship and extraordinary technology ensure intense riding pleasure', 'Tubular space', 'Upside-down telescopic fork, Ø 41mm', 'Cast aluminium dual swing arm', 'Single disc. 4-piston fixed caliper, radially bolted. ABS Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. Single-piston floating caliper. ABS Disco de 240 mm (9.4 inches)', 'ABS', '110/70-R17', '150/60-R17', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 313, 1, NULL, 33.5, 9500, 28, 7500, '10.9:1', 80, 62.1, 'Liquid', 'Injection', NULL, NULL, NULL, 143, 3.33, 'Euro 4', 2005, 849, 1080, 1380, 785, NULL, 158.5, 158.5, 11),
(121, 'bmw-g-310-r-2019', 'NAKED', 'Good looks unmistakably run in the family – the BMW G 310 R clearly carries the genes of the S 1000 R. The sporty headlight fairing with powerful headlight, dynamic fuel tank trim and typical roadster proportions make it an eye-catcher on the street', 'Bolted steel frame, drive unit load-bearing, tubular steel rear frame', 'Upside down fork , Ø 41 mm', 'Solid die-cast aluminum swingarm, directly hinged monoshock, adjustable preload', 'Single disc. ABS Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS Disco de 240 mm (9.4 inches)', 'ABS', '110/80-R17', '160/60-R17', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 313, 1, 4, 34, 9500, 28, 7500, '10.9:1', 80, 62.1, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic fuel injection, BMS-E2', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 143, 3.33, 'Euro 4', 2005, 820, 1080, 1374, 785, NULL, 158.8, NULL, 11),
(122, 'bmw-g-310-r-2022', 'SPORT', 'Wake up with a smile on your face. Because every day is an opportunity to try something new – with the BMW G 310 R. It is an intuitive, agile ride thanks to the optimized engine with Ride by Wire and slipper clutch, whether you are off to work, to an appointment, or out of the city', 'Tubular space', 'Inverted telescopic fork, Ø 41mm (curso 140 mm (5.5 inches))', 'Cast aluminum dual swing arm, central spring strut, spring pre-load adjustable (curso 132 mm (5.2 inches))', 'Single disc. 4-piston fixed caliper, radially bolted. ABS Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. Single-piston floating caliper. ABS Disco de 241 mm (9.5 inches)', 'ABS', '110/70-R17', '150/60-R17', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 313, 1, 4, 34, 9500, 28, 7500, '10.9:1', 80, 62.1, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electric throttle Ride by wire', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 143, 3.33, 'Euro 4', 2005, 849, 1080, 1380, 785, NULL, 164.2, 158, 11),
(123, 'bmw-g-310-r-2020', 'SPORT', 'The BMW G 310 R is the essence of riding pleasure. It was built for pulsing cities and for all those who simply love riding motorcycles. It is manoeuvrable, easy to handle and sporty at the same time. Whether you´re a large or small rider – every type of rider feels immediately at home on the BMW G 310 R!', 'Tubular space', 'Upside-down telescopic fork, Ø 41mm', 'Cast aluminium dual swing arm', 'Single disc Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS Disco de 240 mm (9.4 inches)', 'ABS', '110/70-17', '150/60-17', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 313, 1, NULL, 33.5, 9500, 28, 7500, '10.9:1', 80, 62.1, 'Liquid', 'Injection', NULL, NULL, NULL, 143, 3.33, 'Euro 4', 2005, 849, 1080, 1380, 785, NULL, 158.5, 158.5, 11),
(124, 'bmw-g-650-gs-2016', 'ADVENTURE', 'The G 650 GS continues the success story of BMW Motorrad´s single cylinder engines in impressive fashion - with a solid output of 50 hp at 6,500 rpm and a maximum torque of 44 lb/ft at 5,000 rpm. The bike offers absolutely sensational fuel consumption levels: 74 mpg using regular fuel', 'Bridge-type steel section frame with bolted on rear section', 'Telescopic fork, 41mm diameter, fork stabiliser (curso 170 mm (6.7 inches))', 'Box-section steel dual swing arm, central spring strut operated by lever system, spring pre-load hydraulically adjustable (continuously variable) at handwheel', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating discs. Two-piston calipers Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 240 mm (9.4 inches)', 'ABS', '110/80-R19', '140/80-R17', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 652, 1, 4, 50, 6500, 60, 5000, '11.5:1', 100, 83, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection/BMW engine management, twin spark ignition', '5-speed', 5, 'Chain', 170, 3.2, 'Euro 3', 2165, 920, 1390, 1477, 780, NULL, 195, 175, 14),
(125, 'bmw-g-650-gs-2014', 'ADVENTURE', 'The new G 650 GS provides levels of performance, smoothness and economy that have never been produced before by a single cylinder engine. In BMW Motorrad’s quest to prove that we are the most innovative manufacturer, the G 650 GS has a top quality assortment of accessories available, including an optional anti-theft alarm heated grips. With low suspension as an option and at an affordable price, the versatile G 650 GS is prepared for anything from the city to the open country', 'Bridge-type steel section frame with bolted on rear section', 'Telescopic fork, 41mm diameter, fork stabiliser (curso 170 mm (6.7 inches))', 'Box-section steel dual swing-arm, central spring strut operated by lever system, spring pre-load hydraulically adjustable (continuously variable) at hand wheel', 'Single disc. Floating discs. Two-piston calipers Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 240 mm (9.4 inches)', NULL, '110/80-R19', '140/80-R17', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 652, 1, 4, 48, 6500, 60, 5000, '11.5:1', 100, 83, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection/BMW engine management, twin spark ignition', '5-speed', 5, 'Chain', 170, 3.2, 'Euro 3', 2165, 920, 1390, 1477, 780, NULL, 192, 175, 14),
(126, 'bmw-g-650-gs-2015', 'ADVENTURE', 'Why not? That´s the motto of the G 650 GS. Whether in town or on the gravel track: with this machine you have every terrain under control, and you get more than your money´s worth when it comes to riding fun, too', 'Bridge-type steel section frame with bolted on rear section', 'Telescopic fork, 41mm diameter, fork stabiliser (curso 170 mm (6.7 inches))', 'Box-section steel dual swing arm, central spring strut operated by lever system, spring pre-load hydraulically adjustable (continuously variable) at handwheel', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating discs. Two-piston calipers Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 240 mm (9.4 inches)', 'ABS', '110/80-R19', '140/80-R17', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 652, 1, 4, 48, 6500, 60, 5000, '11.5:1', 100, 83, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection/BMW engine management, twin spark ignition', '5-speed', 5, 'Chain', 170, 3.2, 'Euro 3', 2165, 920, 1390, 1477, 780, NULL, 192, 175, 14),
(127, 'bmw-g-650-gs-2013', 'ADVENTURE', 'The G 650 GS continues the success story of BMW Motorrad´s single cylinder engines in impressive fashion - with a solid output of 50 hp at 6500 rpm and a maximum torque of 44 ft-lb at 5000 rpm. The bike offers absolutely sensational fuel consumption levels: 74 mpg, at a constant 55 mph', 'Bridge-type steel section frame with bolted-on rear section', 'Telescopic fork, 41 mm, fork stabilizer (curso 170 mm (6.7 inches))', 'Box-section steel dual swing arm, central spring strut operated by lever system, spring pre-load hydraulically adjustable (continuously variable) at handwheel', 'Single disc. Floating discs. Two-piston calipers. Switchable ABS Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper. Switchable ABS Disco de 240 mm (9.4 inches)', 'ABS', '110/80-19', '140/80-17', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 652, 1, 4, 50, 6500, 44, 5000, '11.5:1', 100, 83, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection / BMW engine management, twin-spark ignition', '5-speed', 5, 'Chain', 169, 3.18, 'Euro 3', 2159, 914, 1397, 1478, 800, NULL, 191.9, 175.1, 14),
(128, 'bmw-g-650-gs-sertao-2013', 'ADVENTURE', 'Power, robustness and agility combined with maximum control. This is what the G 650 GS Sertão stands for - a machine designed to master even the most adventurous forays into off-road terrain. Naturally its outstanding ride characteristics not only make it excel here but also in everyday riding on country roads or in city traffic', 'Bridge-type steel section frame with bolted-on rear section', 'Telescopic fork, 41 mm, fork stabilizer (curso 211 mm (8.3 inches))', 'Box-section steel dual swing arm, central spring strut operated by lever system, spring preload hydraulically adjustable (continuously variable) at handwheel', 'Single disc. Floating discs. Two-piston calipers. Switchable ABS Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper. Switchable ABS Disco de 240 mm (9.4 inches)', 'ABS', '90/90-21', '130/80-17', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 652, 1, 4, 50, 6500, 44, 5000, '11.5:1', 100, 83, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection / BMW engine management, twin-spark ignition', '5-speed', 5, 'Chain', 169, 3.18, 'Euro 3', 2184, 919, 1440, 1483, 861, NULL, 192.8, 176.9, 14),
(129, 'bmw-k-1300-r-2013', 'NAKED', 'It´s impossible to imagine a more striking or more exciting naked bike. Designed without compromise to impress - and to perform. An output of 173hp (127 kW) an­d 140 Nm of torque ensure it can handle anything the street can throw at it. Looks aren´t always deceptive', 'Bridge-type, cast aluminium, load bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Duolever (curso 115 mm (4.5 inches))', 'Cast aluminium single-sided swing arm with BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 135 mm (5.3 inches))', 'Double disc. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers. Optional ABS Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers. Optional ABS Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '180/55-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 1293, 4, 4, 175, 9250, 140, 8250, '13:1', 80, 64.3, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection/digital engine management including knock sensor (BMS-K)', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 266, 5, 'Euro 3', 2228, 856, 1095, 1585, 820, NULL, 243, 217, 19),
(130, 'bmw-k-1300-r-2014', 'NAKED', 'Imposing design meets unique technology. Technology such as the famous BMW Motorrad Duolever for optimum handling, BMW Motorrad ABS and optional TPC Tyre Pressure Control. The K 1300 R is also the only naked bike available with gear shift assist, allowing riders to change up without declutching or taking their hand off the throttle', 'Bridge-type, cast aluminium, load bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Duolever (curso 115 mm (4.5 inches))', 'Cast aluminium single-sided swing arm with BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 135 mm (5.3 inches))', 'Double disc. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', NULL, '120/70-ZR17', '180/55-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 1293, 4, 4, 175, 9250, 140, 8250, '13:1', 80, 64.3, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection/digital engine management including knock sensor (BMS-K)', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 266, 5, 'Euro 3', 2228, 856, 1095, 1585, 820, NULL, 243, 217, 19),
(131, 'bmw-k-1300-s-2013', 'SPORT', 'The interceptor. The athlete. Aerodynamic, avant-garde. Do you know of another sporty bike with this profile? A bike that develops such pulling power with 175 hp that it take the heat out of many a 200 hp bike? But a bike you can still take out on a quick trip simply because it has great everyday suitability? At the same time a technological treat?', 'Bridge-type frame, cast aluminum, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Duolever (curso 114 mm (4.5 inches))', 'Cast aluminum single-sided swing arm with BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 135 mm (5.3 inches))', 'Double disc. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers. ABS Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers. ABS Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-17', '190/55-17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 1293, 4, 4, 175, 9250, 103, 8250, '13:1', 80, 64.3, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection/digital engine management including knock sensor (BMS-K)', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 201, 4.7, 'Euro 3', 2182, 904, 1219, 1585, 820, NULL, 254, 228.2, 18.9),
(132, 'bmw-k-1300-s-2014', 'SPORT', 'Extreme power. Thrilling acceleration. Instant responses across the rev range. Welcome to the ultimate sports tourer - the new BMW K 1300 S', 'Bridge-type frame, cast aluminium, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Duolever (curso 115 mm (4.5 inches))', 'Cast aluminium single-sided swing arm with BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 135 mm (5.3 inches))', 'Double disc. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', NULL, '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 1293, 4, 4, 175, 9250, 140, 8250, '13:1', 80, 64.3, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection/digital engine management including knock sensor (BMS-K)', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 277, 4.7, 'Euro 3', 2182, 905, 1221, 1585, 820, NULL, 254, 228, 19),
(133, 'bmw-k-1600-bagger-2025', 'TOURING', 'Operability, comfort, and performance: Say it like it is with the K 1600 B. Everything has been geared towards you and your traveling experience', 'Bridge-type, cast aluminum, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Duolever; central spring strut (curso 115 mm (4.5 inches))', 'Cast aluminum single-sided swing arm with BMW Motorrad Paralever; central spring strut (curso 135 mm (5.3 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line six, four-stroke', 1649, 6, 4, 160, NULL, 179.9, NULL, '12.2:1', 72, 67.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection digital engine management system: BMS-O with throttle-by-wire', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 193, 5.7, NULL, 2470, 1000, 1300, 1618, 750, NULL, 343.8, NULL, 26.5),
(134, 'bmw-k-1600-bagger-2018', 'TOURING', 'You´re hungry for asphalt. For every mile. For new horizons. Then the Bagger is the motorcycle for your journey. With 6 cylinders, an extraordinary running smoothness and its impressive power development, it leaves no doubts – the journey begins now', 'Bridge-type frame, cast aluminium, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Duolever (curso 125 mm (4.9 inches))', 'BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 135 mm (5.3 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line six, four-stroke', 1649, 6, 4, 160, 7750, 175, 5520, '12.2:1', 72, 67.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', NULL, 5.7, 'Euro 4', 2489, 1000, 1465, 1720, 750, NULL, 336, NULL, 26.5),
(135, 'bmw-k-1600-bagger-2019', 'TOURING', 'Whoever sits atop the Bagger will want to ride on. Thanks to the high level of comfort of this special bike, the riding time is unlimited. Because the standard dynamic ESA ensures optimum handling and riding dynamics. In addition, the ´DYNAMIC´ setting ensures soft damping comfort', 'Bridge-type frame, cast aluminium, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Duolever (curso 125 mm (4.9 inches))', 'BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 135 mm (5.3 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line six, four-stroke', 1649, 6, 4, 160, 7750, 175, 5520, '12.2:1', 72, 67.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 200, 5.7, 'Euro 4', 2489, 1000, 1465, 1618, 750, NULL, 336, NULL, 26.5),
(136, 'bmw-k-1600-bagger-2021', 'TOURING', 'If you’re hungry for asphalt and for new horizons, then the Bagger is the motorcycle for your journey. With its six cylinders, it delivers impressive power and extraordinary running smoothness. Let the journey begin', 'Aluminum bridge-type frame with load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Duolever (curso 115 mm (4.5 inches))', 'BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 125 mm (4.9 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line six, four-stroke', 1649, 6, 4, 158.2, 7750, 175, 5250, '12.2:1', 72, 67.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic fuel injection with ride-by-wire throttle system', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 201, 5.7, 'Euro 4', 2470, 1000, 1300, 1618, 750, NULL, 336, NULL, 26.5),
(137, 'bmw-k-1600-bagger-2024', 'TOURING', 'The navigation quite literally sets new standards. In full-screen mode, the display stands out with its 1,920x720 pixels in full HD resolution. You know your ways – but from now on you will also enjoy discovering new ones', 'Bridge-type, cast aluminum, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Duolever; central spring strut (curso 115 mm (4.5 inches))', 'Cast aluminum single-sided swing arm with BMW Motorrad Paralever; central spring strut (curso 135 mm (5.3 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line six, four-stroke', 1649, 6, 4, 160, NULL, 179.9, NULL, '12.2:1', 72, 67.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection digital engine management system: BMS-O with throttle-by-wire', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 193, 5.7, NULL, 2470, 1000, 1300, 1618, 750, NULL, 343.8, NULL, 26.5),
(138, 'bmw-k-1600-bagger-2020', 'TOURING', 'You´re hungry for asphalt. For every mile. For new horizons. Then the Bagger is the motorcycle for your journey. With 6 cylinders, an extraordinary running smoothness and its impressive power development, it leaves no doubts – the journey begins now', 'Bridge-type frame, cast aluminium, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Duolever (curso 125 mm (4.9 inches))', 'BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 135 mm (5.3 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line six, four-stroke', 1649, 6, 4, 158.2, 7750, 175, 5520, '12.2:1', 72, 67.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', NULL, 5.7, 'Euro 4', 2470, 1000, 1300, 1618, 750, NULL, 336, NULL, 26.5),
(139, 'bmw-k-1600-bagger-2023', 'TOURING', 'Operability, comfort, safety and performance: Say it like it is with the K 1600 B. Everything has been geared towards you and your traveling experience. In this process, the new lighting technology is state-of-the-art: thanks to the full LED headlight with adaptive headlight, you can turn night into day like never before, whizzing around bends in a much more dynamic way', 'Bridge-type, cast aluminum, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Duolever; central spring strut (curso 115 mm (4.5 inches))', 'Cast aluminum single-sided swing arm with BMW Motorrad Paralever; central spring strut (curso 135 mm (5.3 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line six, four-stroke', 1649, 6, 4, 160, 6750, 179.9, 5250, '12.2:1', 72, 67.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection digital engine management system: BMS-O with throttle-by-wire', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 193, 5.7, NULL, 2470, 1000, 1300, 1618, 750, NULL, 343.8, NULL, 26.5),
(140, 'bmw-k-1600-bagger-2022', 'TOURING', 'Enjoy unleashing the power of the legendary six-cylinder engine. From then on, you are virtually eating up the road ahead of you, turning relaxed cruising with luxurious comfort into adventurous performance touring. Just like you would expect from the elongated and dynamically drawn bagger outline. Thanks to the K 1600 B, you’re happy to be riding a little longer, whether on your own or with friends', 'Bridge-type, cast aluminum, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Duolever; central spring strut (curso 115 mm (4.5 inches))', 'Cast aluminum single-sided swing arm with BMW Motorrad Paralever; central spring strut (curso 135 mm (5.3 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line six, four-stroke', 1649, 6, 4, 160, 6750, 179.9, 5250, '12.2:1', 72, 67.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection digital engine management system: BMS-O with throttle-by-wire', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 193, 5.7, NULL, 2470, 1000, 1300, 1618, 750, NULL, 343.8, NULL, 26.5),
(141, 'bmw-k-1600-gt-2015', 'TOURING', 'Gran Turismo. Travel in big style. That means combining dynamic performance and comfort - and transforming distance into free space. BMW Motorrad´s vision was the essence of this philosophy - the pure sense of Gran Turismo. This vision has now taken shape in the K 1600 GT', 'Bridge-type frame, cast aluminium, load bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Duolever (curso 125 mm (4.9 inches))', 'BMW Paralever (curso 135 mm (5.3 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line six, four-stroke', 1649, 6, 4, 160, 7750, 175, 5250, '12.2:1', 72, 67.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection, digital engine management (BMS-X)', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 239, 4.5, 'Euro 3', 2324, 1000, 1440, 1680, 810, NULL, 319, 295, 24),
(142, 'bmw-k-1600-gt-2013', 'TOURING', NULL, 'Bridge-type frame, cast aluminium, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Duolever (curso 124 mm (4.9 inches))', 'BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 135 mm (5.3 inches))', 'Double disc. Four-piston calipers. ABS Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. Two-piston calipers. ABS Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-17', '190/55-17', 'In-line six, four-stroke', 1649, 6, 4, 160, 7750, 129, 5250, '12.2:1', 72, 67.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection, digital engine management (BMS-X)', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 201, NULL, 'Euro 3', 2324, 1001, 1440, 1679, 810, NULL, 332, 308, 26.5),
(143, 'bmw-k-1600-gt-2014', 'TOURING', 'Our brand new, six-cylinder engine is perfectly complimented by the ergonomics of the K 1600 GT. Designed to be the ultimate European-style performance touring bike, the key ´triangle´ between footrests, seat and handlebars on the GT give the rider full control of the bike and still provide a high level of long-distance comfort', 'Bridge-type frame, cast aluminium, load bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Duolever (curso 125 mm (4.9 inches))', 'Travel front/rear (curso 135 mm (5.3 inches))', 'Double disc. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', NULL, '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line six, four-stroke', 1649, 6, 4, 160, 7750, 175, 5250, '12.2:1', 72, 67.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection, digital engine management (BMS-X)', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 239, 4.5, 'Euro 3', 2324, 1000, 1440, 1680, 810, NULL, 319, 295, 24),
(144, 'bmw-k-1600-gtl-2022', 'TOURING', 'Six-cylinder in-line engines have always belonged to the showcase drives at BMW. Since 2010, BMW Motorrad offers fascinating high-performance and luxurious six-cylinder equipment at the highest level with the K 1600 models', 'Aluminum bridge-type frame with load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Duolever (curso 115 mm (4.5 inches))', 'BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 135 mm (5.3 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line six, four-stroke', 1649, 6, 4, 160, 6750, 180, 5250, '12.2:1', 72, 67.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic fuel injection with ride-by-wire throttle system', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 201, 5.7, 'Euro 5', 2489, 1000, 1475, 1618, 750, NULL, 357.9, NULL, 26.5),
(145, 'bmw-k-1600-gtl-2026', 'TOURING', 'There is a German proverb along the lines of “anyone who travels with ambitions never travels alone.” This is especially true when you are traveling with someone else. The BMW K 1600 GTL represents both these elements. It offers performance touring that leaves no wishes unfulfilled', 'Bridge-type frame, cast aluminum, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Duolever; central spring strut (curso 115 mm (4.5 inches))', 'Cast aluminum single-sided swing arm with BMW Motorrad Paralever; central spring strut (curso 135 mm (5.3 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line six, four-stroke', 1649, 6, 4, 160, NULL, 180, NULL, '12.2:1', 72, 67.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection digital engine management system: BMS-O with throttle-by-wire', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 193, 5.7, 'Euro 5', 2489, 1000, 1475, 1618, 750, NULL, 357.9, NULL, 26.5),
(146, 'bmw-k-1600-gtl-2018', 'TOURING', 'Ride on. And on and on. Glide into the horizon in style and elegance on this luxurious high-performance touring motorcycle. The new BMW K 1600 GTL motorcycle is the pinnacle of high quality and sheer comfort, boasting the legendary straight-six engine', 'Aluminum bridge-type frame with load-bearing engine', 'BMW Duolever, central spring strut (curso 115 mm (4.5 inches))', 'BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 135 mm (5.3 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line six, four-stroke', 1649, 6, 4, 160, 7750, 175, 5250, '12.2:1', 72, 67.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection, digital engine management (BMS-X)', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', NULL, 5.7, 'Euro 3', 2489, 1000, 1465, 1680, 750, NULL, 350, 323, 26.5),
(147, 'bmw-k-1600-gtl-2014', 'TOURING', 'The BMW K 1600 GTL brings a new dimension to luxury touring – blending smooth power from the brand new six-cylinder engine with class-leading comfort the GTL is luxury. Rider and pillion passenger benefit from a relaxed, upright seating position, excellent wind protection and plenty of room for both riders and luggage, which makes long distances more enjoyable than ever', 'Bridge-type frame, cast aluminium, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Duolever (curso 125 mm (4.9 inches))', 'Travel front/rear (curso 135 mm (5.3 inches))', 'Double disc. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', NULL, '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line six, four-stroke', 1649, 6, 4, 160, 7750, 175, 5250, '12.2:1', 72, 67.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection, digital engine management (BMS-X)', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 239, 4.6, 'Euro 3', 2489, 1000, 1465, 1680, 750, NULL, 348, 321, 26.5),
(148, 'bmw-k-1600-gtl-2023', 'TOURING', 'Its powerful six-cylinder engine now delivers dynamism and superior character: thanks to the comfortably designed vehicle geometry, you can enjoy every mile. - The cockpit has also been redesigned. it has been entirely geared towards interaction with you so you can enjoy every tour even more consciously and intensively', 'Bridge-type frame, cast aluminum, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Duolever; central spring strut (curso 115 mm (4.5 inches))', 'Cast aluminum single-sided swing arm with BMW Motorrad Paralever; central spring strut (curso 135 mm (5.3 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line six, four-stroke', 1649, 6, 4, 160, 6750, 180, 5250, '12.2:1', 72, 67.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection digital engine management system: BMS-O with throttle-by-wire', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 200, 5.7, 'Euro 5', 2489, 1000, 1475, 1618, 750, NULL, 357.9, NULL, 26.5),
(149, 'bmw-k-1600-gtl-2020', 'TOURING', NULL, 'Bridge-type frame, cast aluminium, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Duolever (curso 125 mm (4.9 inches))', 'BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 135 mm (5.3 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line six, four-stroke', 1649, 6, 4, 158.2, 7750, 175, 5520, '12.2:1', 72, 67.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 162, NULL, 'Euro 4', 2489, 1000, 1475, 1618, 750, NULL, 350, NULL, 26.5),
(150, 'bmw-k-1600-gtl-2024', 'TOURING', 'Sometimes it’s the small things that make a trip unforgettable. That’s why the K 1600 GTL is exclusive down to the last detail: be it the available armrest for your companion, the sophisticated, optional liners for cases and top case or the numerous chrome parts that make your bike look perfect. You yourself can rely on the best light conditions you could have hoped for thanks to the full LED headlight with adaptive headlight', 'Bridge-type frame, cast aluminum, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Duolever; central spring strut (curso 115 mm (4.5 inches))', 'Cast aluminum single-sided swing arm with BMW Motorrad Paralever; central spring strut (curso 135 mm (5.3 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line six, four-stroke', 1649, 6, 4, 160, NULL, 180, NULL, '12.2:1', 72, 67.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection digital engine management system: BMS-O with throttle-by-wire', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 193, 5.7, 'Euro 5', 2489, 1000, 1475, 1618, 750, NULL, 357.9, NULL, 26.5),
(151, 'bmw-k-1600-gtl-2025', 'TOURING', 'There is a German proverb along the lines of “anyone who travels with ambitions never travels alone.” This is especially true when you are traveling with someone else. The BMW K 1600 GTL represents both these elements. It offers performance touring that leaves no wishes unfulfilled', 'Bridge-type frame, cast aluminum, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Duolever; central spring strut (curso 115 mm (4.5 inches))', 'Cast aluminum single-sided swing arm with BMW Motorrad Paralever; central spring strut (curso 135 mm (5.3 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line six, four-stroke', 1649, 6, 4, 160, NULL, 180, NULL, '12.2:1', 72, 67.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection digital engine management system: BMS-O with throttle-by-wire', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 193, 5.7, 'Euro 5', 2489, 1000, 1475, 1618, 750, NULL, 357.9, NULL, 26.5),
(152, 'bmw-k-1600-gtl-2012', 'TOURING', 'The ergonomic design is geared towards maximum comfort and features a single-section, dual-level seat unit, rider footrests which are further forward and lower, and handlebars which reach further back towards the rider. The standard top box featuring an integrated back rest rounds off the range of comfort features for the pillion passenger. The K 1600 GTL sets a new benchmark in luxury motorcycle touring', 'Bridge-type frame, cast aluminium, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Duolever (curso 125 mm (4.9 inches))', 'BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 135 mm (5.3 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line six, four-stroke', 1649, 6, 4, 160, 7750, 175, 5250, '12.2:1', 72, 67.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection, digital engine management (BMS-X)', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 239, 4.6, 'Euro 3', 2489, 1000, 1465, 1680, 750, NULL, 348, 321, 26.5),
(153, 'bmw-k-1600-gtl-2013', 'TOURING', 'When luxury is freed of constraint, it moves to a new level. At the very top of this evolution is the K 1600 GTL – a high-class touring bike like none before it. With the most compact and efficient in-line 6-cylinder engine ever installed in a series production motorcycle', 'Bridge-type frame, cast aluminium, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Duolever (curso 124 mm (4.9 inches))', 'BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 135 mm (5.3 inches))', 'Double disc. Four-piston calipers. ABS Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. Two-piston calipers. ABS Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-17', '190/55-17', 'In-line six, four-stroke', 1649, 6, 4, 160, 7750, 129, 5250, '12.2:1', 72, 67.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection, digital engine management (BMS-X)', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 201, 4.52, 'Euro 3', 2487, 1001, 1466, 1679, 749, NULL, 348.4, 321.1, 26.5),
(154, 'bmw-k-1600-gtl-2019', 'TOURING', 'A first-class engine: the legendary straight-six engine offers an unparalleled smooth ride and the most outstanding riding performance in the luxury tour sector. Its 118 kW (160 PS) output and maximum torque of 175 Nm at 5250 rpm supplies the perfect dynamic thrust forward. And 70% of the torque is already achieved at 1500 rpm', 'Aluminum bridge-type frame with load-bearing engine', 'BMW Duolever, central spring strut (curso 115 mm (4.5 inches))', 'BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 135 mm (5.3 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line six, four-stroke', 1649, 6, 4, 160, 7750, 175, 5250, '12.2:1', 72, 67.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection, digital engine management (BMS-X)', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', NULL, 5.7, 'Euro 3', 2489, 1000, 1465, 1618, 750, NULL, 350, 323, 26.5),
(155, 'bmw-k-1600-gtl-2016', 'TOURING', NULL, 'Aluminum bridge-type frame with load-bearing engine', 'BMW Duolever, central spring strut (curso 125 mm (4.9 inches))', 'BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 135 mm (5.3 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line six, four-stroke', 1649, 6, 4, 160, 7750, 175, 5250, '12.2:1', 72, 67.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection, digital engine management (BMS-X)', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 239, NULL, NULL, 2489, 1000, 1465, 1680, 750, NULL, 348, 321, 26.5),
(156, 'bmw-k-1600-gtl-2021', 'TOURING', 'Enjoy effortless steering on all your trips, whether you’re on your own or with a passenger. Travelling with the K 1600 GTL is a unique experience – stylish, powerful, luxurious – the first class awaits you on two wheels', 'Aluminum bridge-type frame with load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Duolever (curso 115 mm (4.5 inches))', 'BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 135 mm (5.3 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line six, four-stroke', 1649, 6, 4, 158.2, 7750, 175, 5250, '12.2:1', 72, 67.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic fuel injection with ride-by-wire throttle system', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 201, 5.7, 'Euro 4', 2489, 1000, 1475, 1618, 750, NULL, 350, NULL, 26.5),
