(158, 'bmw-k-1600-gtl-exclusive-2015', 'TOURING', 'When luxury is freed of all ballast, it moves to a new level. At the very top of this evolution is the K 1600 GTL – a high-class touring bike like none before it. With the most compact and efficient in-line 6-cylinder engine ever installed in a series production motorcycle', 'Bridge-type frame, cast aluminium, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Duolever (curso 125 mm (4.9 inches))', 'BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 135 mm (5.3 inches))', 'Double disc. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', NULL, '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line six, four-stroke', 1649, 6, 4, 158.2, 7750, 175, 5250, '12.2:1', 72, 67.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection, digital engine management (BMS-X)', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 239, 4.6, NULL, 2489, 1000, 1465, 1680, 750, NULL, 348, 321, 26.5),
(159, 'bmw-k-1600-gtl-exclusive-2014', 'TOURING', 'The BMW K 1600 GTL brings a new dimension to luxury touring – blending smooth power from the brand new six-cylinder engine with class-leading comfort the GTL is luxury. Rider and pillion passenger benefit from a relaxed, upright seating position, excellent wind protection and plenty of room for both riders and luggage, which makes long distances more enjoyable than ever', 'Bridge-type frame, cast aluminium, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Duolever (curso 125 mm (4.9 inches))', 'Travel front/rear (curso 135 mm (5.3 inches))', 'Double disc. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', NULL, '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line six, four-stroke', 1649, 6, 4, 160, 7750, 175, 5250, '12.2:1', 72, 67.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection, digital engine management (BMS-X)', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 239, 4.6, 'Euro 3', 2489, 1000, 1465, 1680, 750, NULL, 348, 321, 26.5),
(160, 'bmw-k-1600-gtl-exclusive-2016', 'TOURING', NULL, 'Aluminum bridge-type frame with load-bearing engine', 'BMW Duolever, central spring strut (curso 125 mm (4.9 inches))', 'BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 135 mm (5.3 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line six, four-stroke', 1649, 6, 4, 160, 7750, 175, 5250, '12.2:1', 72, 67.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection, digital engine management (BMS-X)', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 239, NULL, NULL, 2489, 1000, 1465, 1680, 750, NULL, 348, 321, 26.5),
(161, 'bmw-r-12-2025', 'CRUISER', 'You don´t have to dream of California. This cruiser brings this unique vibe right to your doorstep. Its low seat height invites you to hop on immediately. As a road surfer, you might want to give your ears some fitting music to listen to', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1170, NULL, NULL, 95, NULL, 109.8, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 203, 4.96, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1519, NULL, NULL, 226.8, NULL, 14),
(162, 'bmw-r-1200-gs-2016', 'ADVENTURE', 'The new R 1200 GS is ready for any terrain, thanks to the greater rigidity of its main frame and its enhanced Paralever and Telelever for even greater steering accuracy. The optional Dynamic ESA configures the suspension automatically to the terrain and load conditions', 'Twin-section frame, front- and bolted on rear frame,load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Telelever; stanchion diameter 37 mm, central spring strut (curso 190 mm (7.5 inches))', 'Cast aluminium single swingarm with BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 200 mm (7.9 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 305 mm (12.0 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 276 mm (10.9 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-R19', '170/60-R17', 'Two cylinder boxer, two-stroke', 1170, 2, 4, 125, 7750, 125, 6500, '12.5:1', 101, 73, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection/BMS-K digital engine management with electromotive throttle actuator', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 207, 4.1, 'Euro 3', 2210, 953, 1450, 1507, 850, NULL, 238, 205, 20),
(163, 'bmw-r-1200-gs-2012', 'ADVENTURE', 'The versatility and sheer performance of the GS is partly due to the famous boxer engine which is at the heart of the awesome machine. Now updated with double over head cams, the motorcycle offers more torque at lower revs, improved responses and better acceleration across the rev range, making the bike even better both on and off-road', 'Two-section frame consisting of front and rear sections, load- bearing engine-gearbox unit', 'BMW Motorrad Telelever (curso 190 mm (7.5 inches))', 'Cast aluminium single-sided swing arm with BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 200 mm (7.9 inches))', 'Double disc. Optional integral ABS. Can be switched off Disco de 305 mm (12.0 inches)', 'Single disc. Optional integral ABS. Can be switched off Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '110/80-R19', '150/70-R17', 'Two cylinder boxer, two-stroke', 1170, 2, 4, 48, 7750, 120, 6000, '12:1', 101, 73, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection/BMS-K digital engine management with overrun fuel cut-off, twin spark', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 207, 4.3, 'Euro 3', 2210, 915, 1450, 1507, 850, NULL, 229, 203, 20),
(164, 'bmw-r-1200-gs-2017', 'ADVENTURE', 'The R 1200 GS is THE GS. It founded the dual-sport motorcycle segment – and is still leading it confidently today. The diversity – roads, cross-country, urban, countryside, comfort, performance – combined with the legendary robustness and the expertise from over 36 years of GS development result in a motorcycle which shies away from no competitors', 'Two-section frame, front- and bolted on rear frame, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Telelever (curso 190 mm (7.5 inches))', 'Cast aluminium single-sided swing arm with BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 200 mm (7.9 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 305 mm (12.0 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 276 mm (10.9 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-19', '170/60-17', 'Two cylinder boxer, two-stroke', 1170, 2, NULL, 125, 7750, 125, 6500, '12.5:1', 101, 73, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', NULL, NULL, 'Euro 4', 2207, 953, 1450, 1507, 850, NULL, 244, NULL, 20),
(165, 'bmw-r-1200-gs-2014', 'ADVENTURE', 'For 32 years, the BMW Motorrad GS has been defining and dominating the segment of travel enduros. No other motorcycle is such an uncompromising embodiment of freedom and adventure, reliability and riding dynamics, and ultimately pure riding pleasure both on and off the road. BMW Motorrad is now embarking on the next chapter of its success story – with the new R 1200 GS', 'Twin-section frame, front- and bolted on rear frame,load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Telelever (curso 190 mm (7.5 inches))', 'Cast aluminium single swingarm with BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 200 mm (7.9 inches))', 'Double disc. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 305 mm (12.0 inches)', 'Single disc. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 276 mm (10.9 inches)', NULL, '120/70-R19', '170/60-R17', 'Two cylinder boxer, two-stroke', 1170, 2, NULL, 123.4, 7750, 125, 6500, '12.5:1', 101, 73, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection/BMS-K digital engine management with electromotive throttle actuator', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 207, 4.1, 'Euro 3', 2210, 953, 1450, 1507, 850, NULL, 238, 205, 20),
(166, 'bmw-r-1200-gs-2018', 'ADVENTURE', 'The R 1200 GS has always been inspiring. The new model goes one better: both in terms of its touring suitability and off-road performance. Which means for you: increased comfort, dynamics and more fun. In short: yet more adventure', 'Two-section frame, front- and bolted on rear frame, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Telelever (curso 190 mm (7.5 inches))', 'Cast aluminium single-sided swing arm with BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 200 mm (7.9 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 305 mm (12.0 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 276 mm (10.9 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-R19', '170/60-R17', 'Two cylinder boxer, four-stroke', 1170, 2, 4, 125, 7750, 125, 6500, '12.5:1', 101, 73, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 200, 4.96, 'Euro 4', 2207, 953, 1450, 1507, 850, NULL, 244, NULL, 20),
(167, 'bmw-r-1200-gs-2015', 'ADVENTURE', 'Powerful, refined, and high revving. The R 1200 GS is powered by a new two cylinder opposed twin engine design delivering 125 hp (92 kW). Based on a new concept of combined air and liquid cooling and vertical flows through the cylinders, the engine operates efficiently, reliably, and with high torques at all times', 'Twin-section frame, front- and bolted on rear frame,load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Telelever; stanchion diameter 37 mm, central spring strut (curso 190 mm (7.5 inches))', 'Cast aluminium single swingarm with BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 200 mm (7.9 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 305 mm (12.0 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 276 mm (10.9 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-R19', '170/60-R17', 'Two cylinder boxer, four-stroke', 1170, 2, 4, 125, 7750, 125, 6500, '12.5:1', 101, 73, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection/BMS-K digital engine management with electromotive throttle actuator', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 208, 4.1, 'Euro 3', 2210, 953, 1450, 1507, 850, NULL, 238, 199, 20),
(168, 'bmw-r-1200-gs-2013', 'ADVENTURE', 'The BMW R 1200 GS – the icon of all travel enduros. For 32 years “the GS” has been defining its segment and has proven to be the trusty companion on any motorcycle adventure. BMW Motorrad is now embarking on a new chapter of its success story and is yet again perfecting the iconic R 1200 GS', 'Two-section frame, bolted on rear frame, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Telelever (curso 191 mm (7.5 inches))', 'Cast aluminium single-sided swing arm with BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 201 mm (7.9 inches))', 'Double disc. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers. ABS Disco de 305 mm (12.0 inches)', 'Single disc. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers. ABS Disco de 276 mm (10.9 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-19', '170/60-17', 'Two cylinder boxer, two-stroke', 1170, 2, NULL, 123.4, 7750, 124.8, 6500, '12.5:1', 101, 73, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection / BMS-K+ digital engine management with electromotive throttle actuator', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 207, 4.13, 'Euro 3', 2210, 953, 1450, 1506, 851, NULL, 238.1, 205, 20.1),
(169, 'bmw-r-1200-gs-2019', 'ADVENTURE', 'Wherever the journey takes you, the R 1200 GS is bound to draw attention. From the front to the back, the striking GS line style acknowledges its unquenchable thirst for adventure. High-quality design elements, attractive colors and styles make the new GS unmatched', 'Two-section frame, front- and bolted on rear frame, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Telelever (curso 190 mm (7.5 inches))', 'Cast aluminium single-sided swing arm with BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 200 mm (7.9 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 305 mm (12.0 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 276 mm (10.9 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-R19', '170/60-R17', 'Two cylinder boxer, four-stroke', 1170, 2, 4, 125, 7750, 125, 6500, '12.5:1', 101, 73, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 200, 4.96, 'Euro 4', 2207, 953, 1450, 1507, 850, NULL, 244, NULL, 20),
(170, 'bmw-r-1200-gs-adventure-2012', 'ADVENTURE', 'Some journeys you can tell are going to be tough just by looking at the map - but the reality is always going to be tougher. And that´s where the new BMW R 1200 GS Adventure comes into its own. However far you have to go, whatever the terrain, this is a motorcycle that will never let you down', 'Two-section frame consisting of front and rear sections, load- bearing engine-gearbox unit', 'BMW Motorrad Telelever (curso 210 mm (8.3 inches))', 'Cast aluminium single-sided swing arm with BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 220 mm (8.7 inches))', 'Double disc. Optional integral ABS. Can be switched off Disco de 305 mm (12.0 inches)', 'Single disc. Optional integral ABS. Can be switched off Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '110/80-R19', '150/70-R17', 'Two cylinder boxer, two-stroke', 1170, 2, NULL, 110, 7750, 120, 6000, '12:1', 101, 73, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection/BMS-K digital engine management with overrun fuel cut-off, twin spark', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 193, 4.6, NULL, 2240, 915, 1450, 1510, 890, NULL, 256, 223, 33),
(171, 'bmw-r-1200-gs-adventure-2019', 'ADVENTURE', 'The R 1200 GS Adventure is up for journeys and challenges of all types. With its powerful, robust and dynamic design, one look will tell you all you need to know about its character', 'Two-section frame, front- and bolted on rear frame, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Telelever, front, stanchion diameter 37 mm (curso 210 mm (8.3 inches))', 'BMW Motrrad EVO Paralever, rear (curso 220 mm (8.7 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers Disco de 305 mm (12.0 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS Disco de 276 mm (10.9 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-R19', '170/60-R17', 'Two cylinder boxer, four-stroke', 1170, 2, 4, 125, 7750, 125, 6500, '12.5:1', 101, 73, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 200, 4.96, 'Euro 4', 2255, 980, 1450, 1469, 890, NULL, 260, 229.1, 30),
(172, 'bmw-r-1200-gs-adventure-2018', 'ADVENTURE', 'Do you love extreme, long tours, even on bumpy roads? Do you enjoy stony paths or the wilderness? Whether it´s asphalt, offroad, rocks or sand: the BMW R 1200 GS Adventure has the right answers to every challenge with its light, agile handling', 'Two-section frame, front- and bolted on rear frame, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Telelever, front, stanchion diameter 37 mm (curso 210 mm (8.3 inches))', 'BMW Motrrad EVO Paralever, rear (curso 220 mm (8.7 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers Disco de 305 mm (12.0 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS Disco de 276 mm (10.9 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-R19', '170/60-R17', 'Two cylinder boxer, four-stroke', 1170, 2, 4, 125, 7750, 125, 6500, '12.5:1', 101, 73, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 200, 4.96, 'Euro 4', 2255, 980, 1450, 1510, 890, NULL, 263, 229.1, 30),
(173, 'bmw-r-1200-gs-adventure-2015', 'ADVENTURE', 'Fan of extreme and long tours? On rough roads, over stony tracks out in the wild, too? Tarmac, offroad, stones and sand: These are the challenges the new BMW R 1200 GS Adventure is longing to master with its easy and agile handling', 'Two-section frame consisting of front and rear sections, load- bearing engine-gearbox unit', 'BMW Motorrad Telelever; stanchion diameter 37 mm, central spring strut (curso 210 mm (8.3 inches))', 'Cast aluminium single-sided swing arm with BMW Motorrad Paralever; WAD strut (travel-related damping), spring pre-load hydraulically adjustable (continuously', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 305 mm (12.0 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 275 mm (10.8 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-R19', '170/60-R17', 'Two cylinder boxer, four-stroke', 1170, 2, 4, 125, 7750, 125, 6500, '12.5:1', 101, 73, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 193, 4.3, 'Euro 3', 2255, 980, 1450, 1510, 890, NULL, 260, 229.1, 30),
(174, 'bmw-r-1200-gs-adventure-2017', 'ADVENTURE', 'Conquer any type of terrain on an enduro which meets all your practical needs. Two standard-fitted ride modes – ´Rain´ and ´Road´ – are available at the press of a button and offer two completely different, finely tuned riding experiences. It´s like having two motorcycles in one', 'Two-section frame, front- and bolted on rear frame, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Telelever, front, stanchion diameter 37 mm (curso 210 mm (8.3 inches))', 'BMW Motrrad EVO Paralever, rear (curso 220 mm (8.7 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers Disco de 305 mm (12.0 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS Disco de 276 mm (10.9 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-R19', '170/60-R17', 'Twin, four-stroke', 1170, 2, 4, 125, 7750, 125, 6500, '12.5:1', 101, 73, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', NULL, NULL, 'Euro 4', 2255, 980, 1450, 1510, 890, NULL, 263, 229.1, 30),
(175, 'bmw-r-1200-gs-adventure-2013', 'ADVENTURE', NULL, 'Two-section frame consisting of front and rear sections, load- bearing engine-gearbox unit', 'BMW Motorrad Telelever (curso 211 mm (8.3 inches))', 'Cast aluminium single-sided swing arm with BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 221 mm (8.7 inches))', 'Double disc. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers. Switchable ABS Disco de 305 mm (12.0 inches)', 'Single disc. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers. Switchable ABS Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '110/80-19', '150/70-17', 'Two cylinder boxer, two-stroke', 1170, 2, NULL, 110, 7750, 89, 6000, '12:1', 101, 73, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection / BMS-K+ digital engine management with overrun fuel cut-off, twin spark', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 201, NULL, 'Euro 3', 2235, 991, 1524, 1509, 889, NULL, 255.8, 229.1, 32.9),
(176, 'bmw-r-1200-gs-adventure-2016', 'ADVENTURE', 'A machine for those who want to test their limits and go beyond them. Or to put it briefly: A motorcycle for riders who are seeking real adventure and don´t want to miss out on a great deal of riding pleasure in the process', 'Two-section frame consisting of front and rear sections, load- bearing engine-gearbox unit', 'BMW Motorrad Telelever; stanchion diameter 37 mm, central spring strut (curso 210 mm (8.3 inches))', 'Cast aluminium single-sided swing arm with BMW Motorrad Paralever; WAD strut (travel-related damping), spring pre-load hydraulically adjustable (continuously', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 305 mm (12.0 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 275 mm (10.8 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-R19', '170/60-R17', 'Two cylinder boxer, four-stroke', 1170, 2, 4, 125, 7750, 125, 6500, '12.5:1', 101, 73, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 193, 4.3, 'Euro 3', 2255, 980, 1450, 1510, 890, NULL, 260, 229.1, 30),
