(183, 'bmw-r-1200-gs-adventure-triple-black-2012', 'ADVENTURE', 'Some journeys you can tell are going to be tough just by looking at the map - but the reality is always going to be tougher. And that´s where the new BMW R 1200 GS Adventure comes into its own. However far you have to go, whatever the terrain, this is a motorcycle that will never let you down', 'Two-section frame consisting of front and rear sections, load- bearing engine-gearbox unit', 'BMW Motorrad Telelever (curso 210 mm (8.3 inches))', 'Cast aluminium single-sided swing arm with BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 220 mm (8.7 inches))', 'Double disc. Optional integral ABS. Can be switched off Disco de 305 mm (12.0 inches)', 'Single disc. Optional integral ABS. Can be switched off Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '110/80-R19', '150/70-R17', 'Two cylinder boxer, two-stroke', 1170, 2, NULL, 110, 7750, 120, 6000, '12:1', 101, 73, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection/BMS-K digital engine management with overrun fuel cut-off, twin spark', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 193, 4.6, NULL, 2240, 915, 1450, 1510, 890, NULL, 256, 223, 33),
(184, 'bmw-r-1200-gs-adventure-triple-black-2016', 'ADVENTURE', 'A machine for those who want to test their limits and go beyond them. Or to put it briefly: A motorcycle for riders who are seeking real adventure and don´t want to miss out on a great deal of riding pleasure in the process', 'Two-section frame consisting of front and rear sections, load- bearing engine-gearbox unit', 'BMW Motorrad Telelever; stanchion diameter 37 mm, central spring strut (curso 210 mm (8.3 inches))', 'Cast aluminium single-sided swing arm with BMW Motorrad Paralever; WAD strut (travel-related damping), spring pre-load hydraulically adjustable (continuously', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 305 mm (12.0 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 275 mm (10.8 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-R19', '170/60-R17', 'Two cylinder boxer, four-stroke', 1170, 2, 4, 125, 7750, 125, 6500, '12.5:1', 101, 73, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 193, 4.3, 'Euro 3', 2255, 980, 1450, 1510, 890, NULL, 260, 229.1, 30),
(185, 'bmw-r-1200-gs-adventure-triple-black-2013', 'ADVENTURE', NULL, 'Two-section frame consisting of front and rear sections, load- bearing engine-gearbox unit', 'BMW Motorrad Telelever (curso 211 mm (8.3 inches))', 'Cast aluminium single-sided swing arm with BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 221 mm (8.7 inches))', 'Double disc. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers. Switchable ABS Disco de 305 mm (12.0 inches)', 'Single disc. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers. Switchable ABS Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '110/80-19', '150/70-17', 'Two cylinder boxer, two-stroke', 1170, 2, NULL, 110, 7750, 89, 6000, '12:1', 101, 73, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection / BMS-K+ digital engine management with overrun fuel cut-off, twin spark', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 201, NULL, 'Euro 3', 2235, 991, 1524, 1509, 889, NULL, 255.8, 229.1, 32.9),
(186, 'bmw-r-1200-gs-adventure-triple-black-2017', 'ADVENTURE', 'Conquer any type of terrain on an enduro which meets all your practical needs. Two standard-fitted ride modes – ´Rain´ and ´Road´ – are available at the press of a button and offer two completely different, finely tuned riding experiences. It´s like having two motorcycles in one', 'Two-section frame, front- and bolted on rear frame, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Telelever, front, stanchion diameter 37 mm (curso 210 mm (8.3 inches))', 'BMW Motrrad EVO Paralever, rear (curso 220 mm (8.7 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers Disco de 305 mm (12.0 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS Disco de 276 mm (10.9 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-R19', '170/60-R17', 'Twin, four-stroke', 1170, 2, 4, 125, 7750, 125, 6500, '12.5:1', 101, 73, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', NULL, NULL, 'Euro 4', 2255, 980, 1450, 1510, 890, NULL, 263, 229.1, 30),
(187, 'bmw-r-1200-gs-exclusive-2019', 'ADVENTURE', 'Wherever the journey takes you, the R 1200 GS is bound to draw attention. From the front to the back, the striking GS line style acknowledges its unquenchable thirst for adventure. High-quality design elements, attractive colors and styles make the new GS unmatched', 'Two-section frame, front- and bolted on rear frame, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Telelever (curso 190 mm (7.5 inches))', 'Cast aluminium single-sided swing arm with BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 200 mm (7.9 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 305 mm (12.0 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 276 mm (10.9 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-R19', '170/60-R17', 'Two cylinder boxer, four-stroke', 1170, 2, 4, 125, 7750, 125, 6500, '12.5:1', 101, 73, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 200, 4.96, 'Euro 4', 2207, 953, 1450, 1507, 850, NULL, 244, NULL, 20),
(188, 'bmw-r-1200-gs-exclusive-2018', 'ADVENTURE', 'The R 1200 GS has always been inspiring. The new model goes one better: both in terms of its touring suitability and off-road performance. Which means for you: increased comfort, dynamics and more fun. In short: yet more adventure', 'Two-section frame, front- and bolted on rear frame, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Telelever (curso 190 mm (7.5 inches))', 'Cast aluminium single-sided swing arm with BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 200 mm (7.9 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 305 mm (12.0 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 276 mm (10.9 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-R19', '170/60-R17', 'Two cylinder boxer, four-stroke', 1170, 2, 4, 125, 7750, 125, 6500, '12.5:1', 101, 73, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 200, 4.96, 'Euro 4', 2207, 953, 1450, 1507, 850, NULL, 244, NULL, 20),
(189, 'bmw-r-1200-gs-rallye-2013', 'ADVENTURE', 'The BMW R 1200 GS – the icon of all travel enduros. For 32 years “the GS” has been defining its segment and has proven to be the trusty companion on any motorcycle adventure. BMW Motorrad is now embarking on a new chapter of its success story and is yet again perfecting the iconic R 1200 GS', 'Two-section frame, bolted on rear frame, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Telelever (curso 191 mm (7.5 inches))', 'Cast aluminium single-sided swing arm with BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 201 mm (7.9 inches))', 'Double disc. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers. ABS Disco de 305 mm (12.0 inches)', 'Single disc. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers. ABS Disco de 276 mm (10.9 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-19', '170/60-17', 'Two cylinder boxer, two-stroke', 1170, 2, NULL, 123.4, 7750, 124.8, 6500, '12.5:1', 101, 73, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection / BMS-K+ digital engine management with electromotive throttle actuator', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 207, 4.13, 'Euro 3', 2210, 953, 1450, 1506, 851, NULL, 238.1, 205, 20.1),
(190, 'bmw-r-1200-gs-rallye-2017', 'ADVENTURE', 'The R 1200 GS is THE GS. It founded the dual-sport motorcycle segment – and is still leading it confidently today. The diversity – roads, cross-country, urban, countryside, comfort, performance – combined with the legendary robustness and the expertise from over 36 years of GS development result in a motorcycle which shies away from no competitors', 'Two-section frame, front- and bolted on rear frame, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Telelever (curso 190 mm (7.5 inches))', 'Cast aluminium single-sided swing arm with BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 200 mm (7.9 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 305 mm (12.0 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 276 mm (10.9 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-19', '170/60-17', 'Two cylinder boxer, two-stroke', 1170, 2, NULL, 125, 7750, 125, 6500, '12.5:1', 101, 73, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', NULL, NULL, 'Euro 4', 2207, 953, 1450, 1507, 850, NULL, 244, NULL, 20),
(191, 'bmw-r-1200-gs-rallye-2019', 'ADVENTURE', 'Wherever the journey takes you, the R 1200 GS is bound to draw attention. From the front to the back, the striking GS line style acknowledges its unquenchable thirst for adventure. High-quality design elements, attractive colors and styles make the new GS unmatched', 'Two-section frame, front- and bolted on rear frame, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Telelever (curso 190 mm (7.5 inches))', 'Cast aluminium single-sided swing arm with BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 200 mm (7.9 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 305 mm (12.0 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 276 mm (10.9 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-R19', '170/60-R17', 'Two cylinder boxer, four-stroke', 1170, 2, 4, 125, 7750, 125, 6500, '12.5:1', 101, 73, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 200, 4.96, 'Euro 4', 2207, 953, 1450, 1507, 850, NULL, 244, NULL, 20),
(192, 'bmw-r-1200-gs-rallye-2012', 'ADVENTURE', 'The versatility and sheer performance of the GS is partly due to the famous boxer engine which is at the heart of the awesome machine. Now updated with double over head cams, the motorcycle offers more torque at lower revs, improved responses and better acceleration across the rev range, making the bike even better both on and off-road', 'Two-section frame consisting of front and rear sections, load- bearing engine-gearbox unit', 'BMW Motorrad Telelever (curso 190 mm (7.5 inches))', 'Cast aluminium single-sided swing arm with BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 200 mm (7.9 inches))', 'Double disc. Optional integral ABS. Can be switched off Disco de 305 mm (12.0 inches)', 'Single disc. Optional integral ABS. Can be switched off Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '110/80-R19', '150/70-R17', 'Two cylinder boxer, two-stroke', 1170, 2, 4, 48, 7750, 120, 6000, '12:1', 101, 73, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection/BMS-K digital engine management with overrun fuel cut-off, twin spark', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 207, 4.3, 'Euro 3', 2210, 915, 1450, 1507, 850, NULL, 229, 203, 20),
