(194, 'bmw-r-1200-gs-triple-black-2016', 'ADVENTURE', 'The new R 1200 GS is ready for any terrain, thanks to the greater rigidity of its main frame and its enhanced Paralever and Telelever for even greater steering accuracy. The optional Dynamic ESA configures the suspension automatically to the terrain and load conditions', 'Twin-section frame, front- and bolted on rear frame,load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Telelever; stanchion diameter 37 mm, central spring strut (curso 190 mm (7.5 inches))', 'Cast aluminium single swingarm with BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 200 mm (7.9 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 305 mm (12.0 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 276 mm (10.9 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-R19', '170/60-R17', 'Two cylinder boxer, two-stroke', 1170, 2, 4, 125, 7750, 125, 6500, '12.5:1', 101, 73, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection/BMS-K digital engine management with electromotive throttle actuator', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 207, 4.1, 'Euro 3', 2210, 953, 1450, 1507, 850, NULL, 238, 205, 20),
