(205, 'bmw-r-1200-rt-2014', 'TOURING', 'Increased comfort for a greater sense of thrill. A motorcycle that defined the classic touring bike segment has now reached the next stage of evolution: the new BMW R 1200 RT. Whether on your own or with a passenger: the new R 1200 RT is all about comfortable, relaxed riding on every tour', 'Two-part tubular frame, engine partially load-bearing', 'Telelever (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Cast aluminium single swing arm with Paralever (curso 136 mm (5.4 inches))', 'Double disc. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 276 mm (10.9 inches)', NULL, '120/70-ZR17', '180/55-ZR17', 'Two cylinder boxer, four-stroke', 1170, 2, NULL, 125, 7750, 125, 6500, '12.5:1', 101, 73, 'Liquid', 'BMW engine management, BMS-K', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 201, 3.9, 'Euro 3', 2222, 985, 1415, 1485, 805, 155, 274, 233.2, 25),
(206, 'bmw-r-1250-gs-adventure-premium-2019', 'ADVENTURE', 'The new BMW R 1250 GS Adventure is built for your challenges. Rough routes, adverse conditions and the most remote destinations are no problem for the queen of travel enduros', 'Two-section frame, front- and bolted on rear frame, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Telelever (curso 210 mm (8.3 inches))', 'Cast aluminium single-sided swing arm with BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 220 mm (8.7 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 305 mm (12.0 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 276 mm (10.9 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-R19', '170/60-R17', 'Two cylinder boxer, four-stroke', 1254, 2, 4, 134.1, 7750, 143, 6250, '12.5:1', 102.5, 76, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 200, 4.7, 'Euro 4', 2270, 980, 1460, 1525, 890, NULL, 268, NULL, 30),
(207, 'bmw-r-1250-gs-adventure-premium-2020', 'ADVENTURE', 'The new BMW R 1250 GS Adventure is built for your challenges. Rough routes, adverse conditions and the most remote destinations are no problem for the king of travel enduros', 'Two-section frame, front- and bolted on rear frame, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Telelever (curso 210 mm (8.3 inches))', 'Cast aluminium single-sided swing arm with BMW Motorrad Paralever (curso 220 mm (8.7 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 305 mm (12.0 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 276 mm (10.9 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-R19', '170/60-R17', 'Two cylinder boxer, four-stroke', 1254, 2, 4, 134.1, 7750, 143, 6250, '12.5:1', 102.5, 76, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 200, 4.75, 'Euro 4', 2270, 980, 1460, 1504, 890, NULL, 268, NULL, 30),
(208, 'bmw-r-1250-gs-adventure-premium-40-anos-2021', 'ADVENTURE', 'The world is there to be discovered. There’s always something new. The R 1250 GS Adventure is the queen of the touring enduro It’s just made for impassable routes, adverse conditions and the most remote destinations. That is why we have further optimised the high standard of touring suitability and comfort. From driver assistance systems, lighting technology and advanced riding modes to a USB socket, the R 1250 GS Adventure offers you everything you need to explore unknown places', 'Two-section frame, front- and bolted on rear frame, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Telelever; stanchion diameter 37 mm, central spring strut (curso 210 mm (8.3 inches))', 'Cast aluminium single-sided swing arm with BMW Motorrad Paralever; WAD strut (travel-related damping), spring pre-load hydraulically adjustable (continuously', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 305 mm (12.0 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 276 mm (10.9 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-R19', '170/60-R17', 'Two cylinder boxer, four-stroke', 1254, 2, 4, 134.1, 7750, 143, 6250, '12.5:1', 102.5, 76, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 200, 4.75, 'Euro 5', 2270, 980, 1460, 1504, 890, NULL, 268, NULL, 30),
(209, 'bmw-r-1250-gs-adventure-premium-40-anos-2023', 'ADVENTURE', 'The R 1250 GS Adventure is at home in the world. No destination is too far for it, no underground is alien to it. On the road, off-road and back again. Even if you don´t know what terrain to expect along the way, you can rely on your bike down to the smallest detail. With the R 1250 GS Adventure, you can now enjoy long distances even more intensely', 'Two-section frame, front- and bolted on rear frame, load-bearing engine', 'BMW Motorrad Telelever; stanchion diameter 37 mm, central spring strut (curso 210 mm (8.3 inches))', 'Cast aluminium single-sided swing arm with BMW Motorrad Paralever; WAD strut (travel-related damping), spring pre-load hydraulically adjustable (continuously', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 305 mm (12.0 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 276 mm (10.9 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-R19', '170/60-R17', 'Two cylinder boxer, four-stroke', 1254, 2, 4, 136, 7750, 143, 6500, '12.5:1', 102.5, 76, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 193, 4.75, 'Euro 5', 2207, 953, 1430, 1504, 890, NULL, 268.1, NULL, 29.9),
