(262, 'bmw-r-12-719-2025', 'CRUISER', 'You don´t have to dream of California. This cruiser brings this unique vibe right to your doorstep. Its low seat height invites you to hop on immediately. As a road surfer, you might want to give your ears some fitting music to listen to', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1170, NULL, NULL, 95, NULL, 109.8, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 203, 4.96, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1519, NULL, NULL, 226.8, NULL, 14),
(263, 'bmw-r-12-cruiser-2025', 'CRUISER', 'With its comprehensive standard equipment, the R 12 S lets you relive the spirit of the 1970s with its aesthetic, while enjoying state-of-the-art technology. Of course, the iconic bike is also powered by the legendary boxer engine, which has been thrilling fans with its punch for decades. You can find out everything about the extensive technical equipment of the #Soulfuel bike on this page', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1170, NULL, NULL, 109, NULL, 109.8, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 216, 4.96, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1519, NULL, NULL, 220, NULL, 15.9),
