(307, 'bmw-r-18-2025', 'CRUISER', 'Timeless beauty: the BMW R 18. An icon that keeps reinventing itself. It combines exclusivity with quintessential coolness. Here, classic design meets uncompromising modernity', 'Double-cradle steel', 'Telescopic fork (curso 119 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Steel swingarm with central shock strut (curso 89 mm (3.5 inches))', 'Double disc. 4 piston fixed calipers. ABS Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. 4 piston fixed calipers. ABS Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-R19', '180/65-B16', 'Two cylinder boxer, four-stroke', 1802, 2, 4, 91, NULL, 162.7, NULL, '9.6:1', 107.1, 100, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe fuel injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 179, 2.12, NULL, 2441, 965, 1125, 1730, 691, NULL, 345, NULL, 16),
(308, 'bmw-r-18-2024', 'CRUISER', 'The flyline is elongated and low. The double-cradle steel frame covers the powerful, sculpted engine that underlines the impressive presence of the bike. Riders also have a number of custom equipment options: the R 18 is scaled back to its core to allow for full customization', 'Double-cradle steel', 'Telescopic fork (curso 119 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Steel swingarm with central shock strut (curso 89 mm (3.5 inches))', 'Double disc. 4 piston fixed calipers. ABS Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. 4 piston fixed calipers. ABS Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-R19', '180/65-B16', 'Two cylinder boxer, four-stroke', 1802, 2, 4, 91, NULL, 158, NULL, '9.6:1', 107.1, 100, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe fuel injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 179, NULL, NULL, 2441, 965, 1125, 1730, 691, NULL, 345.2, 345.2, 16),
(309, 'bmw-r-18-2023', 'CRUISER', 'We have counted on the boxer since 1923 with conviction. The 1,802 cc two-cylinder boxer engine of the R 18 is the highest displacement boxer that BMW has ever built. It delivers a maximum torque of 116 lbs-ft at 3,000 rpm. At 4,750 rpm, the Big Boxer delivers 91 hp combining its core tradition with modern technology for pure emotion on the road', 'Double-cradle steel', 'Telescopic fork (curso 119 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Steel swingarm with central shock strut (curso 89 mm (3.5 inches))', 'Double disc. 4 piston fixed calipers. ABS Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. 4 piston fixed calipers. ABS Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-R19', '180/65-B16', 'Two cylinder boxer, four-stroke', 1802, 2, 4, 91, 4750, 157.3, 3000, '9.6:1', 107.1, 100, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe fuel injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 179, NULL, NULL, 2441, 965, 1125, 1730, 691, NULL, 345.2, 345.2, 16),
(310, 'bmw-r-18-100-anos-2024', 'CRUISER', 'The flyline is elongated and low. The double-cradle steel frame covers the powerful, sculpted engine that underlines the impressive presence of the bike. Riders also have a number of custom equipment options: the R 18 is scaled back to its core to allow for full customization', 'Double-cradle steel', 'Telescopic fork (curso 119 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Steel swingarm with central shock strut (curso 89 mm (3.5 inches))', 'Double disc. 4 piston fixed calipers. ABS Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. 4 piston fixed calipers. ABS Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-R19', '180/65-B16', 'Two cylinder boxer, four-stroke', 1802, 2, 4, 91, NULL, 158, NULL, '9.6:1', 107.1, 100, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe fuel injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', 179, NULL, NULL, 2441, 965, 1125, 1730, 691, NULL, 345.2, 345.2, 16),
(311, 'bmw-s-1000-r-2019', 'NAKED', 'Emotional roadster visuals paired with super-sporty riding dynamics – this is what the BMW S 1000 R stands for. Reduced down to the essentials, it is a signal for offensive dynamism', 'Aluminium composite bridge frame, partially self-supporting engine', 'Upside-down telescopic fork 46 mm, compression and rebound stage adjustable (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Aluminium 2-sided swing arm, rebound damping adjustable (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 999, 4, 4, 162.3, 11000, 114, 9250, '12.1:1', 80, 49.7, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. Electronic injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, 6.7, 'Euro 4', 2050, 845, 1228, 1439, 814, NULL, 205, 178, 17.5),
(312, 'bmw-s-1000-r-2014', 'SPORT', 'A roadster, reduced to the essentials: maximum performance of 160 bhp (118 kW), 112 Nm torque and a power-to-weight ratio of 1.29 kilograms per bhp - and the competition disappears in the rear mirror. Like its superbike predecessor, the S 1000 R sets the benchmark in its segment', 'Aluminium composite frame, partially self supporting engine', 'Upside down telescopic fork and empty (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Aluminium dual swing arm, adjustable rear suspension (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Double disc. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', NULL, '3.50-17', '6.00-17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 999, 4, NULL, 163, 11000, 112, 9250, '12:1', 80, 49.7, 'Liquid', 'Electronic fuel injection, digital motor electronics BMS-KP', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 201, 5.4, 'Euro 3', 2057, 845, 1138, 1439, 814, NULL, 207, 178, 17.5),
(313, 'bmw-s-1000-r-2017', 'SPORT', 'Stripped down to the essential, but maximized for pure riding fun. Its aggressive engine with 165 hp/121 kW will put a smile on your face every time it revs up', 'Aluminium composite bridge frame, partially self-supporting engine', 'Upside-down telescopic fork 46 mm, compression and rebound stage adjustable (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Aluminium 2-sided swing arm, rebound damping adjustable (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-17', '190/55-17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 999, 4, 4, 160, 11000, 114, 9250, '12.1:1', 80, 49.7, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. Electronic injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, 'Euro 4', 2057, 845, 1138, 1439, 814, NULL, 205, 178, 17.5),
(314, 'bmw-s-1000-r-2021', 'NAKED', 'If your heartbeat races in proportion to the tachometer, then the S 1000 R is the Roadster for you. It’s stripped down to the essentials but maximized for pure riding pleasure. Its aggressive engine with its 165 hp will put a smile on your face every time it revs up. The rich sound of the new standard HP titanium rear exhaust leaves no doubt: That´s how life in the fast lane sounds', 'Aluminium composite bridge frame, partially self-supporting engine', 'Upside-down telescopic fork 46 mm, compression and rebound stage adjustable (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Aluminium 2-sided swing arm, rebound damping adjustable (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 999, 4, 4, 165, 11000, 114, 9250, '12.1:1', 80, 49.7, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic fuel injection with ride-by-wire throttle system and knock sensor', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 201, 6.7, 'Euro 4', 2057, 845, 1228, 1439, 814, NULL, 205, 178, 17.5),
(315, 'bmw-s-1000-r-2015', 'SPORT', 'The high-performance 4-cylinder in-line engine derives from the RR and was optimised for the purpose of the comparison. The result: extremely linear torque delivery for constant forward propulsion across the entire engine speed range', 'Aluminium composite frame, partially self supporting engine', 'Upside down telescopic fork and empty (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Aluminium dual swing arm, adjustable rear suspension (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 999, 4, NULL, 160, 11000, 112, 9250, '12:1', 80, 49.7, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection/digital engine management including knock sensor (BMS-K-P)', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 200, 5.4, 'Euro 3', 2057, 845, 1138, 1439, 814, NULL, 207, 178, 17.5),
(316, 'bmw-s-1000-r-2018', 'NAKED', 'Is your heartbeat connected directly to the tachometer? Then the S 1000 R is the Roadster for you – stripped down to the essentials, but maximising pure riding pleasure', 'Aluminium composite bridge frame, partially self-supporting engine', 'Upside-down telescopic fork 46 mm, compression and rebound stage adjustable (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Aluminium 2-sided swing arm, rebound damping adjustable (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 999, 4, 4, 165, 11000, 114, 9250, '12.1:1', 80, 49.7, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. Electronic injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, 6.7, 'Euro 4', 2057, 845, 1138, 1439, 814, NULL, 205, 178, 17.5),
(317, 'bmw-s-1000-r-2016', 'SPORT', 'The lines of the S 1000 R are striking at first sight, too: aggressive tail-up/nose-down design, distinctive split face and the characteristic gills. The ´R´ shows much less of its sharp-edged, muscular skin. Some people call it naked - we just call it focused on the essentials', 'Aluminium composite frame, partially self supporting engine', 'Upside down telescopic fork and empty (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Aluminium dual swing arm, adjustable rear suspension (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 999, 4, NULL, 160, 11000, 112, 9250, '12:1', 80, 49.7, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection/digital engine management including knock sensor (BMS-K-P)', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 200, 5.4, 'Euro 3', 2057, 845, 1138, 1439, 814, NULL, 207, 178, 17.5),
(318, 'bmw-s-1000-r-2020', 'NAKED', 'Emotional roadster visuals paired with super-sporty riding dynamics – this is what the BMW S 1000 R stands for. Reduced down to the essentials, it is a signal for dynamism. Its close resemblance to the RR is apparent at first glance. Find out about all the technical data and standard equipment here', 'Aluminium composite bridge frame, partially self-supporting engine', 'Upside-down telescopic fork 46 mm, compression and rebound stage adjustable (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Aluminium 2-sided swing arm, rebound damping adjustable (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 999, 4, 4, 165, 11000, 114, 9250, '12.1:1', 80, 49.7, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 201, 6.7, 'Euro 4', 2057, 845, 1228, 1439, 814, NULL, 205, 178, 17.5),
(319, 'bmw-s-1000-rr-2020', 'SPORT', 'Ten years after the first generation of the RR first mesmerized the world of motorcycles, we´re now entering the next level of performance. We have updated almost every component of the RR - from the front to the rear. The result: less weight and noticeably higher performance. Are you ready for the pole position and for victory? The RR awaits you', 'Aluminium composite bridge frame, partially self-supporting engine', 'Upside-down telescopic fork 46 mm, compression and rebound stage adjustable, (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'WSBK Aluminium swing arm, full floater pro, compression and rebound damping adjustable, adjustable preload (curso 117 mm (4.6 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 999, 4, 4, 205, 13500, 112.6, 11000, '13.3:1', 80, 49.7, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic fuel injection with ride-by-wire throttle system, variable intake, and knock sensor', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 200, 6.36, 'Euro 4', 2073, 848, 1151, 1441, 823, NULL, 197, 175, 16.5),
(320, 'bmw-s-1000-rr-2012', 'SPORT', 'The S 1000 RR’s first year in production revolutionised the super-sport market, out performing the more conventional competition which has dominated the market for the past decade. This makes it even more exciting to be able to say that the adrenaline filled 193bhp of sheer excitement, is now more affordable than ever before', 'Bridge-type frame, cast aluminium, load-bearing engine', '46 mm Upside-down fork, rebound and compression adjustable (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Cast aluminium swing arm, Continuously adjustable rear inbound-rebound damping, high and low speed (curso 130 mm (5.1 inches))', 'Double disc. Race ABS. Can be switched off Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. Race ABS. Can be switched off Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 999, 4, 4, 190.4, 13000, 112, 9750, '13:1', 80, 49.7, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection/digital engine management including knock sensor (BMS-K-P)', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 299, 5.7, 'Euro 4', 2056, 826, 1138, 1432, 820, NULL, 202, 178, 17.5),
(321, 'bmw-s-1000-rr-2014', 'SPORT', 'In the S 1000 RR, BMW present the most enhanced, dynamic and adrenaline fuelled motorcycle in the range. The RR Sport takes super sport riding to the next level, with performance enhancing features to fuel the passion of even the most demanding of track riders', 'Bridge-type frame, cast aluminium, load-bearing engine', 'Upside down telescopic fork and empty (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Ast aluminium swing arm, Continuously adjustable rear inbound-rebound damping, high and low speed (curso 130 mm (5.1 inches))', 'Double disc. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers. ABS Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper. ABS Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 999, 4, NULL, 193, 13000, 112, 9750, '13:1', 80, 49.7, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic intake pipe injection/digital engine management including knock sensor (BMS-K-P)', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 201, 5.4, 'Euro 3', 2056, 845, 1138, 1432, 814, NULL, 202, 178, 17.5),
(322, 'bmw-s-1000-rr-2025', 'SPORT', 'The superbike provides a dynamic riding experience and is always on the hunt for the last millisecond. Every detail is geared towards uncompromising performance. You can find out everything about the extensive technical equipment on this page. You can also see the optional equipment for the S 1000 RR', 'Aluminium composite bridge frame, partially self-supporting engine', 'Upside-down telescopic fork 46 mm, compression and rebound stage adjustable (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Aluminium swing arm, full floater pro, compression and rebound damping adjustable, adjustable preload (curso 117 mm (4.6 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 999, 4, 4, 205, NULL, 112.6, NULL, '13.3:1', 80, 49.7, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic injection, variable intake pibe', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 303, NULL, NULL, 2073, 848, 1151, 1455, 833, NULL, 175, 175, 16.5),
(323, 'bmw-s-1000-rr-2018', 'SPORT', 'Now the S 1000 RR comes with DTC Dynamic Traction Control as standard for even greater driving dynamics and road safety. As a result the S 1000 RR remains a thoroughbred among sport bikes – whether on the road or on the racing circuit', 'Bridge-type aluminium frame with load-bearing engine', 'Upside-down telescopic fork 46 mm, compression and rebound stage adjustable, (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Aluminium double-sided swing-arm, central spring strut, adjustable rebound and compression-stage damping (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 999, 4, NULL, 199, 13500, 113, 10500, '13:1', 80, 49.7, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. Electronic injection, variable intake pipe', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, 'Euro 4', 2050, 826, 1140, 1438, 815, NULL, 208, 179.5, 17.5),
(324, 'bmw-s-1000-rr-2019', 'SPORT', 'The BMW S 1000 RR plays by its own rules: appearance here always means pure performance. Dynamic stands for the purest form of racing sport and riding pleasure. Added to this is the constant balance between reason and unreasonableness', 'Aluminium composite bridge frame, partially self-supporting engine', 'Upside-down telescopic fork 46 mm, compression and rebound stage adjustable, (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Aluminium double-sided swing-arm, central spring strut, adjustable rebound and compression-stage damping (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 999, 4, NULL, 199, 13500, 113, 10500, '13:1', 80, 49.7, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. Electronic injection, variable intake pipe', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 200, 6.7, 'Euro 4', 2050, 826, 1140, 1438, 815, NULL, 208, 179.5, 17.5),
(325, 'bmw-s-1000-rr-2013', 'SPORT', 'When we build a superbike, we have no time for second best. Presenting the very latest in racing power, the 2013 S 1000 RR. With an aluminum bridge-type frame, radial brakes, a super sporty tail-up nose-down design, hot colors and the ultimate combination of electronic rider assistance. The RR includes four riding modes that adjust power delivery, throttle response, Race ABS action and even Dynamic Traction Control (optional equipment)', 'Aluminum composite bridge frame, partially self-supporting engine', 'Upside-down telescopic fork 46 mm, compression and rebound stage adjustable (curso 119 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Aluminum 2-sided swing arm, compression and rebound damping, high and low speed adjustable (curso 130 mm (5.1 inches))', 'Double disc. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers. ABS Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper. ABS Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-17', '190/55-17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 999, 4, 4, 193, 13000, 112, 9750, '13:1', 80, 49.7, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. Electronic injection, digital engine electronics with integrated knock control (BMS-KP)', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 193, NULL, 'Euro 3', 2056, 826, 1138, 1422, 820, NULL, 204.6, 180.5, 17.4),
(326, 'bmw-s-1000-rr-2016', 'SPORT', 'The RR is the epitome of a superbike - and that applies to its design, too. Now in its third generation, you can instantly see its increased power. The profile is razor-sharp and extremely clear, the volume of the contours and shapes perfectly balanced', 'Aluminium composite bridge frame, partially self-supporting engine', 'Upside-down telescopic fork 46 mm, compression and rebound stage adjustable (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Aluminium 2-sided swing arm, compression and rebound damping adjustable (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Double disc. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', NULL, '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 999, 4, 4, 199, 13500, 113, 10500, '13:1', 80, 49.7, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. Electronic injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 201, 5.7, NULL, 2050, 826, 1138, 1425, 815, NULL, 204, 175.5, 17.5),
(327, 'bmw-s-1000-rr-2021', 'SPORT', 'Anyone who looks at it immediately understands that this is a high performance motorcycle. Every part of the RR has been designed to get the most out of it. Take, for instance, the frame layout with its new suspension technology that makes the RR lighter and more precise. In addition, there is the ergonomically focused seating position, which is unrivaled thanks to the modified frame and fairing design', 'Aluminium composite bridge frame, partially self-supporting engine', 'Upside-down telescopic fork 46 mm, compression and rebound stage adjustable, (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'WSBK Aluminium swing arm, full floater pro, compression and rebound damping adjustable, adjustable preload (curso 117 mm (4.6 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 999, 4, 4, 205, 13000, 112.6, 11000, '13.3:1', 80, 49.7, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic fuel injection with ride-by-wire throttle system, variable intake, and knock sensor', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 201, 6.36, 'Euro 4', 2073, 848, 1151, 1441, 823, NULL, 197, 175, 16.5),
(328, 'bmw-s-1000-rr-2015', 'SPORT', 'The S 1000 RR revolutionised the supersports class when it first came out in 2009. Now - six years later - it steps up to the very same challenge. The S 1000 RR model year 2015 has been completely revised: BMW Motorrad engineers have entirely reconceived the bike´s technology, design and fittings. The result: in its origins a genuine Double R, on the road a new supersports machine', 'Aluminium composite bridge frame, partially self-supporting engine', 'Upside-down telescopic fork 46 mm, compression and rebound stage adjustable (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Aluminium 2-sided swing arm, compression and rebound damping adjustable (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Double disc. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', NULL, '120/70-17', '190/55-17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 999, 4, 4, 195.8, 13500, 113, 10500, '13:1', 80, 49.7, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. Electronic injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 299, 5.7, NULL, 2050, 826, 1138, 1425, 815, NULL, 204, 175.5, 17.5),
(329, 'bmw-s-1000-rr-2023', 'SPORT', 'It’s hard to imagine the race track without it – and the RR is also intrinsically linked to it', 'Aluminium composite bridge frame, partially self-supporting engine', 'Upside-down telescopic fork 46 mm, compression and rebound stage adjustable (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Aluminium swing arm, full floater pro, compression and rebound damping adjustable, adjustable preload (curso 117 mm (4.6 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 999, 4, 4, 205, 13000, 112.6, 11000, '13.3:1', 80, 49.7, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic injection, variable intake pibe', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 303, NULL, NULL, 2073, 848, 1151, 1455, 833, NULL, 196.9, 175, 16.5),
(330, 'bmw-s-1000-rr-2022', 'SPORT', 'Always pushing to the limit and in search of the ideal line, you´ve got 205 HP beneath you. Unbridled power pushes your RR to the max - with a maximum torque of 83 lb-ft at 11,000 rpm and a torque curve of at least 74 lb-ft over a range of 5,500 to 14,500 [rpm]', 'Aluminium composite bridge frame, partially self-supporting engine', 'Upside-down telescopic fork 46 mm, compression and rebound stage adjustable (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'WSBK Aluminium swing arm, full floater pro, compression and rebound damping adjustable, adjustable preload (curso 117 mm (4.6 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 999, 4, 4, 205, 13000, 112.6, 11000, '13.3:1', 80, 49.7, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic fuel injection with ride-by-wire throttle system, variable intake, and knock sensor', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 298, NULL, 'Euro 4', 2073, 848, 1151, 1441, 823, NULL, 196.9, NULL, 16.5),
(331, 'bmw-s-1000-rr-2026', 'SPORT', 'The superbike provides a dynamic riding experience and is always on the hunt for the last millisecond. Every detail is geared towards uncompromising performance. You can find out everything about the extensive technical equipment on this page. You can also see the optional equipment for the S 1000 RR', 'Aluminium composite bridge frame, partially self-supporting engine', 'Upside-down telescopic fork 46 mm, compression and rebound stage adjustable (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Aluminium swing arm, full floater pro, compression and rebound damping adjustable, adjustable preload (curso 117 mm (4.6 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 999, 4, 4, 205, NULL, 112.6, NULL, '13.3:1', 80, 49.7, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic injection, variable intake pibe', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 303, NULL, NULL, 2073, 848, 1151, 1455, 833, NULL, 175, 175, 16.5),
(332, 'bmw-s-1000-rr-2017', 'SPORT', 'The razor-sharp flyline gives it a look of extreme clarity, its contours and shapes complementing each other superbly. It radiates a love of straights and bends from the front to the rear and its hunger for high-level performance is plain to see. The RR shares a desire for pure acceleration and speed with you', 'Aluminium composite bridge frame, partially self-supporting engine', 'Upside-down telescopic fork 46 mm, compression and rebound stage adjustable, (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Aluminium 2-sided swing arm, compression and rebound damping adjustable, adjustable (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-17', '190/55-17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 999, 4, NULL, 195.8, 12500, 113, 10500, '13:1', 80, 49.7, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. Electronic injection, variable intake pipe', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, 'Euro 4', 2050, 826, 1138, 1438, 815, NULL, 208, NULL, 17.5),
