(354, 'brp-can-am-defender-650-dps-hd7-4x4-utv-2025', 'OFF_ROAD', 'The Outlander PRO HD7 offers more class-leading features than any other ATV, including horsepower, torque, towing capacity, and storage. Throw in a utility-calibrated suspension, more protection, and 3,000-mile maintenance intervals, and the Outlander PRO offers more value than ever', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 650, NULL, NULL, 50, NULL, 55.6, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1346, NULL, NULL, 363, NULL, 19.3),
