(635, 'ducati-1199-panigale-2012', 'SPORT', 'The 1199 Panigale sets the most extreme benchmark ever and its arrival represents one of the most historic moments in Ducati’s incredible Superbike history', 'Monocoque aluminum', 'Marzocchi 50mm pressurized and fully adjustable usd fork with hard anodized aluminum lightweight slider', 'Fully adjustable Sachs unit', 'Double disc. Semi-floating discs, radially mounted Brembo Monobloc M50 4-piston callipers ABS optional +2.5kg (+5.5lb) Disco de 330 mm (13.0 inches)', 'Single disc. 2-piston calliper Disco de 245 mm (9.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-17', '180/55-17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1198, 2, 4, 195, 10750, 133, 9000, NULL, 112, 60.8, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Marelli electronic fuel injection, elliptical throttle bodies', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, 'Euro 3', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1430, NULL, NULL, 188, 164, 17),
(636, 'ducati-1199-panigale-2015', 'SPORT', 'The new Superquadro 195 HP engine is exquisitely incorporated into the monocoque chassis. Engineering solutions marked by an innovation in details have been implemented to take the dry weight down to an incredible 164 kg. Ducati styling inside and out is further enhanced by the most exclusive components', 'Monocoque Aluminium', 'Marzocchi 50mm pressurized and fully adjustable usd fork with hard anodized aluminum lightweight slider', 'Fully adjustable Sachs unit. Adjustable linkage: Progressive/flat. Aluminum single-sided swingarm', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 330 mm (13.0 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 245 mm (9.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '200/55-ZR17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1198, 2, 4, 195, 10750, 132, 9000, '12.5:1', 112, 60.8, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Mitsubishi electronic fuel injection system. Twin injectors per cylinder. Full ride-by-wire elliptical', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, 'Euro 3', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1437, 825, NULL, 190.5, 166.5, 17),
(637, 'ducati-1199-panigale-2013', 'SPORT', 'Supreme performance, superlative technology, magnetic personality, enthralling design: on track or on road there´s nothing to beat the 1199 Panigale', 'Monocoque Aluminium', 'Marzocchi 50mm pressurized and fully adjustable usd fork with hard anodized aluminum lightweight slider', 'Fully adjustable Sachs unit. Adjustable linkage: Progressive/flat. Aluminum single-sided swingarm', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 330 mm (13.0 inches)', 'Single disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 245 mm (9.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '200/55-ZR17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1198, 2, 4, 191.8, 10750, 132, 9000, '12.5:1', 112, 60.8, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Mitsubishi electronic fuel injection system. Twin injectors per cylinder. Full ride-by-wire elliptical', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, 'Euro 3', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1437, 825, NULL, 188, 164, 17),
