(647, 'ducati-1199-panigale-s-tricolore-2013', 'SPORT', 'In perfect keeping with tradition,the 1199 Panigale S is decked out in a Tricolour livery to celebrate ´Made in Borgo Panigale´ techological excellence and mark the start of a new Ducati Superbike era. Completing the bike set-up are the Ducati performance exhaust, ABs and a device that has already gainedcult status: the all new telemetry, housed in the latest-generation DDA+, which also utilises GPS signals', 'Monocoque Aluminium', 'Ohlins NIX30 43mm with TiN, fully adjustable usd fork. Electronic compression and rebound damping adjustment', 'Fully adjustable Ohlins TTX36 unit. Electronic compression and rebound damping adjustment. Adjustable linkage: Progressive/flat. Aluminum single-sided swingarm', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 330 mm (13.0 inches)', 'Single disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 245 mm (9.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '200/55-ZR17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1198, 2, 4, 195, 10750, 133, 9000, '12.5:1', 112, 60.8, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Mitsubishi electronic fuel injection system. Twin injectors per cylinder. Full ride-by-wire elliptical', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1437, 825, NULL, 188, 166.5, 17),
(648, 'ducati-1199-panigale-s-tricolore-2012', 'SPORT', NULL, 'Monocoque aluminium', 'Öhlins NIX30 43mm with TiN, fully adjustable usd fork. Electronic compression and rebound damping adjustment', 'Fully adjustable Ohlins TTX36 unit. Electronic compression and rebound damping adjustment. Adjustable linkage: Progressive/flat. Aluminum single-sided swingarm', 'Double disc. Semi-floating discs, radially mounted Brembo Monobloc M50 4-piston callipers. ABS Disco de 330 mm (13.0 inches)', 'Single disc. 2-piston calliper. ABS Disco de 245 mm (9.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '200/55-ZR17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1198, 2, 4, 195, 10750, 132, 9000, '12.5:1', 112, 60.8, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Mitsubishi electronic fuel injection system. Twin injectors per cylinder. Full ride-by-wire elliptical', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, 'Euro 3', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1437, 825, NULL, 190, 166, 17),
(649, 'ducati-1199-superleggera-2014', 'NAKED', 'The 1199 Superleggera is the most exclusive and extreme Ducati ever made. An unprecedented 200+ horsepower in homologated configuration (205+ with included racing exhaust) and a 166Kg weight ready-to-ride without gas (around the same as a Superbike in full racing trim) give it the best, by far, power to weight ratio of any homologated motorcycle', 'Monocoque in magnesium alloy', 'Fully adjustable 43mm USD Öhlins FL 916 fork with TiN treatment, billet fork bottoms and lightweight stress-optimized outer tubes (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Fully adjustable single Öhlins TTX36 shock with titanium spring, with linkage adjustable between progressive/flat. Aluminium single-sided swingarm. Adjustable', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 330 mm (13.0 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 245 mm (9.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '200/55-ZR17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1198, 2, 4, 200, 11500, 134, 10200, '12.5:1', 106, 67.9, 'Liquid', 'Injection. 53mm throttle bodies with full Ride by Wire', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1511, 830, NULL, 177, 155, 17),
(650, 'ducati-1299-panigale-2018', 'SPORT', 'Breathtakingly stylish, the new 1299 Panigale leaves no room for compromise when it comes to technical excellence. Such is the case of the new Superquadro engine with an unprecedented 116mm bore. 205 hp* of pure adrenaline, 145 Nm of stunning torque', 'Monocoque Aluminium', 'Marzocchi 50mm pressurized and fully adjustable usd fork with hard anodized aluminum lightweight slider (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Fully adjustable Sachs unit. Adjustable linkage: Progressive/flat. Aluminum single-sided swingarm (curso 130 mm (5.1 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 330 mm (13.0 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 245 mm (9.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '200/55-ZR17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1285, 2, 4, 205, 10500, 144.6, 8750, '12.5:1', 116, 60.8, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Twin injectors per cylinder. Full ride-by-wire elliptical throttle bodies', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, 'Euro 3', 2070, 745, 1105, 1437, 830, NULL, 190.5, 166.5, 17),
(651, 'ducati-1299-panigale-2017', 'SPORT', 'Breathtakingly stylish, the new 1299 Panigale leaves no room for compromise when it comes to technical excellence. Such is the case of the new Superquadro engine with an unprecedented 116mm bore. 205 hp* of pure adrenaline, 145 Nm of stunning torque', 'Monocoque Aluminium', 'Marzocchi 50mm pressurized and fully adjustable usd fork with hard anodized aluminum lightweight slider (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Fully adjustable Sachs unit. Adjustable linkage: Progressive/flat. Aluminum single-sided swingarm (curso 130 mm (5.1 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 330 mm (13.0 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 245 mm (9.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '200/55-ZR17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1285, 2, 4, 205, 10500, 144.6, 8750, '12.5:1', 116, 60.8, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Twin injectors per cylinder. Full ride-by-wire elliptical throttle bodies', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, 'Euro 3', 2070, 745, 1105, 1437, 830, NULL, 190.5, 166.5, 17),
(652, 'ducati-1299-panigale-2016', 'SPORT', 'The opening and closing of throttle butterflies on the Superquadro is controlled by a fully electronic Ride-by-Wire system. The absence of a mechanical connection between the twistgrip and the throttle bodies allows the engine ECU to regulate power delivery by directly adjusting the throttle; Ride-by-Wire makes it possible to have different power and delivery based on the selected Riding Mode, to alter the level of engine back-torque (EBC), and to control any slipping of the rear wheel (DTC)', 'Monocoque Aluminium', 'Marzocchi 50mm pressurized and fully adjustable usd fork with hard anodized aluminum lightweight slider (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Fully adjustable Sachs unit. Adjustable linkage: Progressive/flat. Aluminum single-sided swingarm (curso 130 mm (5.1 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 330 mm (13.0 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 245 mm (9.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '200/55-ZR17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1285, 2, 4, 205, 10500, 144.6, 8750, '12.5:1', 116, 60.8, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Twin injectors per cylinder. Full ride-by-wire elliptical throttle bodies', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, 'Euro 3', 2070, 745, 1105, 1437, 830, NULL, 190.5, 166.5, 17),
(653, 'ducati-1299-panigale-s-2016', 'SPORT', 'The new Superquadro engine is ingeniously incorporated into the Monoscocca chassis, providing the perfect platform from which to deliver its incredible 205 horsepower. The underside of the fuel tank, when mounted, seals the top of the frame which then becomes the airbox. Innovative engineering solutions such as these are used throughout the Panigale line, and take the dry weight of the 1299 Panigale/S down to 166.5 kg while the Panigale R sits at an incredible 162 kg', 'Monocoque Aluminium', 'Öhlins NIX30 43mm fully adjustable USD fork with TiN treatment. Electronic compression and rebound damping adjustment with semi-active mode (curso 120 mm (4.7', 'Fully adjustable Ohlins TTX36 unit. Electronic compression and rebound damping adjustment with semi-active mode. Adjustable linkage: Progressive/flat. Aluminium', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 330 mm (13.0 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 245 mm (9.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '200/55-ZR17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1285, 2, 4, 205, 10500, 144.6, 8750, '12.6:1', 116, 60.8, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Twin injectors per cylinder. Full ride-by-wire elliptical throttle bodies', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, 'Euro 3', 2070, 745, 1105, 1437, 830, NULL, 190.5, 166.5, 17),
