(681, 'ducati-diavel-1198-carbon-2011', 'NAKED', 'Within milliseconds, DTC is able to detect and control rear wheel-spin, considerably increasing the bike’s active safety and performance', 'Tubular steel Trellis frame', 'Marzocchi DLC coated 50mm fully adjustable usd forks (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Progressive linkage with fully adjustable Sachs monoshock. Aluminium single-sided swingarm (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Double disc. Brembo callipers, 4-piston with ABS Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. 2-piston floating calliper with ABS Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '240/45-ZR17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1198, 2, NULL, 162, 9500, 127.5, 8000, '11.5:1', 106, 67.9, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Mitsubishi electronic fuel injection system, Mikuni elliptical throttle bodies with RbW', '6-speed', 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1590, 770, NULL, 207, 207, 17),
