(683, 'ducati-diavel-1198-carbon-2012', 'NAKED', 'Machine finished forged aluminium Marchesini wheels, reducing weight to 207 kg. Marzocchi forks with diamond-like coating (DLC). Brake disc carriers in milled aluminium. Carbon fibre fairing and black accessories', 'Tubular steel Trellis frame', 'Marzocchi 50mm fully adjustable usd forks (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Progressive linkage with fully adjustable Sachs monoshock. Aluminium single-sided swingarm (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Double disc. Brembo callipers, 4-piston with ABS Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. 2-piston floating calliper with ABS Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '240/45-ZR17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1198, 2, 4, 162, 9500, 127.5, 8000, '11.5:1', 106, 67.9, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Mitsubishi electronic fuel injection system, Mikuni elliptical throttle bodies with RbW', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, 'Euro 3', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1590, 770, NULL, 210, 210, 17),
(684, 'ducati-diavel-1198-carbon-2015', 'NAKED', 'The Diavel Carbon exemplifies the distinctive style and sporty soul of the Diavel with high-quality, light-weight components. Clad with carbon fiber and Marchesini forged wheels, weight is reduced to just 205 kg, only further enhancing the performance of this extraordinary motorcycle', 'Tubular steel Trellis frame', 'Marzocchi DLC coated 50mm fully adjustable usd forks (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Progressive linkage with fully adjustable Sachs monoshock. Remote spring preload adjustment. Aluminium single-sided swingarm (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '240/45-ZR17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1198, 2, 4, 162, 9250, 130.5, 8000, '12.5:1', 106, 67.9, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Elliptical throttle bodies, fully ride-by-wire controlled', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, 'Euro 3', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1590, 770, NULL, 234, 205, 17),
(685, 'ducati-diavel-1198-carbon-2014', 'NAKED', 'The Ride-by-Wire (RbW) system is an electronic interface between the Diavel’s twistgrip and engine, which configures an ideal power response depending on the riding mode selected. The twistgrip no longer has a throttle cable connected directly to the throttle body butterflies, but instead delivers a signal to a control unit, which in turn operates the butterfly opening electronically', 'Tubular steel Trellis frame', 'Marzocchi DLC coated 50mm fully adjustable usd forks', 'Progressive linkage with fully adjustable Sachs monoshock. Remote spring preload adjustment. Aluminium single-sided swingarm', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '240/45-ZR17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1198, 2, 4, 162, 9500, 127.5, 8000, '11.5:1', 106, 67.9, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Mitsubishi electronic fuel injection system, Mikuni elliptical throttle bodies with RbW', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, 'Euro 3', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1590, 770, NULL, 234, 205, 17),
(686, 'ducati-diavel-1198-cromo-2013', 'NAKED', 'The Diavel project was born when Ducati designers applied their wish-list of bike “basic instincts” to a blank canvas. With a “what if?” approach to creating a dream bike, they sketched inspiring shapes which became a lower and longer motorcycle. “The challenge of building a muscular silhouette over a pure-bred competition motor had to be met with determination and a delicate touch, and the result is a frontal area that looks like a power athlete on the starting blocks,” explains the team at Ducati Design responsible for the project', 'Tubular steel Trellis frame', 'Marzocchi 50mm fully adjustable usd forks', 'Progressive linkage with fully adjustable Sachs monoshock. Remote spring preload adjustment. Aluminium single-sided swingarm', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '240/45-ZR17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1198, 2, 4, 162, 9500, 127.5, 8000, '11.5:1', 106, 67.9, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Mitsubishi electronic fuel injection system, Mikuni elliptical throttle bodies with RbW', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, 'Euro 3', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1590, 770, NULL, 210, 210, 17),
(687, 'ducati-diavel-1198-dark-2014', 'NAKED', 'The Diavel project was born when Ducati designers applied their wish-list of bike “basic instincts” to a blank canvas. With a “what if?” approach to creating a dream bike, they sketched inspiring shapes which became a lower and longer motorcycle. “The challenge of building a muscular silhouette over a pure-bred competition motor had to be met with determination and a delicate touch, and the result is a frontal area that looks like a power athlete on the starting blocks,” explains the team at Ducati Design responsible for the project', 'Tubular steel Trellis frame', 'Marzocchi DLC coated 50mm fully adjustable usd forks', 'Progressive linkage with fully adjustable Sachs monoshock. Aluminium single-sided swingarm', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '240/45-ZR17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1198, 2, 4, 162, 9500, 127.5, 8000, '11.5:1', 106, 67.9, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Mitsubishi electronic fuel injection system, Mikuni elliptical throttle bodies with RbW', '6-speed', 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Euro 3', 2235, 860, 1192, 1590, 770, NULL, 239, 210, 17),
