(691, 'ducati-diavel-1260-s-2023', 'NAKED', 'The Diavel 1260 combines the performance of a maxi-naked with the ergonomics of a muscle cruiser. Its design reinterprets the Diavel style with a contemporary look and integrates perfectly the 162 HP Testastretta DVT 1262 engine, beating heart of this new Diavel 1260, now compliant with Euro 5 regulation standards', 'Tubular steel Trellis', 'Ø 48 mm Öhlins adjustable usd fork, TiN treatment (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Öhlins fully adjustable monoshock, Aluminium casted single-sided swingarm (curso 130 mm (5.1 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '240/45-ZR17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1262, 2, 4, 162, 9500, 129, 7500, '13:1', 106, 71.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Bosch electronic fuel injection system, elliptical throttle bodies with Ride-by-Wire, equivalent diameter 56', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, 5.5, 'Euro 5', 2200, NULL, NULL, 1600, 780, NULL, 247, 221, 17),
