(693, 'ducati-diavel-1260-s-2020', 'NAKED', 'The Diavel 1260 S version is available in Ducati red with white graphics, alternating with black parts, giving the Diavel 1260 a new sportiness, without sacrificing the style that distinguishes this model', 'Tubular steel Trellis', 'Ø 48 mm Öhlins adjustable usd fork, TiN treatment (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Öhlins fully adjustable monoshock, Aluminium casted single-sided swingarm (curso 130 mm (5.1 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-17', '240/45-17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1262, 2, 4, 159, 9500, 129, 7500, '13:1', 106, 71.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Bosch electronic fuel injection system, elliptical throttle bodies with Ride-by-Wire, equivalent diameter 56', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, 5.4, 'Euro 4', 2200, NULL, NULL, 1600, 780, NULL, 244, 218, 17),
(694, 'ducati-diavel-1260-s-2019', 'NAKED', 'Muscular lines and an imposing front bring out the strong and restless personality of the new Diavel, featuring a long, slender rear with a 240mm rear wheel. The wide air inlets and trellis frame complete the elegant picture as they support the engine, the true beating heart of this bike. The S version, featuring the total black livery and Öhlins suspension, is the embodiment of the new Diavel’s determined and sophisticated style', 'Tubular steel Trellis', '48mm fully adjustable usd forks (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Fully adjustable Sachs unit. Remote spring preload adjustment. Aluminium single-sided swingarm (curso 130 mm (5.1 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-17', '240/45-17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1262, 2, 4, 157, 9500, 129.5, 7500, '13:1', 106, 71.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Bosch electronic fuel injection system, elliptical throttle bodies with Ride-by-Wire, equivalent diameter 56', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, 5.4, 'Euro 4', 2200, NULL, NULL, 1600, 780, NULL, 244, 218, 17),
