(696, 'ducati-diavel-v4-1158-2026', 'NAKED', 'Muscular, sporty, exaggerated and elegant at the same time, able to magnetize attention in any context, Diavel V4 synthesizes seemingly distant technical, dynamic and stylistic features, such as those of sport nakeds and muscle cruisers', 'Aluminum monocoque', 'Ø 50 mm fully adjustable usd fork (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Fully adjustable monoshock, aluminium single-sided swingarm (curso 145 mm (5.7 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Semi-floating discs. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '240/45-ZR17', 'V4, four-stroke', 1158, 4, 4, 168, NULL, 126, NULL, '14:1', 83, 53.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic fuel injection system, Øeq 46 mm elliptical throttle bodies with Ride-by-Wire system', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, 6.4, 'Euro 5', 2200, NULL, NULL, 1593, 790, NULL, 211, NULL, 20),
(697, 'ducati-diavel-v4-1158-2024', 'NAKED', 'Unique personality that doesn´t go unnoticed. Enjoy the sound of the Diavel V4 and get ready to conquer the city. The exhilarating performances of the V4 Granturismo engine are combined with surprising agility and dynamics for such a motorcycle', 'Aluminum monocoque', 'Ø 50 mm fully adjustable usd fork (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Fully adjustable monoshock, aluminium single-sided swingarm (curso 145 mm (5.7 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Semi-floating discs. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '240/45-ZR17', 'V4, four-stroke', 1158, 4, 4, 168, NULL, 126, NULL, '14:1', 83, 53.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic fuel injection system, Øeq 46 mm elliptical throttle bodies with Ride-by-Wire system', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, 6.4, 'Euro 5', 2200, NULL, NULL, 1593, 790, NULL, 223, 221, 20),
