(701, 'ducati-hypermotard-796-2011', 'SUPERMOTO', 'Aggressive ‘motard’ styling and stance combine with Ducati ‘sportbike’ technology to deliver the best of both worlds. With a riding position that ensures total control, the Hypermotard is ready to dominate every inch of asphalt with big-bore acceleration and road holding that redefines the street experience', 'Tubular steel Trellis', 'Marzocchi 43mm usd forks (curso 165 mm (6.5 inches))', 'Progressive linkage with adjustable Sachs monoshock. Aluminium single-sided swingarm (curso 141 mm (5.6 inches))', 'Double disc Disco de 305 mm (12.0 inches)', 'Single disc Disco de 245 mm (9.6 inches)', NULL, '120/70-17', '180/55-17', 'V2, four-stroke', 803, 2, 2, 81, 8000, 75.5, 7700, '11:1', 88, 66, 'Air', 'Injection. Siemens electronic fuel injection, 45mm throttle body', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 192, 4.7, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1455, 825, NULL, 167, 167, 12.4),
(702, 'ducati-hypermotard-796-2010', 'SUPERMOTO', 'The 796 rides the common ground between manners and madness, mixing Ducati´s unrivaled twin-cylinder power and sportbike heredity with the lightweight and minimalist supermotard concept', 'Tubular steel Trellis frame', 'Marzocchi 43mm usd forks', 'Progressive linkage with adjustable Sachs monoshock. Aluminium single-sided swingarm', 'Double disc Disco de 305 mm (12.0 inches)', 'Single disc Disco de 245 mm (9.6 inches)', NULL, '120/70-ZR17', '180/55-ZR17', 'V2, four-stroke', 803, 2, 2, 81, 8000, 7.7, 7700, '11:1', 88, 66, 'Air', 'Injection. Siemens electronic fuel injection, 45mm throttle body', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1455, 825, NULL, 167, 167, 12.4),
