(704, 'ducati-hypermotard-821-2016', 'SUPERMOTO', 'The new Hypermotard offers all the power of a new generation 110 HP Testastretta 11° engine with the advanced technology of Riding Modes, Power Modes and the Ducati Safety Pack. Don´t put the brakes on your energy: total control and extreme versatility allow you to attack any road in Hyper style', 'Tubular steel Trellis frame', '43mm usd forks (curso 170 mm (6.7 inches))', 'Progressive linkage with fully adjustable monoshock. Aluminium single-sided swingarm (curso 150 mm (5.9 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 245 mm (9.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-17', '180/55-17', 'V2, four-stroke', 821, 2, 4, 110, 9250, 89, 7750, '12.8:1', 88, 67.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Magneti Marelli electronic fuel injection system. Throttle bodies with full Ride by Wire system', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, 'Euro 3', 2100, NULL, NULL, 1500, 870, NULL, 198, 175, 16),
(705, 'ducati-hypermotard-821-2014', 'SUPERMOTO', 'The new Hypermotard family has done it again with the latest design which offers, as with the first version, a stunning looking bike that is a joy to ride. The original dirtbike-inspired look has become even more daring thanks to the visibly higher ground clearance, the high and tapered tail and the narrow sides', 'Tubular steel Trellis frame', '43mm usd forks', 'Progressive linkage with fully adjustable Sachs monoshock. Aluminium single-sided swingarm', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 245 mm (9.6 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-17', '180/55-17', 'V2, four-stroke', 821, 2, 4, 110, 9250, 89, 7750, '12.8:1', 88, 67.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Magneti Marelli electronic fuel injection system. Throttle bodies with full Ride by Wire system', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, 'Euro 3', 2100, NULL, NULL, 1500, 870, NULL, 198, 175, 16),
