(722, 'ducati-monster-796-2013', 'NAKED', 'The Monster 796 is the perfect synthesis between sports performances, aesthetics and daily riding pleasure. Cared for in each single detail, it is the ideal bike for each riding style and represents the utmost evolution of the Monster family', 'Tubular steel Trellis frame', '43mm upside-down forks', 'Progressive linkage with preload and rebound Sachs adjustable monoshock', 'Double disc. Four-piston calipers Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 245 mm (9.6 inches)', NULL, '120/70-ZR17', '180/55-ZR17', 'V2, four-stroke', 803, 2, NULL, 85.8, 8250, 78, 6250, '11:1', 88, 66, 'Air', 'Injection. Siemens electronic fuel injection, 45mm throttle body', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, 'Euro 3', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1450, 800, NULL, 187, 167, 15),
