(757, 'ducati-multistrada-1260-s-2019', 'ADVENTURE', 'In addition to long journeys on motorways and city traffic, the new Multistrada 1260 also deals brilliantly with dirt roads', 'Tubular steel Trellis', '48mm fully adjustable usd forks (curso 170 mm (6.7 inches))', 'Fully adjustable Sachs unit. Remote spring preload adjustment. Aluminium single-sided swingarm (curso 170 mm (6.7 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 330 mm (13.0 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-17', '190/55-17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1262, 2, 4, 158, 9500, 129.5, 7500, '13:1', 106, 71.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Bosch electronic fuel injection system, elliptical throttle bodies with Ride-by-Wire, equivalent diameter 56', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, 5.2, 'Euro 4', 2200, NULL, NULL, 1585, 825, NULL, 235, 212, 20),
