(759, 'ducati-multistrada-1260-s-2020', 'ADVENTURE', 'Thanks to the Ducati Testastretta DVT 1262 cm3 Euro 4 engine, the Multistrada 1260 is now even more pleasurable for everyday use thanks to the increased torque at low and mid-range engine speeds', 'Tubular steel Trellis', '48mm fully adjustable usd forks', 'Fully adjustable Öhlins TTX36 unit. Remote spring preload adjustment. Aluminium single-sided swingarm', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-17', '190/55-17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1262, 2, 4, 158, 9500, 129.5, 7500, '13:1', 106, 71.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Bosch electronic fuel injection system, elliptical throttle bodies with Ride-by-Wire, equivalent diameter 56', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, 5.2, 'Euro 4', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1585, 825, NULL, 232, 209, 20),
(760, 'ducati-multistrada-950-2017', 'ADVENTURE', 'When the Ducati Design Center set to work on the Multistrada 950, its aim was to design a compact bike that would be visibly lightweight but above all a real Multistrada. For this reason, its took inspiration from two Ducati flagship models. The Multistrada 950 perfectly blends the design of the Multistrada 1200 and that of the Multistrada 1200 Enduro, taking the ´lightest´ elements from both', 'Tubular steel Trellis frame', 'KYB 48 mm fully adjustable USD fork (curso 170 mm (6.7 inches))', 'Fully adjustable Sachs monoshock unit. Remote spring preload adjustment. Aluminium double-sided swingarm (curso 170 mm (6.7 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-19', '170/60-17', 'V2, four-stroke', 937, 2, NULL, 160, 9000, 96.2, 7750, '12.6:1', 94, 67.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Bosch electronic fuel injection system, cylindrical throttle bodies with Ride-by-Wire, diameter 53 mm', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2200, NULL, NULL, 1594, 840, NULL, 229, 205.7, 20),
