(788, 'ducati-xdiavel-s-1262-2016', 'NAKED', 'Dauntless, irreverent, unheard of, the new XDiavel breaches the world of cruisers with Ducati values, merging concepts that apparently stand worlds apart. Travelling and relaxing to the comfort of forward controls combines with the performance and handling of a real Ducati', 'Tubular steel Trellis frame', 'Adjustable usd forks (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Single shock absorber, Adjustable preload and rebound (curso 110 mm (4.3 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '240/45-ZR17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1262, 2, 4, 156, 9500, 128.9, 5000, '13:1', 106, 71.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Bosch fuel injection system. Full ride-by-wire system', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, NULL, 'Euro 3', 2235, NULL, NULL, 1615, 755, NULL, 247, 220, 17),
(789, 'ducati-xdiavel-s-1262-2019', 'NAKED', 'A new colour for the XDiavel: Matt Liquid Concrete Grey, a tone that perfectly matches the ´total black´ of the mechanics. A new dark brown seat completes the sophisticated, sporty colour scheme', 'Tubular steel trellis', 'Adjustable usd forks (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Single shock absorber, Adjustable preload and rebound (curso 110 mm (4.3 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 265 mm (10.4 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '240/45-ZR17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1262, 2, 4, 152, 9500, 126, 5000, '13:1', 106, 71.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Bosch fuel injection system. Full ride-by-wire system', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, NULL, 'Euro 4', 2235, NULL, NULL, 1615, 755, NULL, 247, 220, 17),
