(964, 'harley-davidson-electra-glide-ultra-limited-flhtk-2019', 'TOURING', 'The front and rear brakes are electronically linked to provide exactly the right amount of brake to each tire no matter the road condition', NULL, 'Telescopic fork', 'Twin shocks', 'Double disc. ABS. 4-piston', 'Single disc. ABS. 4-piston', 'ABS', '130/80-B17', '180/65-B16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1746, 2, NULL, 90, 5450, 150, 3250, '10:1', 100, 111, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. ESPFI', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, 5.47, NULL, 2600, NULL, NULL, 1625, 740, 135, 410.1, 398, 22.7),
(965, 'harley-davidson-electra-glide-ultra-limited-flhtk-2012', 'TOURING', 'The Electra Glide® Ultra Limited provides the next step for those looking to stand out and upgrade their ride. Redefining ´fully-loaded,´ the Electra Glide Ultra Limited boasts the large, 1690 cc Twin Cam 103™ engine, anti-lock brakes, electronic cruise control, Smart Security System, unique two-tone paint schemes, premium Tour-Pak® luggage rack, premium, plush removable luggage liners and heated hand grips as standard features', 'Mild steel; tubular frame; two-piece stamped and welded backbone; cast and forged junctions; twin downtubes; bolt-on', '41.3 mm telescopic, triple circuit damping (curso 117 mm (4.6 inches))', 'Air-adjustable shocks. Mild steel; two-piece drawn and welded section; forged junctions; MIG welded swingarm (curso 76 mm (3.0 inches))', 'Double disc. 4-piston calipers. ABS Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. 4-piston caliper. ABS Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'ABS', '130/80-NW17', '180/65-NW16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1688, 2, 2, NULL, NULL, 135.6, 3250, '9.6:1', 98.4, 111.3, 'Air', 'Injection. Electronic Sequential Port Fuel Injection (ESPFI)', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, 5.6, NULL, 2504, NULL, NULL, 1613, 693, 130, 408.7, 388.7, 22.7),
(966, 'harley-davidson-electra-glide-ultra-limited-flhtk-2015', 'TOURING', 'The farther you go on a motorcycle, the better it gets. Whether riding one, or building a new one from LED headlamp to taillight. Welcome to the top of the line bagger', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Double disc. ABS. 4-piston', 'Single disc. ABS. 2-piston', 'ABS', '130/80-17', '180/65-16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1688, 2, NULL, 85.8, 5100, 138, 3750, '9.7:1', 98.4, 111.3, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. Electronic Sequential Port Fuel Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, 5.6, NULL, 2600, NULL, NULL, 1625, 740, 135, 413.2, 400.1, 22.7),
(967, 'harley-davidson-electra-glide-ultra-limited-flhtk-2017', 'TOURING', 'Get in the two-up Electra Glide® seat and there are absolutely no limits to how far you can go or how good it’s all going to feel', NULL, 'Telescopic fork', 'Twin shocks', 'Double disc. ABS. 4-piston', 'Single disc. ABS. 4-piston', 'ABS', '130/80-B17', '180/65-B16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1754, 2, NULL, 90, 5450, 150, 3250, '10:1', 100, 111.3, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. ESPFI', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, 5.6, NULL, 2600, NULL, NULL, 1625, 740, 135, 411, 394, 22.7),
(968, 'harley-davidson-electra-glide-ultra-limited-flhtk-2013', 'TOURING', 'Classic style and maximum comfort. That´s the perfect balance of the wide set handlebars that come standard on the Electra Glide® Ultra Limited model. They´re designed to keep you comfortably propped in a commanding position while making sure your neck muscles stay calm and relaxed mile after mile, state after state', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Double disc. 4-piston', 'Single disc. 2-piston', NULL, '130/80-17', '180/65-16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1688, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 135.6, 3250, '9.6:1', 98.4, 111.3, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. Electronic Sequential Port Fuel Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, 5.6, NULL, 2504, NULL, NULL, 1613, 693, 130, 413.2, 400.1, 22.7),
(969, 'harley-davidson-electra-glide-ultra-limited-flhtk-2016', 'TOURING', 'From the day the first Electra Glide® motorcycle crossed the country in 1965, it’s had a singular mission. Make the ride a cosmic leap beyond anything the rider has experienced in terms of function and comfort. So here we are countless miles later. And everything we’ve learned has been built into these Project RUSHMORE machines. One-touch saddlebags, GPS and infotainment, better airflow around the rider, more passing power, the list goes on', NULL, 'Telescopic fork', 'Twin shocks', 'Double disc. ABS. 4-piston', 'Single disc. ABS. 4-piston', 'ABS', '130/80-17', '180/65-16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1688, 2, NULL, 87, 5100, 138, 3250, '9.7:1', 98.4, 111.3, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. ESPFI', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, 5.6, NULL, 2600, NULL, NULL, 1625, 740, 135, 411, 394, 22.7),
