(1016, 'harley-davidson-fat-boy-special-110th-edition-2013', 'TOURING', 'Each Anniversary Edition Harley-Davidson is a unique masterpiece, with its very own work of art marking it as part of this historic celebration. Forged of solid bronze and plated with black nickel, each Anniversary medallion is then distressed to highlight the bronze. And since no two can ever distress the same, each becomes a completely unique commemorative ´sculpture.´', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Single disc. 4-piston', 'Single disc. 2-piston', NULL, '130/80-B17', '180/65-B16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1688, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 135.6, 3250, '9.6:1', 98.4, 111.3, 'Air', 'Injection. Electronic Sequential Port Fuel Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, 5.6, NULL, 2464, NULL, NULL, 1613, 678, 130, 367.9, 355.2, 22.7),
