(1018, 'harley-davidson-heritage-classic-flhc-flhcs-2018', 'CRUISER', 'The Heritage Classic motorcycle used to be a homage to ‘50s chrome nostalgia. Take a look at the new one, and you’ll see it’s anything but that', NULL, 'Telescopic fork', 'Twin shocks', 'Single disc. ABS. 4-piston', 'Single disc. ABS. 2-piston', 'ABS', '130/90-B16', '150/80-B16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1745, 2, NULL, 86, 5020, 145, 3000, '9.7:1', 98.4, 111.1, 'Air', 'Injection. Electronic Sequential Port Fuel Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, 5.5, NULL, 2415, NULL, NULL, 1630, 680, 120, 330, 316, 18.9),
(1019, 'harley-davidson-heritage-classic-flhc-flhcs-2019', 'CRUISER', 'The refined gloss-black finishes, modern edge and reinvigorated ride of the Heritage Classic takes nostalgia ripping into a new place. It starts with the performance of the Milwaukee-Eight® 114 engine and the re-invented Softail® frame and suspension. On top of that, it holds a look that drips with gangster-era style', NULL, 'Telescopic fork', 'Twin shocks', 'Single disc. ABS. 4-piston', 'Single disc. ABS. 2-piston', 'ABS', '130/90-B16', '150/80-B16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1746, 2, NULL, 86, 5020, 147.8, 3000, '9.7:1', NULL, NULL, 'Air', 'Injection. Electronic Sequential Port Fuel Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, 5, NULL, 2415, NULL, NULL, 1630, 680, 120, 328, 316, 18.9),
(1020, 'harley-davidson-heritage-classic-flhc-flhcs-2020', 'CRUISER', 'New this year, the Heritage Classic comes in two finishes from the factory. Make noise with the Milwaukee-Eight® 107 with classic chrome style from the engine to the steel laced wheels or the 114 that comes with blacked-out finishes', NULL, 'Telescopic fork', 'Twin shocks', 'Single disc. ABS. 4-piston', 'Single disc. ABS. 2-piston floating', 'ABS', '130/90-B16', '150/80-B16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1746, 2, NULL, 86, 5020, 147.8, 3000, '9.7:1', NULL, NULL, 'Air', 'Injection. Electronic Sequential Port Fuel Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, 5, NULL, 2415, NULL, NULL, 1630, 680, 120, 328, 316, 18.9),
