(1027, 'harley-davidson-heritage-softail-classic-110-th-edition-2013', 'CRUISER', 'Blazing from the past with original dresser spirit and modern touring capabilities. Do laced wheels, whitewalls and studded leather add to the way a bike feels on the road? Of course they do. It´s these extras that make the Heritage Softail® Classic model the quintessential boulevard cruiser', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Single disc. 4-piston', 'Single disc. 2-piston', NULL, 'MT90-B16', '150/80-B16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1688, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 131.4, 3000, '9.6:1', 98.4, 111.1, 'Air', 'Injection. Electronic Sequential Port Fuel Injection (ESPFI)', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, 5.6, NULL, 2400, NULL, NULL, 1638, 648, 130, 341.1, 326.1, 18.9),
