(1029, 'harley-davidson-heritage-softail-classic-flstc-2014', 'CRUISER', 'F you want a comfortable bike but love that rigid-suspension look, you´ve come to the right bike. We´ve kept all the modern comforts where they belong—below the surface of a rad, vintage-looking bike. You get the classic lines of a vintage ´hardtail´ frame with the horizontal rear shocks hidden in the guts. It´s a signature rigid look, and you´ll only find it on a Softail® model', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Single disc. 4-piston', 'Single disc. 2-piston', NULL, 'MT90-B16', '150/80-B16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1688, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 131.4, 3000, '9.6:1', 98.4, 111.1, 'Air', 'Injection. Electronic Sequential Port Fuel Injection (ESPFI)', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, 5.6, NULL, 2400, NULL, NULL, 1638, 648, 130, 341.1, 326.1, 18.9),
(1030, 'harley-davidson-heritage-softail-classic-flstc-2015', 'CRUISER', 'A new front brake system on the Softail® models this year delivers a 40 percent reduction in the amount of lever force required at peak braking. The handlebar master and front cylinders have been restyled. There´s a new 4-piston fixed caliper with 32 and 34 mm pistons, premium caliper piston coating to minimize initial displacement and a larger 300 mm rotor. It all adds up to more stopping power with less effort', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Single disc. ABS. 4-piston', 'Single disc. 2-piston', 'ABS', 'MT90-B16', '150/80-B16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1690, 2, NULL, 73.8, 5000, 130, 3000, '9.6:1', 98.4, 111.1, 'Air', 'Injection. Electronic Sequential Port Fuel Injection (ESPFI)', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, 5.6, NULL, 2405, NULL, NULL, 1638, 690, 131, 341.1, 326.1, 18.9),
(1031, 'harley-davidson-heritage-softail-classic-flstc-2017', 'CRUISER', 'Comfort as modern as this morning’s news and the power from our High Output Twin Cam 103B™ engine, but the look still blazes straight from this machine’s authentic dresser past', NULL, 'Telescopic fork', 'Twin shocks', 'Single disc. ABS. 4-piston', 'Single disc. ABS. 2-piston', 'ABS', 'MT90-B16', '150/80-B16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1690, 2, NULL, 78, 5020, 125, 3000, '9.7:1', 98.4, 111.1, 'Air', 'Injection. Electronic Sequential Port Fuel Injection (ESPFI)', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, 5.6, NULL, 2405, NULL, NULL, 1635, 690, 131, 347, 333, 18.9),
