(1040, 'harley-davidson-low-rider-fxdl-2017', 'CRUISER', 'The muscular Low Rider® is a long-time favorite of those who want to ride hard. Mid-mount controls, adjustable seat and handlebars. Dual disc front brakes and optional laced wheels. Keyless ignition. And powered by the High Output Twin Cam™ 103 engine that feeds into a two-into-one exhaust. It’s an icon built so more riders can put on more miles', NULL, 'Telescopic fork', 'Twin shocks', 'Single disc. 4-piston fixed', 'Single disc. 2-piston torque-free floating', NULL, '100/90-B19', '160/70-B17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1690, 2, NULL, 77, 5020, 125, 3500, '9.6:1', 98.3, 111.1, 'Air', 'Injection. ESPFI', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, 5.5, NULL, 2395, NULL, NULL, 1630, 680, 120, 311, 298, 17.8),
