(1050, 'harley-davidson-night-rod-special-1250-vrscdx-2016', 'NAKED', 'If you think all the blacked-out metal looks sinister, you’ve got the right idea. The Night Rod® Special motorcycle is pure aggression from fast back tail section to streamlined front end, built around a liquid-cooled 60° V-twin engine stuffed full of racing-derived serious business like dual overhead cams, 4-valve heads and velocity stacks feeding its double barrel exhaust. In other words, things happen when you twist the throttle. Better if it all happens under the cover of darkness', NULL, 'Inverted fork', NULL, 'Double disc. ABS. 4-piston', 'Single disc. ABS. 4-piston', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR19', '240/40-R18', 'V2, four-stroke', 1247, 2, NULL, 120.7, 8000, 111, 7250, '11.5:1', 105, 72, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic Sequential Port Fuel Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, 6.36, NULL, 2440, NULL, NULL, 1705, 675, 115, 302.1, 289, 18.9),
(1051, 'harley-davidson-night-rod-special-1250-vrscdx-2007', 'CRUISER', 'When you get right down to it, this just might be the blackest sheep of them all', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Single disc. 4-piston', 'Single disc. 4-piston', NULL, '120/70-ZR19', '240/40-R18', 'V2, four-stroke', 1247, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 108.5, 7000, '11.3:1', 104.9, 72.1, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic Sequential Port Fuel Injection', '5-speed', 5, 'Belt', NULL, 4.93, NULL, 2398, NULL, NULL, 1707, 668, 107, 306.6, 291.7, 18.9),
(1052, 'harley-davidson-night-rod-special-1250-vrscdx-2010', 'CRUISER', 'The Night Rod® Special offers a raw, street-tough attitude, with an all-black Revolution V-Twin engine and blacked-out fork legs, swing arm and other components. The speed-screen visor and racing stripe come straight from the drag strip', 'Steel perimeter upper frame with hydroformed main rails and bolt-on lower frame rails; MIG welded', 'Wide, 49mm custom fork (curso 102 mm (4.0 inches))', 'Preload adjustable (curso 102 mm (4.0 inches))', 'Double disc. 4-piston Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. 4-piston Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', NULL, '120/70-ZR19', '240/40-R18', 'V2, four-stroke', 1250, 2, 4, NULL, NULL, 111, 7200, '11.5:1', 105, 72, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Electronic Sequential Port Fuel Injection (ESPFI)', '5-speed', 5, 'Belt', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2460, NULL, NULL, 1715, 690, 140, 292, 292, 18.9),
(1053, 'harley-davidson-night-rod-special-1250-vrscdx-2009', 'CRUISER', 'An all-black Revolution engine, fork legs, swingarm and other blacked-out components give the VRSCDX Night Rod Special a raw, street-tough attitude. A colour-matched nacelle surrounds a round reflector-optic headlight. The straight-shot dual mufflers have black end caps and heat shields', 'Steel perimeter upper frame with hydroformed main rails', 'Wide, 49mm custom fork (curso 102 mm (4.0 inches))', 'Preload adjustable (curso 102 mm (4.0 inches))', 'Double disc. Bremo, 4-piston calipers, ABS Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. Bremo, 4-piston calipers, ABS Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR19', '240/40-R18', 'V2, four-stroke', 1250, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 111, 7200, NULL, 105, 72, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '5-speed', 5, 'Belt', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2460, NULL, NULL, NULL, 640, 107, 292, 292, 18.9),
