(1157, 'harley-davidson-street-glide-flhx-2014', 'TOURING', 'We conducted thousands of road tests with real riders giving us feedback to build the next iteration of the legendary Harley-Davidson® engine. The consensus was: We want more. More low-end torque, more passing power, more perfection in the tone of the exhaust note, more of the feeling we ride a motorcycle for. So we built the engines that deliver it. We’re proud to unveil the next level of Harley-Davidson® V-Twin engine', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Double disc. 4-piston', 'Single disc. 2-piston', NULL, '130/70-BW18', '180/65-BW16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1688, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 135.6, 3250, '9.6:1', 98.4, 111.3, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. ESPFI', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, 5.6, NULL, 2413, NULL, NULL, 1613, 663, 119, 367.9, 355.2, 22.7),
