(1176, 'harley-davidson-switchback-fld-2013', 'TOURING', 'Your riding moods change—so let them. With its detachable windshield and saddlebags, the Switchback motorcycle can make the switch from cruising to touring or back in seconds. Easily take them off for a powerful, head-turning street cruiser. Re-attach them for a comfortable, light-handling tourer that definitely goes the distance', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Double disc. 4-piston fixed', 'Single disc. 2-piston torque-free floating', NULL, '130/70-B18', '160/70-B17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1688, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 135.6, 3500, '9.6:1', 98.4, 111.3, 'Air', 'Injection. Electronic Sequential Port Fuel Injection (ESPFI)', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, 5.6, NULL, 2360, NULL, NULL, 1595, 663, 109, 325.7, 315.7, 17.8),
(1177, 'harley-davidson-switchback-fld-2012', 'CRUISER', 'A union of opposites that sacrifices nothing, the Switchback´s modern styling brings vintage Harley-Davidson simplicity to today’s roads in a look that defines classic: both true to its roots and completely contemporary. And with its detachable windshield and saddlebags, it´s like having two bikes in one: a powerful, head-turning street cruiser that can also go the distance as a comfortable, easy-handling tourer', 'Mild steel, tubular frame; rectangular section backbone; stamped, cast, and forged junctions; forged fender supports', '41.3 mm fork with 20 mm cartridge damping and triple rate spring (curso 98 mm (3.9 inches))', 'Nitrogen charged 36 mm monotube damper with 5 step preload adjustable dual rate spring. Mild steel, rectangular tube sections, stamped junctions; MIG welded', 'Single disc. 4-piston fixed. Optional ABS Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. 2-piston torque-free floating. Optional ABS Disco de 292 mm (11.5 inches)', 'ABS', '130/70-B18', '160/70-B17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1688, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 135.6, 3500, '9.6:1', 98.4, 111.3, 'Air', 'Injection. Electronic Sequential Port Fuel Injection (ESPFI)', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, 5.6, NULL, 2357, NULL, NULL, 1595, 663, 109, 325.7, 315.7, 17.8),
