(1234, 'harley-davidson-xr-1200-sportster-2009', 'OFF_ROAD', 'With styling inspired by the legendary flat-track champion XR750, the XR1200™ is a Sportster® tuned to excel in all aspects of street performance in the hands of a capable, aggressive rider', 'Mild steel tubular frame; circular sections; cast junctions', '43 mm inverted fork', 'Coil-over shocks', 'Double disc. Dual 4-piston Disco de 292 mm (11.5 inches)', 'Single disc. Single piston Disco de 260 mm (10.2 inches)', NULL, '120/70-ZR18', '180/55-ZR17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1202, 2, 2, 90, 7000, 100, 3700, '10:1', 88.9, 96.8, 'Air', 'Injection. Electronic Sequential Port Fuel Injection (ESPFI)', '5-speed', 5, 'Belt', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2195, NULL, NULL, 1515, 765, 145, 250, 250, 13.3),
