(1236, 'harley-davidson-xr-1200x-sportster-2014', 'OFF_ROAD', 'The agile XR1200X motorcycle is draped in a satin black finish for a menacing look. From the black powder-coated engine and straight-shot, high-performance exhaust to the upside-down forks, and the black cast aluminum wheels with orange rim highlight that jet the bike into a whole new era of race-inspired motorcycles—the XR1200X embraces the dark side while paying homage to the old school flat tracker that inspired its style and ease of handling', 'Mild steel tubular frame; circular sections; cast junctions', '39 mm (curso 92 mm (3.6 inches))', 'Mild steel, rectangular tube section, stamped junctions, MIG welded swing-arm. Coil-over; preload dual-adjustable shocks (curso 41 mm (1.6 inches))', 'Single disc. Dual-piston Disco de 292 mm (11.5 inches)', 'Single disc. Single-piston Disco de 260 mm (10.2 inches)', NULL, '120/70-ZR18', '180/55-ZR17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1201, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 100.2, 4000, '10:1', 88.9, 96.8, 'Air', 'Injection. Electronic Sequential Port Fuel Injection (ESPFI)', '5-speed', 5, 'Belt', NULL, 5.35, NULL, 2225, NULL, NULL, 1524, 742, 150, 259.9, 249.9, 13.3),
(1237, 'harley-davidson-xr-1200x-sportster-2013', 'OFF_ROAD', 'The agile XR1200X motorcycle is draped in a satin black finish for a menacing look. From the black powder-coated engine and straight-shot, high-performance exhaust to the upside-down forks, and the black cast aluminum wheels with orange rim highlight that jet the bike into a whole new era of race-inspired motorcycles—the XR1200X embraces the dark side while paying homage to the old school flat tracker that inspired its style and ease of handling', 'Mild steel tubular frame; circular sections; cast junctions', '39 mm (curso 92 mm (3.6 inches))', 'Mild steel, rectangular tube section, stamped junctions, MIG welded swing-arm. Coil-over; preload dual-adjustable shocks (curso 41 mm (1.6 inches))', 'Single disc. Dual-piston Disco de 292 mm (11.5 inches)', 'Single disc. Single-piston Disco de 260 mm (10.2 inches)', NULL, '120/70-ZR18', '180/55-ZR17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1201, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 100.2, 4000, '10:1', 88.9, 96.8, 'Air', 'Injection. Electronic Sequential Port Fuel Injection (ESPFI)', '5-speed', 5, 'Belt', NULL, 5.35, NULL, 2225, NULL, NULL, 1524, 742, 150, 259.9, 249.9, 13.3),
(1238, 'harley-davidson-xr-1200x-sportster-2012', 'OFF_ROAD', 'The agile XR1200X motorcycle is draped in a satin black finish for a menacing look. From the black powder-coated engine and straight-shot, high-performance exhaust to the upside-down forks, and the black cast aluminum wheels with orange rim highlight that jet the bike into a whole new era of race-inspired motorcycles—the XR1200X embraces the dark side while paying homage to the old school flat tracker that inspired its style and ease of handling', 'Mild steel tubular frame; circular sections; cast junctions', '39 mm (curso 92 mm (3.6 inches))', 'Mild steel, rectangular tube section, stamped junctions, MIG welded swing-arm. Coil-over; preload dual-adjustable shocks (curso 41 mm (1.6 inches))', 'Single disc. Dual-piston Disco de 292 mm (11.5 inches)', 'Single disc. Single-piston Disco de 260 mm (10.2 inches)', NULL, '120/70-ZR18', '180/55-ZR17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1201, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 100.2, 4000, '10:1', 88.9, 96.8, 'Air', 'Injection. Electronic Sequential Port Fuel Injection (ESPFI)', '5-speed', 5, 'Belt', NULL, 5.35, NULL, 2225, NULL, NULL, 1524, 742, 150, 259.9, 249.9, 13.3),
(1239, 'harley-davidson-xr-1200x-sportster-2010', 'OFF_ROAD', 'First came the original XR1200®. Designed with the European rider in mind, it demonstrates agility and focus not traditionally found on a Harley-Davidson® motorcycle. The distinctive paint job and retro graphics echo its dirt bike heritage, while the flat track style speedo, exhaust, tail section and wheels are suitably refined for modern roads', 'Mild steel tubular frame; circular sections; cast junctions', '43 mm inverted fork', 'Coil-over shocks, preload dual-adjustment', 'Double disc. Dual 4-piston Disco de 292 mm (11.5 inches)', 'Single disc. Single piston Disco de 260 mm (10.2 inches)', NULL, '120/70-ZR18', '180/55-ZR17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1202, 2, 2, 90, 7000, 100, 3700, '10:1', 88.9, 96.8, 'Air', 'Injection. ESPFI', '5-speed', 5, 'Belt', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2195, NULL, NULL, 1515, 765, 145, 250, 250, 13.3),
(1240, 'harley-davidson-xr-1200x-sportster-2011', 'OFF_ROAD', 'With a tank and tail section designed to evoke the legendary Harley-Davidson® XR750™ – the king of the gritty American flat-track scene – the XR1200X™ puts its mechanical character on display. Wide flat-track bars and rearset footpegs position an assertive rider for active control. The XR1200X has a blacked-out powertrain and exhaust, revised tank graphics, and black wheels with an orange rim pinstripe', 'Mild steel tubular frame, circular sections; cast junctions', '43 mm Inverted Showa fork (curso 125 mm (4.9 inches))', 'Fully-adjustable (curso 89 mm (3.5 inches))', 'Double disc. 4-piston Disco de 292 mm (11.5 inches)', 'Single disc. Single-piston Disco de 260 mm (10.2 inches)', NULL, '120/70-ZR18', '180/55-ZR17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1201, 2, 2, NULL, NULL, 100, 4000, '10:1', 88.9, 96.8, 'Air', 'Injection. Electronic Sequential Port Fuel Injection (ESPFI)', '5-speed', 5, 'Belt', NULL, 5.17, NULL, 2225, 930, 1161, 1524, 742, 150, 259.9, 249.9, 13.3),
