(1372, 'honda-sh-150i-dlx-2018', 'SCOOTER', 'For the purpose of ensuring and then expanding the joys for the next generation, we have developed the new SH150i with a functional and appealing design. The model is equipped with a liquid-cooled, single-cylinder 150cc engine ´eSP´ that was developed as a new next-generation engine and designed to achieve the lowest fuel consumption in its class', 'Underbone, steel tube', '33mm hydraulic fork (curso 89 mm (3.5 inches))', 'Swingarm with dual hydraulic shocks, spring-preload adjustability (curso 84 mm (3.3 inches))', 'Single disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', 'Expanding brake (drum brake) Disco de 130 mm (5.1 inches)', NULL, '100/80-16', '120/80-16', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 153, 1, NULL, 15, 8000, 13.7, 6500, '11:1', 58, 57.8, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Programmed Fuel Injection (PGM-FI) with automatic enricher circuit', 'Automatic', NULL, 'Belt', NULL, 2.58, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1356, 785, NULL, 137, NULL, 7.2),
(1373, 'honda-sh-150i-dlx-2017', 'SCOOTER', 'For the purpose of ensuring and then expanding the joys for the next generation, we have developed the new SH150i with a functional and appealing design. The model is equipped with a liquid-cooled, single-cylinder 150cc engine ´eSP´ that was developed as a new next-generation engine and designed to achieve the lowest fuel consumption in its class', 'Underbone, steel tube', '33mm hydraulic fork (curso 89 mm (3.5 inches))', 'Swingarm with dual hydraulic shocks, spring-preload adjustability (curso 84 mm (3.3 inches))', 'Single disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', 'Expanding brake (drum brake) Disco de 130 mm (5.1 inches)', NULL, '100/80-16', '120/80-16', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 153, 1, NULL, 15, 8000, 13.7, 6500, '11:1', 58, 57.8, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Programmed Fuel Injection (PGM-FI) with automatic enricher circuit', 'Automatic', NULL, 'Belt', NULL, 2.58, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1356, 785, NULL, 137, NULL, 7.2),
(1374, 'honda-trx-420-fourtrax-fm-4x4-quadriciclo-2014', 'OFF_ROAD', 'Strong. Rugged. Able to do-it-all, whether it’s on your favorite trail, the ranch, or the farm. And here’s the best news yet: for 2014 our Foreman is all-new with tons of new features', NULL, 'Independent double-wishbone (curso 185 mm (7.3 inches))', 'Swingarm with single shock (curso 185 mm (7.3 inches))', 'Double disc. Hydraulic Disco de 190 mm (7.5 inches)', 'Expanding brake (drum brake) Disco de 160 mm (6.3 inches)', NULL, '25/8-12', '25/10-12', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 475, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '9.5:1', 92, 71.5, 'Liquid', 'Carburettor. Keihin® 36mm throttle body', '5-speed', 5, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2103, 1204, 1219, 1267, 869, 191, 285.8, NULL, 14.8),
(1375, 'honda-trx-420-fourtrax-fm-4x4-quadriciclo-2013', 'OFF_ROAD', 'Honda’s Foreman all-terrain vehicles have always been the machines to count on when you need an ATV that’s not afraid to take on the tough jobs. And this year is no different: they’re just as strong. Just as rugged. And just as hard working, whether it’s around the ranch, the factory, or on your favorite trail', NULL, 'Independent double-wishbone (curso 170 mm (6.7 inches))', 'Swingarm with single shock (curso 175 mm (6.9 inches))', 'Double disc. Hydraulic Disco de 196 mm (7.7 inches)', 'Expanding brake (drum brake) Disco de 180 mm (7.1 inches)', NULL, '25/8-12', '25/10-12', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 475, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '9.5:1', 92, 71.5, 'Liquid', 'Carburettor. Keihin® 36mm throttle body', '5-speed', 5, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2126, 1204, 1196, 1280, 881, 193, 284, NULL, 15.1),
(1376, 'honda-trx-420-fourtrax-fm-4x4-quadriciclo-2016', 'OFF_ROAD', 'You probably have a go-to person in your life— someone that you can count on in a pinch, the one you can count on when you need something done, done right, done now, and done without excuses. On the jobsite or the shop floor, it’s probably the shop foreman. And in the world of all-terrain vehicles that’s the Honda Foreman', NULL, 'Independent double-wishbone (curso 185 mm (7.3 inches))', 'Swingarm with single shock (curso 185 mm (7.3 inches))', 'Double disc. Hydraulic Disco de 190 mm (7.5 inches)', 'Expanding brake (drum brake) Disco de 160 mm (6.3 inches)', NULL, '25/8-12', '25/10-12', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 475, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '9.5:1', 92, 71.5, 'Liquid', 'Carburettor. Keihin® 36mm throttle body', '5-speed', 5, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2103, 1204, 1219, 1267, 869, 191, 285.8, 285.8, 14.8),
(1377, 'honda-trx-420-fourtrax-fm-4x4-quadriciclo-2015', 'OFF_ROAD', 'Its proven fuel injected 500-class engine offers excellent power and fuel efficiency in a strong chassis with a capable, towing-friendly swingarm rear suspension. Find yourself in a sticky situation? The front differential lock will help make sure you get back to camp. A new reverse mechanism for 2015 is easier to use. And finally, all of these features are wrapped up in some tough, aggressively styled bodywork to set Foreman apart from the competition', NULL, 'Independent double-wishbone (curso 185 mm (7.3 inches))', 'Swingarm with single shock (curso 185 mm (7.3 inches))', 'Double disc. Hydraulic Disco de 190 mm (7.5 inches)', 'Expanding brake (drum brake) Disco de 160 mm (6.3 inches)', NULL, '25/8-12', '25/10-12', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 475, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '9.5:1', 92, 71.5, 'Liquid', 'Carburettor. Keihin® 36mm throttle body', '5-speed', 5, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2103, 1204, 1219, 1267, 869, 191, 285.8, 285.8, 14.8),
(1378, 'honda-trx-420-fourtrax-fm-4x4-quadriciclo-2022', 'OFF_ROAD', 'Are you that person that other people call when they need a problem solved? Someone they can count on when the chips are down? Then the Honda Foreman is the ATV for you. Because, just like you, it’s the ATV you can always count on', NULL, 'Independent double-wishbone (curso 185 mm (7.3 inches))', 'Swingarm with single shock (curso 185 mm (7.3 inches))', 'Double disc. Hydraulic Disco de 190 mm (7.5 inches)', 'Expanding brake (drum brake). Sealed drum Disco de 160 mm (6.3 inches)', NULL, '25/8-12', '25/10-12', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 518, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '9.5:1', 96, 71.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. PGM-FI', '5-speed', 5, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2103, 1204, 1220, 1270, 869, 190, 288.5, 288.5, 14.8),
(1379, 'honda-trx-420-fourtrax-fm-4x4-quadriciclo-2019', 'OFF_ROAD', NULL, NULL, 'Independent double-wishbone (curso 130 mm (5.1 inches))', 'Swingarm with single shock (curso 124 mm (4.9 inches))', 'Expanding brake (drum brake). Dual sealed hydraulic drum', 'Expanding brake (drum brake). Sealed mechanical drum', NULL, '22/7-11', '22/10-9', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 229, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 68.5, 62.2, 'Air', 'Carburettor. 22mm', '5-speed', 5, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1905, 1034, 1069, 1130, 792, 152, 196.9, NULL, 9.1),
(1380, 'honda-trx-420-fourtrax-fm-4x4-quadriciclo-2021', 'OFF_ROAD', 'Everyone who works with their hands learns a truth early on: Never cut corners when it comes to your tools. Which is exactly why so many people rely on Honda’s line of FourTrax Foreman ATVs. And it doesn’t hurt that, like you, they play just as hard as they work. All three models offer features like a powerful 518cc engine, tough front and rear racks, an easy-to-use reverse system, a handy utility box and more. And every Foreman here uses a swingarm rear suspension that’s perfect for hard work or towing', NULL, 'Independent double-wishbone (curso 185 mm (7.3 inches))', 'Swingarm with single shock (curso 185 mm (7.3 inches))', 'Double disc. Hydraulic Disco de 190 mm (7.5 inches)', 'Expanding brake (drum brake). Sealed drum Disco de 160 mm (6.3 inches)', NULL, '25/8-12', '25/10-12', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 518, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '9.5:1', 96, 71.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. PGM-FI', '5-speed', 5, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2103, 1204, 1220, 1270, 869, 190, 288.5, 288.5, 14.8),
(1381, 'honda-trx-420-fourtrax-fm-4x4-quadriciclo-2024', 'OFF_ROAD', 'For many enthusiasts, the Honda Foreman ATV can be considered the original “Do-it-yourself” expert', NULL, 'Independent double-wishbone (curso 185 mm (7.3 inches))', 'Swingarm with single shock (curso 185 mm (7.3 inches))', 'Double disc. Hydraulic Disco de 190 mm (7.5 inches)', 'Expanding brake (drum brake). Sealed drum Disco de 160 mm (6.3 inches)', NULL, '25/8-12', '25/10-12', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 518, 1, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '9.5:1', 96, 71.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. PGM-FI, 36mm', '5-speed', 5, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2106, 1204, 1214, 1270, 876, 190, 288, 288, 14.8),
(1382, 'honda-trx-420-fourtrax-fm-4x4-quadriciclo-2011', 'OFF_ROAD', 'Your weekly list of chores isn’t getting easier, so why would you opt for an ATV that isn’t up to the job? Enter the Honda FourTrax Foreman 4x4, a tough-as-nails machine that’s one of the hardest-working ATVs in our Utility lineup, featuring a beefy 475cc, longitudinally mounted single armed with heaps of task-tackling torque', NULL, 'Independent double-wishbone (curso 170 mm (6.7 inches))', 'Swingarm with dual shocks (curso 170 mm (6.7 inches))', 'Double disc Disco de 180 mm (7.1 inches)', 'Expanding brake (drum brake) Disco de 180 mm (7.1 inches)', NULL, '25/8-12', '25/10-12', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 475, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '8.5:1', 92, 71.5, 'Air', 'Carburettor. 36mm constant velocity carburetor', '5-speed', 5, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2108, 1189, 1181, 1288, 861, 191, 281.2, NULL, 15.5),
(1383, 'honda-trx-420-fourtrax-fm-4x4-quadriciclo-2010', 'OFF_ROAD', 'Whether you´re riding deep into the back country to bag a trophy elk or patrolling an endless fence line, the FourTrax Foreman 4X4 is designed to make the toughest tasks a whole lot easier. Its tough-as-nails 475cc longitudinal Honda engine delivers tons of torque, week after week and year after year', NULL, 'Independent double-wishbone (curso 170 mm (6.7 inches))', 'Swingarm with dual shocks (curso 170 mm (6.7 inches))', 'Double disc Disco de 180 mm (7.1 inches)', 'Expanding brake (drum brake) Disco de 180 mm (7.1 inches)', NULL, '25/8-12', '25/10-12', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 475, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '8.5:1', 92, 71.5, 'Air', 'Carburettor', '5-speed', 5, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2108, 1189, 1181, 1288, 861, 191, 281.2, NULL, 15.5),
(1384, 'honda-trx-420-fourtrax-fm-4x4-quadriciclo-2020', 'OFF_ROAD', 'The Honda FourTrax Foreman is our flagship model when it comes to work. And when the workday’s done, plenty of riders think it’s perfect for having some fun, too. For 2020 we’ve made this great ATV even better, by giving it a bigger, 518cc engine, and lots of other upgrades like new front and rear racks, an easier-to-use reverse system, fresh new styling, a handy new utility box, and more', NULL, 'Independent double-wishbone (curso 185 mm (7.3 inches))', 'Swingarm with single shock (curso 185 mm (7.3 inches))', 'Double disc. Hydraulic Disco de 190 mm (7.5 inches)', 'Expanding brake (drum brake). Sealed drum Disco de 160 mm (6.3 inches)', NULL, '25/8-12', '25/10-12', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 518, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '9.5:1', 96, 71.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. PGM-FI', '5-speed', 5, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2103, 1204, 1219, 1270, 869, 191, 288.5, 288.5, 14.8),
(1385, 'honda-trx-420-fourtrax-fm-4x4-quadriciclo-2012', 'OFF_ROAD', 'Honda´s Foreman family of all-terrain vehicles have always been the machines to count on when you need an ATV that´s not afraid to take on the tough jobs. And this year they´re better than ever: Stronger, smarter, even harder working, whether it´s around the ranch, factory, or your favorite trail', NULL, 'Independent double-wishbone (curso 170 mm (6.7 inches))', 'Swingarm with single shock (curso 175 mm (6.9 inches))', 'Double disc Disco de 196 mm (7.7 inches)', 'Expanding brake (drum brake) Disco de 180 mm (7.1 inches)', NULL, '25/8-12', '25/10-12', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 475, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '9.5:1', 92, 71.5, 'Liquid', 'Carburettor. Keihin® 36mm throttle body', '5-speed', 5, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2126, 1204, 1196, 1280, 881, 193, 284, NULL, 15.1),
(1386, 'honda-trx-420-fourtrax-fm-4x4-quadriciclo-2017', 'OFF_ROAD', 'At Honda, we have a whole stable full of great all-terrain vehicles, but the Honda Foreman has long been the real workhorse that demanding users go to when the going gets tough', NULL, 'Independent double-wishbone (curso 185 mm (7.3 inches))', 'Swingarm with single shock (curso 185 mm (7.3 inches))', 'Double disc. Hydraulic Disco de 190 mm (7.5 inches)', 'Expanding brake (drum brake). Sealed drum Disco de 160 mm (6.3 inches)', NULL, '25/8-12', '25/10-12', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 475, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '9.5:1', 92, 71.5, 'Liquid', 'Carburettor. Keihin® 36mm throttle body', '5-speed', 5, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2103, 1204, 1219, 1267, 869, 191, 285.8, 285.8, 14.8),
