(1388, 'honda-trx-420-fourtrax-fm-4x4-quadriciclo-2023', 'OFF_ROAD', 'For decades now, anyone who depends on an ATV has come to depend on a Honda Foreman, the ATV that has always set the highest standards for toughness, build quality, and overall performance in its class. They offer no-nonsense performance, starting with their powerful 518cc engines, tough steel front and rear racks, long-travel suspension, and so much more', NULL, 'Independent double-wishbone (curso 185 mm (7.3 inches))', 'Swingarm with single shock (curso 185 mm (7.3 inches))', 'Double disc. Hydraulic Disco de 190 mm (7.5 inches)', 'Expanding brake (drum brake). Sealed drum Disco de 160 mm (6.3 inches)', NULL, '25/8-12', '25/10-12', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 518, 1, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '9.5:1', 96, 71.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection. PGM-FI, 36mm', '5-speed', 5, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2106, 1204, 1214, 1270, 876, 190, 288, 288, 14.8),
