(1391, 'honda-trx-420-fourtrax-tm-4x2-quadriciclo-2013', 'OFF_ROAD', 'Honda’s Foreman all-terrain vehicles have always been the machines to count on when you need an ATV that’s not afraid to take on the tough jobs. And this year is no different: they’re just as strong. Just as rugged. And just as hard working, whether it’s around the ranch, the factory, or on your favorite trail', NULL, 'Independent double-wishbone (curso 170 mm (6.7 inches))', 'Swingarm with single shock (curso 175 mm (6.9 inches))', 'Double disc. Hydraulic Disco de 196 mm (7.7 inches)', 'Expanding brake (drum brake) Disco de 180 mm (7.1 inches)', NULL, '25/8-12', '25/10-12', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 475, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '9.5:1', 92, 71.5, 'Liquid', 'Carburettor. Keihin® 36mm throttle body', '5-speed', 5, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2126, 1204, 1196, 1280, 881, 193, 284, NULL, 15.1),
(1392, 'honda-trx-420-fourtrax-tm-4x2-quadriciclo-2015', 'OFF_ROAD', 'Its proven fuel injected 500-class engine offers excellent power and fuel efficiency in a strong chassis with a capable, towing-friendly swingarm rear suspension. Find yourself in a sticky situation? The front differential lock will help make sure you get back to camp. A new reverse mechanism for 2015 is easier to use. And finally, all of these features are wrapped up in some tough, aggressively styled bodywork to set Foreman apart from the competition', NULL, 'Independent double-wishbone (curso 185 mm (7.3 inches))', 'Swingarm with single shock (curso 185 mm (7.3 inches))', 'Double disc. Hydraulic Disco de 190 mm (7.5 inches)', 'Expanding brake (drum brake) Disco de 160 mm (6.3 inches)', NULL, '25/8-12', '25/10-12', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 475, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '9.5:1', 92, 71.5, 'Liquid', 'Carburettor. Keihin® 36mm throttle body', '5-speed', 5, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2103, 1204, 1219, 1267, 869, 191, 285.8, 285.8, 14.8),
(1393, 'honda-trx-420-fourtrax-tm-4x2-quadriciclo-2014', 'OFF_ROAD', 'Strong. Rugged. Able to do-it-all, whether it’s on your favorite trail, the ranch, or the farm. And here’s the best news yet: for 2014 our Foreman is all-new with tons of new features', NULL, 'Independent double-wishbone (curso 185 mm (7.3 inches))', 'Swingarm with single shock (curso 185 mm (7.3 inches))', 'Double disc. Hydraulic Disco de 190 mm (7.5 inches)', 'Expanding brake (drum brake) Disco de 160 mm (6.3 inches)', NULL, '25/8-12', '25/10-12', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 475, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '9.5:1', 92, 71.5, 'Liquid', 'Carburettor. Keihin® 36mm throttle body', '5-speed', 5, 'Shaft drive (cardan)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2103, 1204, 1219, 1267, 869, 191, 285.8, NULL, 14.8),
