(1426, 'husqvarna-fe-450-2025', 'OFF_ROAD', 'The latest technology, the best components, and an unrivalled riding experience. The FE 450 offers it all. Producing a broad spread of controllable power, the engine has also been designed to position all shaft arrangements at the ideal centre of gravity for exceptional manoeuvrability', 'Central double-cradle-type 25CrMo4 steel', 'WP XPLOR-USD, Ø 48 mm (curso 300 mm (11.8 inches))', 'WP XACT Monoshock with linkage (curso 300 mm (11.8 inches))', 'Single disc. Twin-piston floating calliper, brake disc Disco de 260 mm (10.2 inches)', 'Single disc. Single-piston floating calliper, brake dis Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', NULL, '90/90-21', '140/80-18', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 450, 1, NULL, 63, NULL, NULL, NULL, '12.8:1', 95, 63.4, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, 3.68, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1489, 950, 360, 109.8, 107.3, 8),
