(1446, 'husqvarna-svartpilen-801-2024', 'NAKED', 'The 2024 Svartpilen 801 is the latest expansion of our naked motorcycle line-up. It combines exceptional versatility, performance, and style for the streets. Its minimalist, scrambler-inspired design features a new compact and powerful parallel-twin engine, perfectly balanced tubular frame, and refined ergonomics for an engaging, intuitive ride', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 799, NULL, NULL, 103.3, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.5, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1475, NULL, NULL, 181, NULL, 14),
(1447, 'husqvarna-tc-125-2026', NULL, 'The TC 125 receives multiple technical upgrades for 2025 to maintain its position at the head of the highly competitive 125 cc class. Updated bodywork and ergonomics offer riders improved ease of movement on the motorcycle while its lighter chromium molybdenum frame, updated WP suspension, and revised rear shock linkage ensure improved comfort and cornering', 'Central double-cradle-type 25CrMo4 steel', 'WP XACT-USD, Ø 48 mm (curso 305 mm (12.0 inches))', 'WP XACT Monoshock with linkage (curso 293 mm (11.5 inches))', 'Single disc. Brembo twin-piston floating calliper Disco de 260 mm (10.2 inches)', 'Single disc. Brembo single-piston floating calliper Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', NULL, '80/100-21', '120/90-18', 'Single cylinder, two-stroke', 125, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 54, 54.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1490, 939, 350, 92.6, 92.5, 7.2),
