(1455, 'husqvarna-te-250-heritage-2025', 'OFF_ROAD', 'Built upon the most versatile and competitive 250 cc 2-stroke enduro machine on the market, the TE 250 Heritage model is the motorcycle of choice for enduro racers serious about their results', 'Central double-cradle-type 25CrMo4 steel', 'WP XPLOR-USD, Ø 48 mm (curso 300 mm (11.8 inches))', 'WP XACT Monoshock with linkage (curso 300 mm (11.8 inches))', 'Single disc. Twin-piston floating calliper, brake disc Disco de 260 mm (10.2 inches)', 'Single disc. Single-piston floating calliper, brake disc Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', NULL, '90/90-21', '140/90-18', 'Single cylinder, two-stroke', 249, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 66.4, 72, 'Liquid', 'Injection. 39mm', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, 2.55, NULL, 2260, NULL, NULL, 1489, 950, 360, 107, 106.2, 8.5),
