(1499, 'indian-chief-2018', 'CRUISER', NULL, 'Cast Aluminum Frame with Integrated Air-Box', 'Telescopic fork (curso 119 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Single shock (curso 94 mm (3.7 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'ABS', '130/90-B16', '150/80-B16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1811, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 150, 2100, '9.5:1', 101.6, 113, 'Air', 'Injection. Closed Loop Sequential Port injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2630, 1000, 1176, 1730, 660, 140, 357, 341, 20.8),
(1500, 'indian-chief-classic-2016', 'CRUISER', 'Stripped down until all that´s left is an irresistible urge to ride. Take it all in, and you´ll see a front end that drips with chrome, cast wheels and a light-up headdress on the deeply valanced front fender leading the way. There´s always somebody who wants to get a better look at the Classic´s beautiful curves', 'Cast Aluminum Frame with Integrated Air-Box', 'Telescopic fork (curso 119 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Single shock (curso 94 mm (3.7 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'ABS', '130/90-B16', '150/80-B16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1811, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 139, 2600, '9.5:1', 101.6, 113, 'Air', 'Injection. Closed Loop Sequential Port injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2630, 1000, 1176, 1730, 660, 140, 357, 341, NULL),
(1501, 'indian-chief-classic-2015', 'CRUISER', 'All you need. All you want. The 2015 Indian® Chief® Classic is everything an Indian Motorcycle® was and ever should be. It’s a sculpted, powerful cruiser, built with the purest necessities of Indian style, wrapped around the innovation of tomorrow', 'Cast Aluminum Frame with Integrated Air-Box', 'Telescopic fork (curso 119 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Single shock (curso 104 mm (4.1 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'ABS', '130/90-16', '150/80-16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1811, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 139, 2800, '9.5:1', 101.6, 113, 'Air', 'Injection. Closed Loop Sequential Port', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2553, 1029, 1283, 1646, 692, NULL, 370, 354, NULL),
(1502, 'indian-chief-classic-2017', 'CRUISER', 'Want to experience the purest expression of the Indian Motorcycle Company®? Look no further than the iconic Chief® Classic. Abundant power. Timeless style. Restless innovation. And at its heart, the legendary Thunder Stroke® 111 V-Twin. This is our most decorated bike ever. And after one ride, you’ll know exactly why', 'Cast Aluminum Frame with Integrated Air-Box', 'Telescopic fork (curso 119 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Single shock (curso 94 mm (3.7 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'ABS', '130/90-B16', '150/80-B16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1811, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 161.1, 3000, '9.5:1', 101.6, 113, 'Air', 'Injection. Closed Loop Sequential Port injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2630, 1000, 1176, 1730, 660, 140, 357, 341, NULL),
(1503, 'indian-chief-dark-horse-2018', 'CRUISER', 'The Indian Chief Dark Horse maintains the legendary Indian Chief styling, while taking an unpolished and raw approach to its finish with blacked-out styling', 'Cast Aluminum Frame with Integrated Air-Box', 'Telescopic fork (curso 119 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Single shock (curso 94 mm (3.7 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'ABS', '130/90-B16', '150/80-B16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1811, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 150, 2100, '9.5:1', 101.6, 113, 'Air', 'Injection. Closed Loop Sequential Port injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2630, 1000, 1176, 1730, 660, 140, 357, 341, 20.8),
(1504, 'indian-chief-springfield-2017', 'TOURING', 'You. The road. Nothing else. That’s the definition of pure riding. And that’s exactly what you get with the Indian Springfield™, along with features like a keyless ignition. Quick-release windshield. And remote-locking saddlebags. Want more? Add a premium audio system, should you ever want a new soundtrack to go with the satisfying rumble of your Thunder Stroke 111 engine', 'Cast Aluminum Frame with Integrated Air-Box', 'Telescopic forks with air adjust (curso 119 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Single shock (curso 114 mm (4.5 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. 4 piston caliper Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. 2-piston caliper Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'ABS', '130/90-B16', '180/60-B16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1811, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 161.6, 3000, '9.5:1', 101, 113, 'Air', 'Injection. Closed Loop Sequential Port Fuel Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2583, 990, 1442, 1701, 660, 142, 391, 376, 20.8),
(1505, 'indian-chief-springfield-2018', 'TOURING', 'This powerful, versatile, next-generation bagger treats riders to a hint of tradition and a strong dose of distinctive attitude', 'Cast Aluminum Frame with Integrated Air-Box', 'Telescopic forks with air adjust (curso 119 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Single shock (curso 114 mm (4.5 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. 4 piston caliper Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. 2-piston caliper Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'ABS', '130/90-B16', '180/60-B16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1811, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 150, 2100, '9.5:1', 101, 113, 'Air', 'Injection. Closed Loop Sequential Port Fuel Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2583, 990, 1442, 1701, 660, 142, 388, 372, 20.8),
(1506, 'indian-chieftain-2016', 'CRUISER', 'A rolling testament to American ingenuity. The first faired, hard bagger Indian motorcycle is a stunning bike. Cruise around town. Roar down the freeway with the music blasting. Take a long trip across state lines. Then put down the side stand, take a step back and look at one of the most striking motorcycles ever made', 'Aluminium', 'Telescopic forks with air adjust (curso 119 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Single shock (curso 114 mm (4.5 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. 4 piston caliper Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. 2-piston caliper Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'ABS', '130/90-16', '180/60-16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1811, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 138.9, 2800, '9.5:1', NULL, NULL, 'Air', 'Injection. Closed Loop Sequential Port Fuel Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2571, 1000, 1388, 1668, 660, NULL, 389, 373, 20.8),
(1507, 'indian-chieftain-2017', 'CRUISER', 'No bike can make you a leader. But this one certainly sends a message. Powered by our formidable Thunder Stroke® 111 engine, and packed with features to keep everything—and everyone—in check. Like a power windshield. 100-watt premium audio system. Remote-locking saddlebags. And poised, confident handling. You’ve already earned the bragging rights. Own them. Be legendary', 'Aluminium', 'Telescopic forks with air adjust (curso 119 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Single shock (curso 114 mm (4.5 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. 4 piston caliper Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. 2-piston caliper Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'ABS', '130/90-16', '180/60-16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1811, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 161.1, 3000, '9.5:1', NULL, NULL, 'Air', 'Injection. Closed Loop Sequential Port Fuel Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2571, 1000, 1388, 1668, 660, NULL, 391, 376, 20.8),
(1508, 'indian-chieftain-dark-horse-2018', 'CRUISER', 'Introducing Indian Motorcycle® Ride Command™. Featuring the largest touchscreen display. An easy-to-use interface. Customizable information displays. Two-finger touch, with pinch to zoom. And a lot more', 'Cast aluminium', 'Telescopic forks with air adjustment (curso 119 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Single shock (curso 114 mm (4.5 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. 4 piston caliper Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. 2-piston caliper Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'ABS', '130/60-B19', '180/60-R16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1811, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 150, 2100, '9.5:1', 101, 113, 'Air', 'Injection. Closed Loop Sequential Port Fuel Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2571, 1000, 1388, 1668, 660, NULL, 381, 370, 20.8),
(1509, 'indian-chief-vintage-2017', NULL, 'It may look like something from the past. But this Chief® Vintage is all about the future. Behind those genuine-leather saddle bags and whitewall tires lurks something unexpected: progress. A keyless ignition. Cruise control. And a quick-release windshield for cruising around town', 'Cast Aluminum Frame with Integrated Air-Box', 'Telescopic fork (curso 119 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Single shock (curso 94 mm (3.7 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. 4 piston caliper Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. 2-piston caliper Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'ABS', '130/90-16', '150/80-16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1811, 2, NULL, 75, 5200, 161.1, 3000, '9.5:1', 101, 113, 'Air', 'Injection. Closed Loop Sequential Port Fuel Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2634, 1001, 1490, 1730, 692, NULL, 388, 374, 20.8),
(1510, 'indian-chief-vintage-2015', NULL, 'The Thunder Stroke® 111 engine delivers an incredible 119 ft-lbs of torque and features styling that pays tribute to legendary Indian Motorcycle® engines of the past', 'Cast Aluminum Frame with Integrated Air-Box', 'Telescopic fork (curso 119 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Single shock (curso 94 mm (3.7 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. Dual Caliper', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. Single caliper', 'ABS', '130/90-16', '150/80-16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1811, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 138.9, 3000, '9.5:1', 101, 113, 'Air', 'Injection. Closed Loop Sequential Port Fuel Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2553, 1029, 1518, 1646, 692, NULL, 371, 364, 20.8),
(1511, 'indian-chief-vintage-2016', NULL, 'A look that takes signature pieces of our storied past and brings them forward in all the right ways. Desert Tan Genuine Leather saddlebags, chrome front end and an air-cooled Thunder Stroke® 111 Engine that look like they´re straight out of an old photo', 'Cast Aluminum Frame with Integrated Air-Box', 'Telescopic fork (curso 119 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Single shock (curso 94 mm (3.7 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. 4 piston caliper Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. 2-piston caliper Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'ABS', '130/90-16', '150/80-16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1811, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 138.9, 3000, '9.5:1', 101, 113, 'Air', 'Injection. Closed Loop Sequential Port Fuel Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2634, 1001, 1490, 1730, 692, NULL, 379, 364, 20.8),
(1512, 'indian-roadmaster-2016', 'TOURING', 'You have everything you need to turn countless miles of yellow-dotted lines into stories', 'Cast Aluminum Frame with Integrated Air-Box', 'Telescopic forks (curso 119 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Single shock with air adjust (curso 114 mm (4.5 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. 4 piston caliper Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. 2-piston caliper Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'ABS', '130/90-16', '180/60-16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1811, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 138.9, 2600, '9.5:1', 101, 113, 'Air', 'Injection. Closed Loop Sequential Port Fuel Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2656, 1012, 1572, 1668, 673, NULL, 421, 406, 20.8),
(1513, 'indian-roadmaster-2018', 'TOURING', 'The Indian® Roadmaster™ reflects pure American Luxury. Building upon the iconic Roadmaster name used by Indian in the 1940s, the new Roadmaster reimagines Indian Motorcycle comfort, styling and performance out on the open road, for the long haul', 'Cast Aluminum Frame with Integrated Air-Box', 'Telescopic forks (curso 119 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Single shock with air adjust (curso 114 mm (4.5 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. 4 piston caliper Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. 2-piston caliper Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'ABS', '130/90-B16', '180/60-R16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1811, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 151, 2100, '9.5:1', 101, 113, 'Air', 'Injection. Closed Loop Sequential Port Fuel Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2656, 1012, 1572, 1668, 673, 140, 422, 408, 20.8),
(1514, 'indian-roadmaster-2017', 'TOURING', 'If you have the means, you can buy almost any bike. But an Indian® Roadmaster® has to be earned. On the road. Two up. Mile after glorious mile. This is a machine built for the long haul. With the craftsmanship and innovation discerning riders demand. So forget the shortcuts. Get out there and explore', 'Cast Aluminum Frame with Integrated Air-Box', 'Telescopic forks (curso 119 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Single shock with air adjust (curso 114 mm (4.5 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs. 4 piston caliper Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Floating disc. 2-piston caliper Disco de 300 mm (11.8 inches)', 'ABS', '130/90-16', '180/60-16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1811, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 161.1, 3000, '9.5:1', 101, 113, 'Air', 'Injection. Closed Loop Sequential Port Fuel Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2656, 1012, 1572, 1668, 673, NULL, 428, 414, 20.8),
(1515, 'indian-scout-2018', 'CRUISER', NULL, NULL, 'Telescopic fork (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Dual shock (curso 76 mm (3.0 inches))', 'Single disc. Optional ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 298 mm (11.7 inches)', 'Single disc. Optional ABS. Single-piston caliper Disco de 298 mm (11.7 inches)', 'ABS', '130/90-16', '150/80-16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1133, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 97, 5600, '10.7:1', 99, 73.6, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Closed Loop Sequential Port Fuel Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2311, 880, 1207, 1562, 643, 135, 257, 247, 12.5),
(1516, 'indian-scout-2016', 'CRUISER', 'One look at that leaned-forward tank, and you know this is a bike that got all of the details right. The same masterful balance that conquered the Wall of Death, carried the Wrecking Crew to victory and made the world´s fastest Indian', NULL, 'Telescopic fork (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Dual shock (curso 76 mm (3.0 inches))', 'Single disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 298 mm (11.7 inches)', 'Single disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 298 mm (11.7 inches)', NULL, '130/90-16', '150/80-16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1131, 2, NULL, 100, NULL, 97.7, 5900, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Closed Loop Sequential Port Fuel Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2311, 879, 1207, 1562, 643, 135, 254, 247, 12.5),
(1517, 'indian-scout-2017', 'CRUISER', 'It’s not too late to rewrite your script. Change the plot. Add more action. And there’s no better bike to get you there than the Indian® Scout®. With a modern, lightweight chassis. A lower center of gravity. And a liquid-cooled 100-horsepower V-Twin that opens up and never stops', NULL, 'Telescopic fork (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Dual shock (curso 76 mm (3.0 inches))', 'Single disc. Optional ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 298 mm (11.7 inches)', 'Single disc. Optional ABS. Single-piston caliper Disco de 298 mm (11.7 inches)', 'ABS', '130/90-16', '150/80-16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1131, 2, NULL, 100, NULL, 97.7, 5900, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Closed Loop Sequential Port Fuel Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2311, 879, 1207, 1562, 643, 135, 254, 247, 12.5),
(1518, 'indian-scout-2015', 'CRUISER', 'Like its iconic forerunner, the all-new Indian® Scout ™ is an innovative and aesthetically stunning American cruiser. It introduces the first-ever liquid-cooled Indian Motorcycle engine - an efficient and reliable 69 cubic inch V-twin - for impressive power on demand. This new model carries the legendary Indian® Scout™ name into the future in authentic Indian® Motorcycle® style', NULL, 'Telescopic fork (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Dual shock (curso 76 mm (3.0 inches))', 'Single disc. Two-piston calipers Disco de 298 mm (11.7 inches)', 'Single disc. Single-piston caliper Disco de 298 mm (11.7 inches)', NULL, '130/90-H16', '150/80-H16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1131, 2, NULL, 100, NULL, 97.7, 5900, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Closed Loop Sequential Port Fuel Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2311, 879, 1207, 1562, 643, 135, 244, 244, 12.5),
(1519, 'indian-scout-bobber-2018', 'CRUISER', 'Slammed stance. Chopped fenders. Knobby tires. Blacked-out and stripped-down. The Scout Bobber is no frills, all attitude. The only place we didn’t hold back: the 100 barely-tamed horsepower of a 69-cubic-inch V-Twin. Grab on. Hold fast. Your legend', NULL, 'Telescopic fork (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Dual shock (curso 76 mm (3.0 inches))', 'Single disc. Optional ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 298 mm (11.7 inches)', 'Single disc. Optional ABS. Single-piston caliper Disco de 298 mm (11.7 inches)', 'ABS', '130/90-16', '150/80-16', 'V2, four-stroke', 1133, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 97, 5600, '10.7:1', 99, 73.6, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Closed Loop Sequential Port Fuel Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Belt', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2276, 926, 1154, 1562, 649, 123, 255, 245, 12.5),
