(1565, 'ktm-990-duke-2024', 'NAKED', 'Hitting every target with devastating accuracy, the all-new KTM 990 DUKE brings unmatched levels of precision to the street. Packing 123 HP and 103 Nm into an all-new frame, with adjustable WP APEX suspension and highly tuned electronics to boot, this - put simply - is the lightest, sharpest, most performance focused mid-class NAKED motorcycle to ever wear the DUKE nameplate', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 947, NULL, NULL, 121.4, NULL, 103, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.7, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1476, NULL, NULL, 179, NULL, 14.8),
