(1621, 'ktm-exc-300-six-days-2025', 'OFF_ROAD', 'For 2025, the KTM 300 EXC SIX DAYS retains its accolade as the winningest enduro weapon ever created. Boasting a bulletproof powertrain, unmatched top-end speed, and sublime handling credentials, it´s once again ready to take on whatever the world of enduro can throw at it', 'Chrome-molybdenum steel central-tube frame', 'WP XPLOR-USD, Ø 48 mm (curso 300 mm (11.8 inches))', 'WP Xplor PDS shock absorber (curso 310 mm (12.2 inches))', 'Single disc. Brembo 2-piston floating caliper Disco de 260 mm (10.2 inches)', 'Single disc. Brembo single-piston floating calliper, brake disc Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', NULL, '1.60-21', '2.15-18', 'Single cylinder, two-stroke', 293, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 72, 72, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, 2.79, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1489, 960, 370, 104.9, 103.9, 9),
