(1628, 'ktm-exc-f-250-2016', 'OFF_ROAD', 'An unbeatable power-to-weight ratio, low purchase and ownership costs as well as straightforward technology make the 250 EXC the prime choice for extremely heavy Enduro duty', 'Central tube frame made of chrome molybdenum steel tubing', 'WP USD Ø 48 mm (curso 300 mm (11.8 inches))', 'WP PDS shock absorber (curso 335 mm (13.2 inches))', 'Single disc. Brake calipers on floating bearings Disco de 260 mm (10.2 inches)', 'Single disc. Brake calipers on floating bearings Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Single cylinder, two-stroke', 249, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 66.4, 72, 'Liquid', 'Carburettor', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1482, 960, 355, 101.9, 101.9, 9.5),
(1629, 'ktm-exc-f-250-2023', 'OFF_ROAD', 'Thanks to its groundbreaking TPI technology, this extreme machine continues to reach new heights, clearly demonstrating KTM´s unrelenting commitment to 2-stroke development. Besides the renowned benefits of excellent fuel efficiency, clean exhaust emissions and the removed need for jetting, the KTM 250 EXC features a dynamic, lightweight frame', 'Central double-cradle-type 25CrMo4 steel', 'WP XPLOR-USD, Ø 48 mm (curso 300 mm (11.8 inches))', 'WP Xplor PDS shock absorber (curso 310 mm (12.2 inches))', 'Single disc. Brake calipers on floating bearings Disco de 260 mm (10.2 inches)', 'Single disc. Brake calipers on floating bearings Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', NULL, '1.60-21', '2.15-18', 'Single cylinder, two-stroke', 249, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 66.4, 72, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1482, 960, 370, 103.4, 103.4, 9),
(1630, 'ktm-exc-f-250-2015', 'OFF_ROAD', 'The engine receives a new TVC exhaust control setting for 2015, opening at a 200-rpm higher engine speed. This results in smoother power development. The ignition curve has been optimised for this new TVC setting. The carburettor settings have also been revised with a view to better and more uniform engine characteristics', 'Central tube frame made of chrome molybdenum steel tubing', 'WP Suspension Up Side Down 4860 MXMA PA (curso 300 mm (11.8 inches))', 'WP Suspension PDS 5018 DCC (curso 335 mm (13.2 inches))', 'Single disc. Brake calipers on floating bearings Disco de 260 mm (10.2 inches)', 'Single disc. Brake calipers on floating bearings Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Single cylinder, two-stroke', 249, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 66.4, 72, 'Liquid', 'Carburettor', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1482, 960, 355, 101.9, 101.9, 9.5),
(1631, 'ktm-exc-f-250-2025', 'OFF_ROAD', 'The 2025 KTM 250 EXC presents enduro riders with the ultimate combination of power and rideability, setting the benchmark in the highly contested E1 class. Thanks to its groundbreaking frame, closed-cartridge suspension, and epic TBI technology, it remains an extreme machine that continues to reach new heights', 'Central double-cradle-type 25CrMo4 steel', 'WP XPLOR-USD, Ø 48 mm (curso 300 mm (11.8 inches))', 'WP Xplor PDS shock absorber (curso 310 mm (12.2 inches))', 'Single disc. Brake calipers on floating bearings Disco de 260 mm (10.2 inches)', 'Single disc. Brake calipers on floating bearings Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', NULL, '1.60-21', '2.15-18', 'Single cylinder, two-stroke', 249, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 66.4, 72, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1489, 960, 370, 104.6, 103.4, 9),
(1632, 'ktm-exc-f-250-2024', 'OFF_ROAD', 'The 2024 KTM 250 EXC presents enduro riders with the ultimate combination of power and rideability, setting the benchmark in the highly contested E1 class. Thanks to its groundbreaking new frame, suspension, and TBI technology, this extreme machine continues to reach new heights. How far you push, thought, it is up to you', 'Central double-cradle-type 25CrMo4 steel', 'WP XPLOR-USD, Ø 48 mm (curso 300 mm (11.8 inches))', 'WP Xplor PDS shock absorber (curso 310 mm (12.2 inches))', 'Single disc. Brake calipers on floating bearings Disco de 260 mm (10.2 inches)', 'Single disc. Brake calipers on floating bearings Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', NULL, '1.60-21', '2.15-18', 'Single cylinder, two-stroke', 249, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 66.4, 72, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1482, 960, 370, 103.9, 103.4, 9),
(1633, 'ktm-exc-f-250-2017', 'OFF_ROAD', 'This compact firecracker truly outshines the competition with its ripping performance and is the right choice for lovers of low purchase and maintenance costs. Oh, and of course don’t forget that belly tingling 2-stroke symphony when you’re on the pipe', 'Central tube frame made of chrome molybdenum steel tubing', 'WP USD Ø 48 mm (curso 300 mm (11.8 inches))', 'WP Xplor PDS shock absorber (curso 310 mm (12.2 inches))', 'Single disc. Brake calipers on floating bearings Disco de 260 mm (10.2 inches)', 'Single disc. Brake calipers on floating bearings Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Single cylinder, two-stroke', 249, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 66.4, 72, 'Liquid', 'Carburettor. Mikuni TMX', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1482, 960, 370, 100, 100, 9.5),
(1634, 'ktm-exc-f-250-six-days-2015', 'OFF_ROAD', 'The airbox on the KTM 250 EXC Six Days allows maximum air to pass through, but minimal dust and spray. Replacement of the twin-air filter takes approx. 15 seconds, without any tools. Absolutely ´READY TO RACE´', 'Central tube frame made of chrome molybdenum steel tubing', 'WP Suspension Up Side Down 4860 MXMA PA (curso 300 mm (11.8 inches))', 'WP Suspension PDS 5018 DCC (curso 335 mm (13.2 inches))', 'Single disc. Brake calipers on floating bearings Disco de 260 mm (10.2 inches)', 'Single disc. Brake calipers on floating bearings Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Single cylinder, two-stroke', 249, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 66.4, 72, 'Liquid', 'Carburettor', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1482, 960, 355, 101.9, 101.9, 9.5),
(1635, 'ktm-exc-f-300-six-days-2015', 'OFF_ROAD', 'The 300 EXC has demonstrated its abilities clearly in recent years in many offroad competitions. The combination of massive two-stroke performance, unrivalled torque and ultra-manoeuvrable chassis makes it the first choice when the going gets really tough. There´s no better power-to-weight ratio as standard on the market. The compact two-stroke engine supplies the best performance that money can currently buy in the E3 class', 'Central tube frame made of chrome molybdenum steel tubing', 'WP Suspension Up Side Down 4860 MXMA PA (curso 300 mm (11.8 inches))', 'WP Suspension PDS 5018 DCC (curso 335 mm (13.2 inches))', 'Single disc. Brake calipers on floating bearings Disco de 260 mm (10.2 inches)', 'Single disc. Brake calipers on floating bearings Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Single cylinder, two-stroke', 293, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 72, 72, 'Liquid', 'Carburettor', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1482, 960, 355, 102.1, 102.1, 9.5),
(1636, 'ktm-exc-f-350-six-days-2021', 'OFF_ROAD', 'No other brand stands up to the success of KTM when it comes to enduro, and this is clearly evident in the biggest competition on the calendar, the ´International Six Days Enduro´ (ISDE)', 'Chrome-molybdenum steel central-tube frame', 'WP-USD Xplor 48 with preload adjuster (curso 300 mm (11.8 inches))', 'WP Xplor PDS shock absorber (curso 310 mm (12.2 inches))', 'Single disc. Brembo twin-piston floating calliper Disco de 260 mm (10.2 inches)', 'Single disc. Brembo single-piston floating calliper Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 350, 1, NULL, 45, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 88, 57.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1482, 960, 355, 104.3, 104.3, 9),
(1637, 'ktm-exc-f-350-six-days-2019', 'OFF_ROAD', 'Just like rest of the 2019 SIX DAYS enduro range, the 350 EXC-F SIX DAYS features class-leading lightness. This makes it one of the most agile and compact 4-stroke enduro machines available', 'Chrome-molybdenum steel central-tube frame', 'WP-USD Xplor 48 with preload adjuster (curso 300 mm (11.8 inches))', 'WP Xplor PDS shock absorber (curso 310 mm (12.2 inches))', 'Single disc. Brake calipers on floating bearings Disco de 260 mm (10.2 inches)', 'Single disc. Brake calipers on floating bearings Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', NULL, '90/90-M21', '140/80-M18', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 350, 1, NULL, 45, NULL, NULL, NULL, '12.3:1', 88, 57.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1482, 960, 355, 104.5, 104.5, 8.5),
(1638, 'ktm-exc-f-350-six-days-2024', 'OFF_ROAD', 'With an all-new frame, closed-cartridge suspension, new bodywork, and a renewed ability to challenge for the win, the KTM 350 EXC-F SIX DAYS remains the one to beat', 'Central double-cradle-type 25CrMo4 steel', 'WP XPLOR-USD, Ø 48 mm (curso 300 mm (11.8 inches))', 'WP Xplor PDS shock absorber (curso 310 mm (12.2 inches))', 'Single disc. Brake calipers on floating bearings Disco de 260 mm (10.2 inches)', 'Single disc. Brake calipers on floating bearings Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', NULL, '1.6-21', '2.15-19', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 350, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 88, 57.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, 3.83, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 960, 355, 107.3, 103.8, 8.5),
(1639, 'ktm-exc-f-350-six-days-2018', 'OFF_ROAD', 'The state-of-the-art Keihin engine management system with electronic fuel injection features a 42mm throttle body. Thanks to its unique injector position, the engine’s response gives a whole new meaning to the word ‘instantaneous’', 'Chrome-molybdenum steel central-tube frame', 'WP-USD Xplor 48 with preload adjuster (curso 300 mm (11.8 inches))', 'WP Xplor PDS shock absorber (curso 310 mm (12.2 inches))', 'Single disc. Brake calipers on floating bearings Disco de 260 mm (10.2 inches)', 'Single disc. Brake calipers on floating bearings Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 350, 1, NULL, 45, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 88, 57.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1482, 960, 355, 104.5, 104.5, 8.5),
(1640, 'ktm-exc-f-350-six-days-2023', 'OFF_ROAD', 'The KTM 350 EXC-F SIX DAYS once again digs in its rear knobblies, holding its own as the king of the middle ground. With well-documented performance and agility, paired with top-shelf KTM SIX DAYS components - not to mention a trophy room bigger than most - the 2023 KTM 350 EXC-F SIX DAYS is set for another year of podium finishes', 'Central double-cradle-type 25CrMo4 steel', 'WP XPLOR-USD, Ø 48 mm (curso 300 mm (11.8 inches))', 'WP Xplor PDS shock absorber (curso 310 mm (12.2 inches))', 'Single disc. Brake calipers on floating bearings Disco de 260 mm (10.2 inches)', 'Single disc. Brake calipers on floating bearings Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', NULL, '1.6-21', '2.15-19', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 350, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 88, 57.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, 3.83, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 960, 355, 103.8, 103.8, 9.2),
(1641, 'ktm-exc-f-350-six-days-2022', 'OFF_ROAD', 'The KTM 350 EXC-F SIX DAYS once again digs in its rear knobblies, holding its own as the king of the middle ground. With well-documented performance and agility, paired with top-shelf KTM SIX DAYS components - not to mention a trophy room bigger than most - the 2022 KTM 350 EXC-F SIX DAYS is set for another year of podium finishes', 'Central double-cradle-type 25CrMo4 steel', 'WP XPLOR-USD, Ø 48 mm (curso 300 mm (11.8 inches))', 'WP Xplor PDS shock absorber (curso 310 mm (12.2 inches))', 'Single disc. Brembo twin-piston floating calliper Disco de 260 mm (10.2 inches)', 'Single disc. Brembo single-piston floating calliper Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', NULL, '1.60-21', '2.15-18', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 350, 1, NULL, 45, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 88, 57.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1482, 960, 355, 104.3, 104.3, 9),
(1642, 'ktm-exc-f-350-six-days-2020', 'OFF_ROAD', 'KTM engineers take weight loss seriously. As a result, they have crafted the 2020 KTM EXC-F models to be the slimmest, lightest and quickest-turning enduro bikes available. And with an E-starter as standard, getting the big single turned over is as simple as pressing a button', 'Chrome-molybdenum steel central-tube frame', 'WP-USD Xplor 48 with preload adjuster (curso 300 mm (11.8 inches))', 'WP Xplor PDS shock absorber (curso 310 mm (12.2 inches))', 'Single disc. Brembo twin-piston floating calliper Disco de 260 mm (10.2 inches)', 'Single disc. Brembo single-piston floating calliper Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 350, 1, NULL, 45, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 88, 57.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1482, 960, 355, 104.3, 104.3, 9),
(1643, 'ktm-exc-f-350-six-days-2026', 'OFF_ROAD', 'The first KTM bearing the SIX DAYS name tore onto the scene way back in 1996. Back then, there was nothing to beat the KTM 360 EXC for sheer versatility. Nearly 30 years later, the 2025 KTM 350 EXC-F SIX DAYS picks up the baton to continue that trend. With a class-leading frame, closed-cartridge suspension, new bodywork, and a renewed ability to challenge for the win, the 2025 KTM 350 EXC-F SIX DAYS remains the one to beat', 'Central double-cradle-type 25CrMo4 steel', 'WP XPLOR-USD, Ø 48 mm (curso 300 mm (11.8 inches))', 'WP Xplor PDS shock absorber (curso 310 mm (12.2 inches))', 'Single disc. Brake calipers on floating bearings Disco de 260 mm (10.2 inches)', 'Single disc. Brake calipers on floating bearings Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', NULL, '1.6-21', '2.15-19', 'Single cylinder, four-stroke', 350, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 88, 57.5, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, 3.83, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1489, 960, 355, 107.7, 103.8, 8.5),
