(1650, 'ktm-super-adventure-1290-2017', 'ADVENTURE', 'Different modes for the various assistance systems can be selected using a mode switch on the left side of the handlebar. It´s very simple and intuitive: ´up´ and ´down´ through the menu selection, select the desired menu item with the left button, confirm it with the right, job done!', 'Chromium-Molybdenum steel trellis frame, powder coated', 'WP Semi-active suspension USD Ø 48 mm (curso 200 mm (7.9 inches))', 'WP Semi-active suspension monoshock (curso 200 mm (7.9 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 267 mm (10.5 inches)', 'ABS', NULL, NULL, 'V2, four-stroke', 1301, 2, NULL, 160, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1560, 860, 220, 229, 229, 30),
(1651, 'ktm-super-adventure-1290-2016', 'ADVENTURE', 'Different modes for the various assistance systems can be selected using a mode switch on the left side of the handlebar. It´s very simple and intuitive: ´up´ and ´down´ through the menu selection, select the desired menu item with the left button, confirm it with the right, job done!', 'Chromium-Molybdenum steel trellis frame, powder coated', 'WP Semi-active suspension USD Ø 48 mm (curso 200 mm (7.9 inches))', 'WP Semi-active suspension monoshock (curso 200 mm (7.9 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 267 mm (10.5 inches)', 'ABS', NULL, NULL, 'V2, four-stroke', 1301, 2, NULL, 160, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1560, 860, 220, 229, 229, 30),
(1652, 'ktm-super-adventure-1290-r-2023', 'ADVENTURE', 'Pick a point on a map, drop a pin, and hit the road. The KTM 1290 SUPER ADVENTURE R is engineered to cross the wildest, most challenging terrain with unmatched ability and class-leading performance', 'Chrome-moly tubular space frame, powder-coated', 'WP Xplor USD Ø 48 mm (curso 220 mm (8.7 inches))', 'WP Xplor PDS shock absorber (curso 220 mm (8.7 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 267 mm (10.5 inches)', 'ABS', '90/90-21', '150/70-18', 'V2, four-stroke', 1301, 2, NULL, 158.2, NULL, 138, NULL, NULL, 108, 71, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Keihin', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, 5.7, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1580, 880, 250, 221, 221, 23),
(1653, 'ktm-super-adventure-1290-r-2017', 'ADVENTURE', 'True adventure takes guts, so KTM’s rally experts brought out the big guns and packed 1.301cc, 140 Nm of torque and 160 hp into the world’s most advanced Travel Enduro chassis', 'Chromium-Molybdenum steel trellis frame, powder coated', 'WP USD Ø 48 mm (curso 220 mm (8.7 inches))', 'WP-PDS Monoshock (curso 220 mm (8.7 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 267 mm (10.5 inches)', 'ABS', NULL, NULL, 'V2, four-stroke', 1301, 2, NULL, 160, NULL, 140, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1580, 890, 250, 217, 217, 23),
(1654, 'ktm-super-adventure-1290-r-2018', 'ADVENTURE', 'Based on the 1,301cc V-twin of the KTM 1290 SUPER DUKE R, aka “The Beast”, the KTM 1290 SUPER ADVENTURE R is clearly the Alpha in its segment', 'Chromium-Molybdenum steel trellis frame, powder coated', 'WP USD Ø 48 mm (curso 220 mm (8.7 inches))', 'WP-PDS Monoshock (curso 220 mm (8.7 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 267 mm (10.5 inches)', 'ABS', '90/90-21', '150/70-18', 'V2, four-stroke', 1301, 2, NULL, 160, NULL, 140, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1580, 890, 250, 217, 217, 23),
(1655, 'ktm-super-adventure-1290-r-2024', 'ADVENTURE', 'From the Skeleton Coast to the Himalayas, the 1290 SUPER ADVENTURE R is engineered to cross the wildest, most challenging terrain with unmatched ability and class-leading performance. Not only has it proven itself to be without peers in the large-capacity extreme adventure segment, but it also remains the ultimate READY TO RACE choice in travel machines for hardened cross-country nomads', 'Chrome-moly tubular space frame, powder-coated', 'WP Xplor USD Ø 48 mm (curso 220 mm (8.7 inches))', 'WP Xplor PDS shock absorber (curso 220 mm (8.7 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 267 mm (10.5 inches)', 'ABS', '90/90-21', '150/70-18', 'V2, four-stroke', 1301, 2, NULL, 158.2, NULL, 138, NULL, NULL, 108, 71, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Keihin', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, 5.7, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1580, 880, 250, 221, 221, 23),
(1656, 'ktm-super-adventure-1290-s-2024', 'ADVENTURE', 'For 2024, the KTM 1290 SUPER ADVENTURE S sets the benchmark for sporty Adventure travel. Not only does it continue to deliver class-leading technology like Adaptive Cruise Control and Semi-active Suspension to the street, but it also brings real-world usability to the dirt. Rider-focused ergonomics', 'Chromium-Molybdenum steel trellis frame, powder coated', 'WP Semi-active suspension, Upside-Down Ø 48 mm (curso 200 mm (7.9 inches))', 'WP Semi-active suspension monoshock (curso 200 mm (7.9 inches))', 'Double disc. Brembo four-piston radial fixed calliper, brake discs, floating. ABS Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. Brembo twin-piston fixed calliper, brake disc. ABS Disco de 267 mm (10.5 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR19', '170/60-ZR17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1301, 2, NULL, 160, NULL, 138, NULL, '13.1:1', 108, 71, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Keihin, 52 mm', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, 5.39, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1580, 849, 223, 220, 220, 23),
(1657, 'ktm-super-adventure-1290-s-2017', 'ADVENTURE', 'Whack the throttle wide open in the middle of a nasty corner. Brake hard while fully leant over. No harm is done - just grin and rocket on. Even when you’re bending the laws of physics, KTM’s combination of 160 hp, 140 Nm of torque and a mere 238 kg is kept in check by the most advanced electronics in the world of motorcycling', 'Chromium-Molybdenum steel trellis frame, powder coated', 'WP Semi-active suspension USD Ø 48 mm (curso 200 mm (7.9 inches))', 'WP Semi-active suspension monoshock (curso 200 mm (7.9 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 267 mm (10.5 inches)', 'ABS', NULL, NULL, 'V2, four-stroke', 1301, 2, NULL, 160, NULL, 140, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1580, 860, 220, 215, 215, 23),
(1658, 'ktm-super-adventure-1290-s-2019', 'ADVENTURE', 'Whether it’s cracking the throttle wide open out of an exhilarating corner, or braking hard while tipping it in, bending the laws of physics is what the KTM 1290 SUPER ADVENTURE S is made for. Its combination of 160 hp (119 kW), 140 Nm of torque and a mere 215 kg dry weight is kept in check by the most advanced electronics in the world of motorcycling', 'Chromium-Molybdenum steel trellis frame, powder coated', 'WP Semi-active suspension USD Ø 48 mm (curso 200 mm (7.9 inches))', 'WP Semi-active suspension monoshock (curso 200 mm (7.9 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 267 mm (10.5 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR19', '170/60-ZR17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1301, 2, NULL, 160, NULL, 140, NULL, NULL, 108, 71, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1580, 860, 220, 215, 215, 23),
(1659, 'ktm-super-adventure-1290-s-2018', 'ADVENTURE', 'Stability and control are the foundations of riding fun. With its ultra-lightweight tubular trellis frame, a high strength, die-cast, open-lattice swingarm and top quality components from WP Suspension, the KTM 1290 SUPER ADVENTURE S will cement a grin on your face', 'Chromium-Molybdenum steel trellis frame, powder coated', 'WP Semi-active suspension USD Ø 48 mm (curso 200 mm (7.9 inches))', 'WP Semi-active suspension monoshock (curso 200 mm (7.9 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS. Four-piston calipers. Radially mounted Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Two-piston calipers Disco de 267 mm (10.5 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR19', '170/60-ZR17', 'V2, four-stroke', 1301, 2, NULL, 160, NULL, 140, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1580, 860, 220, 215, 215, 23),
