(1779, 'mv-agusta-brutale-910r-2007', 'NAKED', 'Captivating style, a great temperament and engine technology par excellance. But also a fanatical eye to detail and sophisticated fittings', 'CrMo Steel tubular trellis (TIG welded) and aluminium alloy', 'Upside-down telescopic hydraulic fork with rebound-compression damping and spring preload adjustment', 'Progressive, single shock absorber with rebound compression damping and spring preload', 'Double disc Disco de 310 mm (12.2 inches)', 'Single disc Disco de 210 mm (8.3 inches)', NULL, '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 908, 4, 4, 135, NULL, 96, 7900, '13:1', NULL, NULL, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. Mulitpoint electronic injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 258, NULL, NULL, 2007, NULL, NULL, 1411, NULL, 135, 185, 185, 15.1),
(1780, 'mv-agusta-brutale-910r-2008', 'NAKED', 'Elegant lines, a powerful roar from the engine, rousing performance. Together, the power of 146 HP and the joy of a frame made to handle it, unite to restore the passion for motorcycling to what it should be', 'CrMo Steel tubular trellis (TIG welded) and aluminium alloy', 'Upside-down telescopic hydraulic fork with rebound-compression damping and spring preload adjustment (curso 129 mm (5.1 inches))', 'Progressive, single shock absorber with rebound compression damping and spring preload (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Double disc Disco de 310 mm (12.2 inches)', 'Single disc Disco de 210 mm (8.3 inches)', NULL, '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 908, 4, 4, 139, 11000, 96, 7900, '13:1', NULL, NULL, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. Mulitpoint electronic injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 262, NULL, NULL, 2007, 760, NULL, 1411, NULL, 135, 185, 185, 19),
(1781, 'mv-agusta-brutale-910s-2007', 'NAKED', 'The massive 9.8 kgm of torque and 136 CV are echoed in the incredible exhaust note from the four-cylinder, radial-valved engine', 'CrMo Steel tubular trellis (TIG welded) and aluminium alloy', 'Upside-down telescopic hydraulic fork with rebound-compression damping and spring preload adjustment', 'Progressive, single shock absorber with rebound compression damping and spring preload', 'Double disc Disco de 310 mm (12.2 inches)', 'Single disc Disco de 210 mm (8.3 inches)', NULL, '120/65-ZR17', '190/50-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 908, 4, 4, 135, NULL, 96, 7900, '13:1', NULL, NULL, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. Mulitpoint electronic injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 258, NULL, NULL, 2007, 685, NULL, 1411, NULL, 135, 185, 185, 15.1),
