(1783, 'mv-agusta-brutale-989r-2009', 'NAKED', 'here has to be passion, brilliance and love. Only an Italian company like MV Agusta could create such a machine', 'CrMo Steel tubular trellis and aluminium alloy', 'Upside-down telescopic hydraulic fork with rebound-compression damping and spring preload adjustment (curso 129 mm (5.1 inches))', 'Progressive, single shock absorber with rebound compression damping and spring preload (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Double disc. 4-piston caliper Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. 4-piston caliper Disco de 210 mm (8.3 inches)', NULL, '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 982, 4, 4, 139, 11000, 96, 8000, '13:1', 79, 50.1, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. “Weber Marelli” 5SM ignition - injection integrated system; induction discharge electronic ignition', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 265, NULL, NULL, 2020, 760, NULL, 1410, NULL, 135, 185, 185, 19),
(1784, 'mv-agusta-f3-800-2014', 'SPORT', NULL, 'ALS Steel Tubular Trellis', 'Marzocchi UPD Telescopic fork (curso 125 mm (4.9 inches))', 'Sachs adjustable monoshock (curso 123 mm (4.8 inches))', 'Double disc. Brembo radial-type monobloc, with 4 piston Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. Brembo with 2 pistons Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', NULL, '120/70-ZR17', '180/55-ZR17', 'In-line three, four-stroke', 798, 3, 4, 148, 13000, 88, 10600, '13:1', 79, 54.3, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 269, NULL, NULL, 2060, 725, NULL, 1380, 812, 115, NULL, 173, 16.5),
(1785, 'mv-agusta-f3-800-2015', 'SPORT', 'More power, more torque, more adrenaline. The outcome? A motorcycle with exceptional handling, an advanced electronics package and a new 800 cc engine that punches out 148 hp and 88 Nm of torque. Coupled with a super-low weight of 173 kg, the resulting power-to-weight ratio puts it in a position to do battle with litre-class Sportbikes', 'ALS Steel Tubular Trellis', 'Marzocchi UPD Telescopic fork (curso 125 mm (4.9 inches))', 'Sachs adjustable monoshock (curso 123 mm (4.8 inches))', 'Double disc. Brembo radial-type monobloc, with 4 piston Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. Brembo with 2 pistons Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', NULL, '120/70-ZR17', '180/55-ZR17', 'In-line three, four-stroke', 798, 3, 4, 148, 13000, 88, 10600, '13:1', 79, 54.3, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 269, NULL, NULL, 2060, 725, NULL, 1380, 812, 115, 173, 173, 16.5),
(1786, 'mv-agusta-f3-800-2016', 'SPORT', 'Bore diameter remains unaltered at 79.0 mm, while the stroke has been increased from 45.9 mm to 54.3 mm, boosting displacement from 675 cc to 798 cc. Power output reaches a stunning 148 hp at 13,000 rpm, with the peak torque of 88 Nm arriving at 10,600 rpm. The rev limiter has been set to kick in at 13,500 rpm', 'ALS Steel Tubular Trellis', 'Marzocchi UPD Telescopic fork (curso 125 mm (4.9 inches))', 'Sachs adjustable monoshock (curso 123 mm (4.8 inches))', 'Double disc. Brembo radial-type monobloc, with 4 piston Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. Brembo with 2 pistons Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', NULL, '120/70-ZR17', '180/55-ZR17', 'In-line three, four-stroke', 798, 3, 4, 148, 13000, 88, 10600, '13:1', 79, 54.3, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 269, NULL, NULL, 2060, 725, NULL, 1380, 805, 125, 173, 173, 16.5),
(1787, 'mv-agusta-f4-1000-2012', 'SPORT', 'Advanced technology and styling are core components of the MV Agusta DNA, clearly visible in the new F4; however as we believe that limits exist only to be exceeded, we continue to design components that help make the F4 even more unique. The list of the MV original special parts has no end, special materials and technological components of the latest generation allow you to increase the performance of new F4 even more as well as the possibility to personalize it aesthetically', 'CrMo Steel tubular trellis', 'Upside-down telescopic hydraulic fork with rebound-compression damping and spring preload adjustment (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Progressive, single shock absorber with rebound compression damping and spring preload (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Double disc. 4-piston Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. 4-piston Disco de 210 mm (8.3 inches)', NULL, '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 1078, 4, 4, 186, 12900, 144, 9000, '13.1:1', 79, 55, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 305, NULL, NULL, 2100, 750, NULL, 1430, 810, 115, 192.5, 192.5, 17),
(1788, 'mv-agusta-f4-1000-2013', 'SPORT', 'Crossing the border of imagination. The new F4 is our best yet, encompassing the latest technology and engine developments. A true state of the art masterpiece. After intense months of design, development and testing MV Agusta have redefined the characteristics of the F4 with an ambitious underlying goal to make the F4 the most advanced hypersport bike on the market', 'CrMo Steel Tubular Trellis', 'Marzocchi “UPSIDE - DOWN” telescopic hydraulic fork with adjustable rebound-compression damping and external spring preload (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Adjustable monoshock with high and low speed compression settings (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Double disc. Brembo radial-type, single-piece with 4 pistons Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc Disco de 210 mm (8.3 inches)', NULL, '120/70-ZR17', '200/55-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 998, 4, 4, 195, 13400, 110.8, 9600, '13.4:1', 79, 50.9, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 291, NULL, NULL, 2115, 750, NULL, 1430, 830, 115, 191, 191, 17),
(1789, 'mv-agusta-f4-1000-2014', 'SPORT', 'Our objective was to create a vehicle that exceeded the expectations of customers based on a new technological platform, focused on electronics and its fundamental contribution improving power delivery of the engine and driving dynamics on the road and on the track. All this combined with a thorough review of the engine to provide competitive performance', 'CrMo Steel Tubular Trellis', 'Marzocchi “UPSIDE - DOWN” telescopic hydraulic fork with adjustable rebound-compression damping and external spring preload (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Adjustable monoshock with high and low speed compression settings (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Double disc. Brembo radial-type, single-piece with 4 pistons Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc Disco de 210 mm (8.3 inches)', NULL, '120/70-ZR17', '200/55-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 998, 4, 4, 195, 13400, 110.8, 9600, '13.4:1', 79, 50.9, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 291, NULL, NULL, 2115, 750, NULL, 1430, 830, 115, 291, 291, 17),
(1790, 'mv-agusta-f4-1000-2015', 'SPORT', 'Breaking down the barriers of imagination. Encompassing cutting-edge technology and the latest engine design, the new F4 is the best yet. A masterpiece. After intense months of development and testing MV Agusta have redefined the characteristics of the F4 to achieve an ambitious goal: to make the F4 the most advanced hypersport bike on the market', 'CrMo Steel Tubular Trellis', 'Marzocchi “UPSIDE - DOWN” telescopic hydraulic fork with adjustable rebound-compression damping and external spring preload (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Adjustable monoshock with high and low speed compression settings (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Double disc. Brembo radial-type, single-piece with 4 pistons Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc Disco de 210 mm (8.3 inches)', NULL, '120/70-ZR17', '200/55-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 998, 4, 4, 195, 13400, 110.8, 9600, '13.4:1', 79, 50.9, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 291, NULL, NULL, 2115, 750, NULL, 1430, 830, 115, 291, 291, 17),
(1791, 'mv-agusta-f4-1000-rr-2013', 'SPORT', 'The F4 RR contains the most advanced engineering solutions, enhanced by a range of technical excellence to offer the complete control of the vehicle and maximum performance: chassis control utilizing vehicle inertia sensors, a unique engine control with Ride-By-Wire system, Öhlins electronic control suspension and steering damper as well as GP spec titanium connecting rods', 'CrMo Steel Tubular Trellis. Aluminium alloy adjustable swingarm pivot height', 'Öhlins EC Nix hydraulic “UPSIDE DOWN” front forks with TiN superficial treatment. Completely adjustable electronically controlled compression and rebound', 'Progressive, single shock absorber Öhlins TTX. Fully adjustable hydraulic electronically controlled compression and rebound damping with manual, spring preload', 'Double disc. Floating disc. Brembo GP radial-type, single-piece with 4 pistons Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc Disco de 210 mm (8.3 inches)', NULL, '120/70-ZR17', '200/55-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 998, 4, 4, 201, 13600, 111, 9600, '13.4:1', 79, 50.9, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Weber Marelli 5SM ignition - injection integrated system; induction discharge electronic ignition', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 298, NULL, NULL, 2115, 750, NULL, 1430, 830, 115, 190, 190, 17),
(1792, 'mv-agusta-f4-1000-rr-2008', 'SPORT', 'An engine, that combined with the massive power of the unprecedented radial braking system and the sublime handling provided by the ultralight Brembo wheels, allows the F4 1000R to ensure its supremacy amongst the elite of the fastest motorcycles in the world', NULL, 'Upside-down telescopic hydraulic fork with rebound-compression damping and spring preload adjustment', 'Progressive, single shock absorber with rebound compression damping and spring preload', 'Double disc', 'Single disc', NULL, '120/70-ZR17', '190/55-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 998, 4, 4, 174, 11900, 111, 10000, '13:1', 76, 55, 'Liquid', 'Injection. “Weber Marelli” 5SM ignition - injection integrated system; induction discharge electronic ignition', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 302, NULL, NULL, 2007, 685, NULL, NULL, NULL, 130, 192, 192, 21),
(1793, 'mv-agusta-f4-1000-rr-2015', 'SPORT', 'The top-of-the-range F4 RR contains unparalleled engineering solutions and thoroughbred excellence, ensuring total bike control and heart-stopping performance: an inertial control platform with lean angle sensor, a redefined riding position, full Ride-By-Wire, Öhlins electronic suspension and steering damper as well as GP-spec titanium con rods', 'CrMo Steel Tubular Trellis. Aluminium alloy adjustable swingarm pivot height', 'Öhlins EC Nix hydraulic “UPSIDE DOWN” front forks with TiN superficial treatment. Completely adjustable electronically controlled compression and rebound', 'Progressive, single shock absorber Öhlins TTX. Fully adjustable hydraulic electronically controlled compression and rebound damping with manual, spring preload', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating disc. Brembo GP radial-type, single-piece with 4 pistons Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS, four-piston Disco de 210 mm (8.3 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '200/55-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 998, 4, 4, 200.8, 13600, 111, 9600, '13.4:1', 79, 50.9, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Weber Marelli 5SM ignition - injection integrated system; induction discharge electronic ignition', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 298, NULL, NULL, 2115, 750, NULL, 1430, 830, 115, 190, 190, 17),
