(2057, 'suzuki-burgman-650-executive-650-2014', 'SCOOTER', 'The ultimate two-wheeled, zero fuss luxurious method of two-wheeled transport perfectly describes the Burgman 650 ABS Executive. Combining advanced motorcycle design within the performance scooter concept has resulted in this exciting form of powered two-wheeler. Offering a new level of scooter comfort, weather protection and ease of use with big bike power, handling and ABS braking, our Executive model raises the bar for two wheeled personal transport', NULL, 'Telescopic, coil spring, oil damped', 'Swingarm type, coil spring, oil damped', 'Double disc. ABS', 'Single disc. ABS', 'ABS', '120/70-R15', '160/60-R14', 'Twin, four-stroke', 638, 2, NULL, 54, NULL, NULL, NULL, '11.2:1', 75.5, 71.3, 'Liquid', 'Injection', 'Automatic', NULL, 'Belt', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2260, 810, 1435, NULL, NULL, NULL, 277, 277, 15),
