(2106, 'suzuki-dl-650-v-strom-2021', 'ADVENTURE', 'The 2020 V-Strom 650 continues the V-Strom family tradition of being a fun and logical motorcycle to buy and ride. The engine delivers stellar performance and great fuel economy while achieving worldwide emission standards', 'Twin-spar aluminum-alloy', 'Telescopic, coil spring, oil damped (curso 150 mm (5.9 inches))', 'Link type, single shock, coil spring, oil damped (curso 160 mm (6.3 inches))', 'Double disc. Tokico 2-piston calipers. ABS Disco de 310 mm (12.2 inches)', 'Single disc. Nissin, 1-piston.ABS Disco de 260 mm (10.2 inches)', 'ABS', '110/80-19', '150/70-17', 'V2, four-stroke', 645, 2, NULL, 71, 8800, 69, 6300, '11.2:1', 81, 62.6, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Ten-hole, long-nose-type fuel injectors on each 39 mm throttle body', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 185, 3.5, NULL, 2275, 839, 1405, 1560, 835, 170, 213, 213, 20.1),
(2107, 'suzuki-dl-650-v-strom-2017', 'ADVENTURE', 'Updated, 645cc, 90-degree V-Twin engine features a boost in torque in the low to mid-RPM range, but retains a strong rush of high RPM power that’s ideal for any riding mission', 'Twin-spar aluminum-alloy frame', 'Telescopic, coil spring, oil damped (curso 150 mm (5.9 inches))', 'Link type, coil spring, oil damped (curso 160 mm (6.3 inches))', 'Double disc. Tokico 2-piston calipers Disco de 310 mm (12.2 inches)', 'Single disc. Nissin, 1-piston Disco de 260 mm (10.2 inches)', NULL, '110/80-19', '150/70-17', 'V2, four-stroke', 645, 2, NULL, 69, 8000, 69, 6400, '11.2:1', 81, 62.6, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 185, NULL, NULL, 2275, NULL, NULL, 1560, 830, 175, 213, 213, 20.1),
(2108, 'suzuki-dl-650-v-strom-2012', 'ADVENTURE', 'For 2012, Suzuki is introducing the new and improved V-Strom 650 ABS. The development concept for the 2012 model was ´The Comfortable Adventure Tourer´. While enhancing the proven running performance and in-town versatility of the current model, Suzuki improved the riding comfort even further on the 2012 V-Strom', 'Aluminum twin-spar frame and aluminum swingarm', 'Telescopic, coil spring, oil damped', 'Link type, coil spring, oil damped', 'Double disc. ABS Disco de 310 mm (12.2 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS Disco de 260 mm (10.2 inches)', 'ABS', '110/80-R19', '150/70-R17', 'V2, four-stroke', 645, 2, 4, 65.7, 8000, NULL, NULL, '11.3:1', 81, 62.6, 'Oil & air', 'Injection. Suzuki fuel injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2290, 840, NULL, 1555, 820, 165, 220, NULL, 22),
(2109, 'suzuki-dl-650-v-strom-adventure-2021', 'ADVENTURE', 'Unique to the V-Strom 650XA are the knuckle covers to support harsh condition riding, and the engine under cowling to give the rider that extra adventure feel, both as standard equipment. Adventure Kit includes Aluminum side cases, mounting brackets, mirror extensions, handlebar brace and bar end weights', 'Aluminum twin-spar', 'Telescopic, coil spring, oil damped', 'Link type, coil spring, oil damped', 'Double disc. ABS. Tokico 2-piston calipers Disco de 310 mm (12.2 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Nissin, 1-piston Disco de 260 mm (10.2 inches)', 'ABS', '110/80-R19', '150/70-R17', 'V2, four-stroke', 645, 2, 4, 70, 8800, 69, 6300, '11.2:1', 81, 62.6, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Suzuki Dual Throttle Valve', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 185, 3.5, 'Euro 4', 2275, 910, 1405, 1560, 835, 170, 216, NULL, 20),
(2110, 'suzuki-dl-650-v-strom-adventure-2024', 'ADVENTURE', 'Renowned for versatility, reliability, and value, Suzuki’s V-Strom 650 models attract riders who use their motorcycles for touring, commuting, or a fun ride when the spirit moves them', 'Twin-spar, aluminum', 'Telescopic, coil spring, oil damped', 'Link type, coil spring, oil damped', 'Double disc. ABS. Tokico 2-piston calipers Disco de 310 mm (12.2 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Nissin, 1-piston Disco de 260 mm (10.2 inches)', 'ABS', '110/80-R19', '150/70-R17', 'V2, four-stroke', 645, 2, 4, 69, NULL, 69, NULL, '11.2:1', 81, 62.6, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Ten-hole, long-nose-type fuel injectors on each throttle body', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 185, NULL, NULL, 2275, 910, 1405, 1560, 835, 170, 216, NULL, 20),
(2111, 'suzuki-dl-650-v-strom-adventure-2025', 'ADVENTURE', 'The beak-style fairing, with vertically stacked headlights and a new mounting structure, helps the V-Strom 650/XT cut through the wind and protect the rider in style. The three-way height-adjustable windscreen was wind tunnel tested to reduce wind noise, buffeting, and rider fatigue', 'Twin-spar, aluminum', 'Telescopic, coil spring, oil damped', 'Link type, coil spring, oil damped', 'Double disc. ABS. Tokico 2-piston calipers Disco de 310 mm (12.2 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Nissin, 1-piston Disco de 260 mm (10.2 inches)', 'ABS', '110/80-R19', '150/70-R17', 'V2, four-stroke', 645, 2, 4, 69, NULL, 69, NULL, '11.2:1', 81, 62.6, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Ten-hole, long-nose-type fuel injectors on each throttle body', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 185, NULL, NULL, 2275, 910, 1405, 1560, 835, 170, 216, NULL, 20),
(2112, 'suzuki-dl-650-v-strom-adventure-2022', 'ADVENTURE', 'Point the iconic DR-BIG beak of the V-Strom at the horizon as the 37L quick-release aluminum panniers, rugged accessory bar, handlebar cross-brace, and mirror extensions are standard equipment. Finished with deep, Glass Sparkle Black paint, the 2022 V-Strom 650XT Adventure rolls out on tubeless-spoke wheels with blue-anodized rims that are sized right for the mission', 'Twin-spar, aluminum', 'Telescopic, coil spring, oil damped', 'Link type, coil spring, oil damped', 'Double disc. ABS. Tokico 2-piston calipers Disco de 310 mm (12.2 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Nissin, 1-piston Disco de 260 mm (10.2 inches)', 'ABS', '110/80-R19', '150/70-R17', 'V2, four-stroke', 645, 2, 4, 69, 8000, 69, 6400, '11.2:1', 81, 62.6, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Ten-hole, long-nose-type fuel injectors on each throttle body', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', 185, NULL, NULL, 2275, 910, 1405, 1560, 835, 170, 239, NULL, 20),
