(2268, 'suzuki-gsx-8s-2025', 'NAKED', 'Designed to excite riders who value agility, power, and bold styling, the 2025 Suzuki GSX-8S is the latest addition to Suzuki’s renowned GSX-S series. This mid-size naked street bike packs a responsive 776cc DOHC parallel-twin engine with 270-degree crankshaft timing, ensuring a smooth, torque-rich ride. Enhanced by Suzuki’s Cross Balancer technology, the GSX-8S delivers the punch and precision riders demand', 'Steel', 'KYB inverted front forks (curso 130 mm (5.1 inches))', 'Adjustable KYB link-type (curso 130 mm (5.1 inches))', 'Double disc. ABS Disco de 310 mm (12.2 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS Disco de 240 mm (9.4 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '180/55-ZR17', 'Twin, four-stroke', 776, 2, 4, NULL, NULL, 78, NULL, '12.8:1', 84, 70, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, 3.5, NULL, 2115, 775, 1105, 1465, 810, 145, 202, NULL, 14),
