(2331, 'suzuki-gsx-s-1000-2016', 'SPORT', 'Born on the racetrack and raised on the street, the 2016 GSX-S1000 is derived from the legendary, championship-winning 2005-2008 gen GSX-R1000. The new GSX-S lineup carries the spirit of the Suzuki GSX-R to the street, with shared technology and components packaged into a chassis designed specifically for street riding comfort', 'Aluminum', 'KYB inverted telescopic, coil spring, oil damped', 'Showa link type, coil spring, oil damped', 'Double disc Disco de 310 mm (12.2 inches)', 'Single disc', NULL, '120/70-ZR17', '190/50-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 999, 4, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '12.2:1', 74.5, 57.3, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2115, 795, NULL, 1460, 810, 140, 207, 207, 17),
(2332, 'suzuki-gsx-s-1000-2018', 'SPORT', 'Equipped with a powerful engine, Suzuki’s Advanced Traction Control System, a balanced KYB suspension, and Brembo brakes, the GSX-S1000 is a street bike packed with some serious performance', 'Aluminum', 'Inverted telescopic, coil spring, oil damped', 'Link type, single shock, coil spring, oil damped', 'Double disc. Brembo 4-piston Disco de 310 mm (12.2 inches)', 'Single disc', NULL, '120/70-ZR17', '190/50-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 999, 4, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '12.2:1', 74.5, 57.3, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2115, 795, NULL, 1460, 810, 140, 207, 207, 17),
(2333, 'suzuki-gsx-s-1000-2025', 'NAKED', 'The 2025 Suzuki GSX-S1000 delivers unrelenting power and street-dominating style, continuing its legacy as the benchmark in naked sportbikes. NEW for 2025, the GSX-S1000 gains a 5-inch full-color TFT display. Its GSX-R1000-based, long-stroke engine provides thrilling acceleration and a broad torque curve', 'Twin-spar aluminum', 'Inverted telescopic, coil spring, oil damped (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Link type, single shock, coil spring, oil damped', 'Double disc. Brembo 4-piston, ABS Disco de 310 mm (12.2 inches)', 'Single disc. Nissin, 1-piston, single disc, ABS Disco de 240 mm (9.4 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/50-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 999, 4, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '12.2:1', 73.4, 59, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Ride-by-Wire electronic throttle bodies', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2115, 810, 1080, 1460, 810, 140, 214, 214, 19),
(2334, 'suzuki-gsx-s-1000-2023', 'SPORT', 'The 2023 GSX-S1000 establishes the performance standard for naked sportbikes by providing superb controllability, agility, and power for an exciting and rewarding riding experience, while complying with worldwide emissions standards. A long-stroke GSX-R1000 engine and nimble chassis combine with sharp, angular styling that hone the GSX-S1000 into an even tighter and more striking package that is ready to turn heads and own the streets', 'Twin-spar aluminum', 'Inverted telescopic, coil spring, oil damped (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Link type, single shock, coil spring, oil damped', 'Double disc. Brembo 4-piston, ABS Disco de 310 mm (12.2 inches)', 'Single disc. Nissin, 1-piston, single disc, ABS Disco de 240 mm (9.4 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/50-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 999, 4, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '12.2:1', 73.4, 59, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Ride-by-Wire electronic throttle bodies', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2115, 810, 1080, 1460, 810, 140, 214, 214, 19),
