(2340, 'suzuki-gsx-s-1000-2019', 'SPORT', 'Get a grip on a whole new standard. Striking looks. Comfort. Power. Versatility. Our standards deliver easy ergonomics, modern style, and metro muscle in dynamite packages. Whatever type of riding you prefer, our standards can handle it', 'Aluminum', 'Inverted telescopic, coil spring, oil damped (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Link type, single shock, coil spring, oil damped (curso 130 mm (5.1 inches))', 'Double disc. Brembo 4-piston, ABS Disco de 310 mm (12.2 inches)', 'Single disc. Nissin, 1-piston, single disc, ABS Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/50-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 999, 4, 4, 150, 10000, 108, 9500, '12.2:1', 73.4, 59, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2115, 795, 1080, 1460, 810, 140, 210, 210, 17),
(2341, 'suzuki-gsx-s-1000-f-2016', 'SPORT', 'Born on the racetrack and raised on the street, the 2016 GSX-S1000 is derived from the legendary, championship-winning 2005-2008 gen GSX-R1000. The new GSX-S lineup carries the spirit of the Suzuki GSX-R to the street, with shared technology and components packaged into a chassis designed specifically for street riding comfort', 'Aluminum', 'KYB inverted telescopic, coil spring, oil damped', 'Showa link type, coil spring, oil damped', 'Double disc Disco de 310 mm (12.2 inches)', 'Single disc', NULL, '120/70-ZR17', '190/50-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 999, 4, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '12.2:1', 74.5, 57.3, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2115, 795, NULL, 1460, 810, 140, 207, 207, 17),
