(2343, 'suzuki-gsx-s-1000-f-2018', 'SPORT', 'Equipped with a powerful engine, Suzuki’s Advanced Traction Control System, a balanced KYB suspension, and Brembo brakes, the GSX-S1000 is a street bike packed with some serious performance', 'Aluminum', 'Inverted telescopic, coil spring, oil damped', 'Link type, single shock, coil spring, oil damped', 'Double disc. Brembo 4-piston Disco de 310 mm (12.2 inches)', 'Single disc', NULL, '120/70-ZR17', '190/50-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 999, 4, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '12.2:1', 74.5, 57.3, 'Liquid', 'Injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2115, 795, NULL, 1460, 810, 140, 207, 207, 17),
(2344, 'suzuki-gsx-s-1000-f-2020', 'SPORT', 'Developed using the attributes of the championship-winning, long-stroke GSX-R1000 engine, this naked sportbike carries Suzuki’s performance spirit to every ride. The GSX-R connection does not stop there, as the GSX-S1000 shares other chassis technology and components so this bike can carve up the corners while providing all-day riding comfort', 'Twin-spar aluminum', 'KYB inverted telescopic, coil spring, oil damped (curso 120 mm (4.7 inches))', 'Link type, single shock, coil spring, oil damped', 'Double disc. Brembo 4-piston, ABS Disco de 310 mm (12.2 inches)', 'Single disc. Nissin, 1-piston, single disc, ABS Disco de 240 mm (9.4 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '190/50-ZR17', 'In-line four, four-stroke', 999, 4, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '12.2:1', 73.4, 59, 'Liquid', 'Injection. 10-hole injectors on each 44mm throttle body', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2115, 795, 1080, 1460, 815, 140, 209, 209, 17),
