(2489, 'triumph-daytona-675i-2008', 'SPORT', 'As the first three-cylinder super sports middleweight, the Daytona 675 is a force to be reckoned with in the most hotly contested arena in motorcycling. The Daytona 675 has won countless comparison tests and for the past two years has taken both the MasterBike and Supertest ‘King of the Supersport’ crowns', 'Aluminum beam twin spar', '41mm USD forks with adjustable preload. rebound and compression damping', 'Monoshock with piggy back reservoir adjustable for preload. rebound and compression damping', 'Double disc Disco de 308 mm (12.1 inches)', 'Single disc Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', NULL, '120/70-ZR17', '180/55-ZR17', 'In-line three, four-stroke', 675, 3, NULL, 125, 12500, 72, 11750, '12.7:1', 74, 52.3, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Multipoint sequential electronic fuel injection with forced air induction', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2010, 710, 1109, 1392, 825, NULL, 164.7, 164.7, 17.4),
(2490, 'triumph-daytona-675i-2014', 'SPORT', 'Apex after apex the new Daytona 675 inspires complete confidence. More power, lighter weight, and easier to ride, our engineers ambition was simple: to create the most perfectly balanced motorcycle. An equal blend of torque, responsiveness, agility, poise and purpose. The result is a bike with class-defining power, performance and handling. A bike that will inspire total confidence. And looks every bit as good', 'Aluminium beam twin spar. Braced, twin-sided, aluminium alloy with adjustable pivot position swing arm', 'KYB 41mm upside down forks with adjustable preload, rebound and high/low speed compression damping, 110mm travel', 'KYB monoshock with piggy back reservoir adjustable for preload, rebound and high/low speed compression damping, 130mm rear wheel travel', 'Double disc. Nissin 4-piston radial mono-block calipers. Switchable ABS Disco de 308 mm (12.1 inches)', 'Single disc. Nissin single piston caliper. Switchable ABS Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '180/55-ZR17', 'In-line three, four-stroke', 675, 3, 4, 128, 12500, 74, 11900, '12.7:1', 76, 49.6, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Multipoint sequential electronic fuel injection with forced air induction and SAI', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2020, 710, 1105, 1395, 830, NULL, 184, NULL, 17.4),
(2491, 'triumph-daytona-675i-2006', 'SPORT', 'Inimitable, spine-tingling sound and feel incredible performance with its exciting, powerful engine and intuitive, razor-sharp chassis. Very few motorcycles can be seen as mold-breaking but the Daytona 675 Triple is definitely one of them', 'Aluminum beam twin spar', '41mm USD forks with adjustable preload. rebound and compression damping', 'Monoshock with piggy back reservoir adjustable for preload. rebound and compression damping', 'Double disc Disco de 308 mm (12.1 inches)', 'Single disc Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', NULL, '120/70-ZR17', '180/55-ZR17', 'In-line three, four-stroke', 675, 3, NULL, 125, 12500, 72, 11750, '12.7:1', 74, 52.3, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Multipoint sequential electronic fuel injection with forced air induction', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2010, 673, 1109, 1392, 825, NULL, NULL, NULL, 17.4),
(2492, 'triumph-daytona-675i-2007', 'SPORT', 'If the Daytona 675’s unique DNA is a large part of its appeal, its stunning performance is the winning flourish', 'Aluminum beam twin spar', '41mm USD forks with adjustable preload. rebound and compression damping', 'Monoshock with piggy back reservoir adjustable for preload. rebound and compression damping', 'Double disc Disco de 308 mm (12.1 inches)', 'Single disc Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', NULL, '120/70-ZR17', '180/55-ZR17', 'In-line three, four-stroke', 675, 3, NULL, 125, 12500, 72, 11750, '12.7:1', 74, 52.3, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Multipoint sequential electronic fuel injection with forced air induction', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2010, 710, 1109, 1392, 825, NULL, 164.7, 164.7, 17.4),
(2493, 'triumph-daytona-675i-2010', 'SPORT', 'The best supersport bike in the world or a class of its own? Designed for the racetrack, to compete with the best in the supersport class, Triumph’s Daytona 675 is the bike to beat on both road and track', 'Aluminium beam twin spar. Swingarm: braced, twin-sided, aluminium alloy with adjustable pivot position', 'Kayaba 41mm upside down forks with adjustable preload, rebound and high/low speed compression damping (curso 130 mm (5.1 inches))', 'Kayaba monoshock with piggy back reservoir adjustable for preload, rebound and high/low speed comporession damping (curso 130 mm (5.1 inches))', 'Double disc. Nissin 4-piston radial mono-block calipers Disco de 308 mm (12.1 inches)', 'Single disc. Nissin single piston caliper Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', NULL, '120/70-ZR17', '180/55-ZR17', 'In-line three, four-stroke', 675, 3, 4, 126.1, 12600, 75, 11750, '12.7:1', 74, 52.3, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Multipoint sequential electronic fuel injection with forced air induction', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2010, 700, 1120, 1395, 825, NULL, 184, 162, 17.4),
(2494, 'triumph-daytona-675i-2015', 'SPORT', 'With twin injectors per cylinder the new Daytona can draw more fuel quicker when you open the throttle fully and demand more from the engine', 'Aluminium beam twin spar. Braced, twin-sided, aluminium alloy with adjustable pivot position swing arm', 'Kayaba 41mm upside down forks with adjustable preload, rebound and high/low speed compression damping (curso 110 mm (4.3 inches))', 'Kayaba monoshock with piggy back reservoir adjustable for preload, rebound and high/low speed compression damping (curso 130 mm (5.1 inches))', 'Double disc. Nissin 4-piston radial mono-block calipers. Switchable ABS Disco de 308 mm (12.1 inches)', 'Single disc. Nissin single piston caliper. Switchable ABS Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', 'ABS', '120/70-ZR17', '180/55-ZR17', 'In-line three, four-stroke', 675, 3, 4, 128, 12500, 74, 11900, '12.7:1', 76, 49.6, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Multipoint sequential electronic fuel injection with forced air induction and SAI', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2020, 710, 1105, 1395, 830, NULL, 187, 167, 17.4),
