(2538, 'triumph-speed-triple-1050i-2007', 'NAKED', 'The first streetfighter bikes were home brewed, they came out of the back streets, stripped down, deconstructed - the complete opposite of ‘pretty’ factory bikes. The very first Speed Triple grew up at the factory in the same way as those raw, unfaired machines', 'Tubular. fabricated aluminum alloy perimeter', '43mm USD forks with dual rate springs and adjustable preload. rebound and compression damping', 'Monoshock with adjustable preload. compression and rebound damping', 'Double disc Disco de 320 mm (12.6 inches)', 'Single disc Disco de 220 mm (8.7 inches)', NULL, '120/70-ZR17', '180/55-ZR17', 'In-line three, four-stroke', 1050, 3, NULL, 132, 9250, 105, 7550, '12:1', 79, 71.4, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Multipoint sequential electronic fuel injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2115, 780, 1250, 1429, 815, NULL, 188.7, 188.7, 17.8),
