(2680, 'triumph-tiger-800-2014', 'ADVENTURE', 'The backbone of the Tiger 800´s chassis is its tubular steel trellis frame recognisable by the twin tubes running down each side of the engine. And we made the girder-like rear subframe super strong to cope with heavy touring loads. The engine is important here too, engineered as a fully stressed and crucial component of the chassis, adding strength so the frame can be lighter for better agility', 'Tubular steel trellis frame', 'Showa 43mm upside down forks, 180mm travel', 'Showa monoshock with hydraulically adjustable preload, 170mm rear wheel travel', 'Double disc. ABS. Floating discs, Nissin 2-piston floating calipers, Optional ABS Disco de 308 mm (12.1 inches)', 'Single disc. ABS. Nissin single piston floating caliper, Optional ABS', 'ABS', '100/90-ZR19', '150/70-ZR17', 'In-line three, four-stroke', 800, 3, 4, 95, 9300, 79, 7850, NULL, 74, 61.9, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Multipoint sequential electronic fuel injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, 5.74, NULL, 2215, 795, 1350, 1530, 810, NULL, 210, NULL, 19),
(2681, 'triumph-tiger-800-sport-2025', 'ADVENTURE', 'Built for riders who crave both thrilling performance and long-distance comfort. Whether you´re breaking free from the daily grind or chasing new horizons, the All-new Tiger Sport 800 delivers pure exhilaration and instant escape with every ride', 'Tubular steel trellis frame', 'WP 43mm upside down forks, adjustable rebound and compression DAMPING - See more at: http://www.triumphmotorcycles.com/bikes/tiger/2015/tiger-800-xc#engine', 'WP monoshock with remote oil reservoir, hydraulically adjustable preload, rebound damping adjustment - See more at:', 'Double disc. Floating discs, Nissin 2-piston sliding calipers, Switchable ABS Disco de 308 mm (12.1 inches)', 'Single disc. Nissin single piston sliding caliper, Switchable ABS Disco de 255 mm (10.0 inches)', 'ABS', '90/90-21', '150/70-17', 'In-line three, four-stroke', 798, 3, 4, 113, NULL, 94.9, NULL, NULL, 74, 61.9, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Multipoint sequential electronic fuel injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, 5.74, NULL, 2215, 865, 1390, 1442, 845, NULL, 213.6, 193, 18.6),
(2682, 'triumph-tiger-800-sport-2026', 'ADVENTURE', 'Built for riders who crave both thrilling performance and long-distance comfort. Whether you´re breaking free from the daily grind or chasing new horizons, the All-new Tiger Sport 800 delivers pure exhilaration and instant escape with every ride', 'Tubular steel trellis frame', 'WP 43mm upside down forks, adjustable rebound and compression DAMPING - See more at: http://www.triumphmotorcycles.com/bikes/tiger/2015/tiger-800-xc#engine', 'WP monoshock with remote oil reservoir, hydraulically adjustable preload, rebound damping adjustment - See more at:', 'Double disc. Floating discs, Nissin 2-piston sliding calipers, Switchable ABS Disco de 308 mm (12.1 inches)', 'Single disc. Nissin single piston sliding caliper, Switchable ABS Disco de 255 mm (10.0 inches)', 'ABS', '90/90-21', '150/70-17', 'In-line three, four-stroke', 798, 3, 4, 113, NULL, 94.9, NULL, NULL, 74, 61.9, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Multipoint sequential electronic fuel injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, 5.74, NULL, 2215, 865, 1390, 1442, 845, NULL, 213.6, 193, 18.6),
(2683, 'triumph-tiger-800-xc-2014', 'ADVENTURE', 'The three-cylinder engine is the same 800cc triple found in the Tiger 800 so it’s got loads of torque and muscular power. And the tough steel frame and long distance fuel range are from the Tiger 800 too. The added XC is what gives you the next-level off-road ability', 'Tubular steel trellis frame', 'Showa 43mm upside down forks, 180mm travel', 'Showa monoshock with hydraulically adjustable preload, 170mm rear wheel travel', 'Double disc. Floating discs, Nissin 2-piston sliding calipers, Switchable ABS Disco de 308 mm (12.1 inches)', 'Single disc. Nissin single piston sliding caliper, Switchable ABS Disco de 255 mm (10.0 inches)', 'ABS', '90/90-21', '150/70-17', 'In-line three, four-stroke', 799, 3, 4, 95, 9300, 79, 7850, NULL, 74, 61.9, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Multipoint sequential electronic fuel injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, 5.74, NULL, 2215, 865, 1390, 1545, 845, NULL, 215, NULL, 19),
(2684, 'triumph-tiger-800-xc-2015', 'ADVENTURE', 'The suspension travel for the Tiger 800XC is a huge 220mm at the front, 215mm at the rear. Just what you need on poor condition trails. We fitted 45mm Showa upside down forks along with a preload and rebound adjustable Showa monoshock so you can adjust for either off or on-road riding', 'Tubular steel trellis frame', 'Showa 43mm upside down forks, (curso 220 mm (8.7 inches))', 'Showa monoshock with hydraulically adjustable preload (curso 215 mm (8.5 inches))', 'Double disc. Floating discs, Nissin 2-piston sliding calipers, Switchable ABS Disco de 308 mm (12.1 inches)', 'Single disc. Nissin single piston sliding caliper, Switchable ABS Disco de 255 mm (10.0 inches)', 'ABS', '90/90-21', '150/70-17', 'In-line three, four-stroke', 799, 3, 4, 95, 9300, 79, 7850, NULL, 74, 61.9, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Multipoint sequential electronic fuel injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, 5.74, NULL, 2215, 865, 1390, 1545, 845, NULL, 215, 190, 19),
