(2688, 'triumph-tiger-800-xca-2016', 'ADVENTURE', 'Equipped with traction control, switchable ABS, 3 Rider Modes, and a second generation 95PS 800cc triple engine with a seamless flow of torque, the Tiger 800 XCA goes further still. Standard equipment includes heated rider and passenger seats, heated grips, LED fog lamps, and an uprated 650W alternator complete with 3 auxiliary sockets that can power everything you need from heated clothing to GPS systems. It also features aluminium pannier rails making it ready to tour with the optional Expedition luggage set', 'Tubular steel trellis. Twin-­sided, cast aluminium alloy swingarm', 'Showa 43mm upside down forks (curso 220 mm (8.7 inches))', 'Showa monoshock with hydraulically adjustable preload, (curso 215 mm (8.5 inches))', 'Double disc. Floating discs, Nissin 2-piston sliding calipers, Switchable ABS Disco de 308 mm (12.1 inches)', 'Single disc. Nissin single piston sliding caliper, Switchable ABS Disco de 255 mm (10.0 inches)', 'ABS', '90/90-21', '150/70-17', 'In-line three, four-stroke', 799, 3, 4, 95, 9300, 79, 7850, '11.3:1', 74, 61.9, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Multipoint sequential electronic fuel injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, 5.74, NULL, 2215, 845, 1390, 1545, 840, NULL, 203, 203, 19),
(2689, 'triumph-tiger-800-xca-2018', 'ADVENTURE', 'With the exhilarating all-new top spec Tiger 800 XCA your adventure literally starts here with a bike that’s now as great off road as it always was on', 'Tubular steel trellis. Twin-­sided, cast aluminium alloy swingarm', 'WP 1.69 in (43 mm) upside down forks, with adjustable rebound and compression damping (curso 220 mm (8.7 inches))', 'WP monoshock with remote oil reservoir, hydraulically adjustable preload (curso 215 mm (8.5 inches))', 'Double disc. Floating discs, Brembo 2-piston sliding calipers, Switchable ABS Disco de 308 mm (12.1 inches)', 'Single disc. Nissin single piston sliding caliper, Switchable ABS Disco de 255 mm (10.0 inches)', 'ABS', '90/90-21', '150/70-R17', 'In-line three, four-stroke', 799, 3, 4, 95, 9300, 79, 7850, '11.3:1', 74, 61.9, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Multipoint sequential electronic fuel injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, 5.74, NULL, 2215, 845, 1390, 1545, 840, NULL, 208, 208, 19),
(2690, 'triumph-tiger-800-xca-2019', 'ADVENTURE', 'The supremely off-road focused Tiger 800 XCA is equipped with all-LED lighting, full colour TFT instruments, switchable traction control and ABS, six riding modes including new ‘Off-Road Pro’, and a new generation 95PS 800cc Triple engine with a lower ratio first gear for a seamless flow of torque lower-down and even better acceleration', 'Tubular steel trellis. Twin-­sided, cast aluminium alloy swingarm', 'WP 1.69 in (43 mm) upside down forks, with adjustable rebound and compression damping (curso 220 mm (8.7 inches))', 'WP monoshock with remote oil reservoir, hydraulically adjustable preload (curso 215 mm (8.5 inches))', 'Double disc. Floating discs, Brembo 2-piston sliding calipers, Switchable ABS Disco de 305 mm (12.0 inches)', 'Single disc. Nissin single piston sliding caliper, Switchable ABS Disco de 255 mm (10.0 inches)', 'ABS', '90/90-21', '150/70-R17', 'In-line three, four-stroke', 800, 3, 4, 95, 9500, 79, 8050, '11.3:1', 74.1, 61.9, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Multipoint sequential electronic fuel injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, 5.74, NULL, 2215, 805, 1390, 1545, 840, NULL, 208, 208, 19),
