(2692, 'triumph-tiger-800-xca-2017', 'ADVENTURE', 'The finely honed handling and ride are everything you would expect from a Triumph. The suspension features 43mm WP USD forks that have 220mm of front wheel travel and come with adjustable rebound and compression damping', 'Tubular steel trellis. Twin-­sided, cast aluminium alloy swingarm', 'Showa 43mm upside down forks (curso 220 mm (8.7 inches))', 'Showa monoshock with hydraulically adjustable preload, (curso 215 mm (8.5 inches))', 'Double disc. Floating discs, Nissin 2-piston sliding calipers, Switchable ABS Disco de 308 mm (12.1 inches)', 'Single disc. Nissin single piston sliding caliper, Switchable ABS Disco de 255 mm (10.0 inches)', 'ABS', '90/90-21', '150/70-17', 'In-line three, four-stroke', 799, 3, 4, 95, 9300, 79, 7850, '11.3:1', 74, 61.9, 'Liquid', 'Injection. Multipoint sequential electronic fuel injection', '6-speed', 6, 'Chain', NULL, 5.74, NULL, 2215, 845, 1390, 1545, 840, NULL, 215, 203, 19),
